:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commits/671b49755953bf329a90076af60e4c596f400f41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:41:33Z","email":"kuatbek@doublefin.com","name":"Quatbek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:41:33Z","email":"kuatbek@doublefin.com","name":"Quatbek"},"message":"Eliminate zip duplication: create-orca-sub-app delegates to build-orca-sub-app\n\nThe zip creation script was duplicated across both skill files, meaning\nevery bug fix had to be applied twice (and PR #18 missed build-orca-sub-app\nentirely, which is how the backslash regression went unnoticed).\n\nChanges:\n- build-orca-sub-app: split old Step 2 (install+build+serve) into\n  Step 2 (install+build) and Step 4 (serve), making the zip Step 3.\n  Steps 1-3 now form a self-contained install/build/zip sequence that\n  callers can follow without starting the production bundle server.\n- create-orca-sub-app: replace duplicate Steps 4+5 (install+build, zip)\n  with a single delegation step that fetches and follows build-orca-sub-app\n  Steps 1-3 only, mirroring how the scaffold skill is called in Step 3.\n  Steps 6-7 renumbered to 5-6; troubleshooting reference updated.\n\nThe zip script now lives exclusively in build-orca-sub-app Step 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6815e7f5ea7e325251c0847faffea18305ee15c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/git/trees/6815e7f5ea7e325251c0847faffea18305ee15c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/git/commits/671b49755953bf329a90076af60e4c596f400f41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250924067?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Quat7","id":250924067,"login":"Quat7","node_id":"U_kgDODvTMIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commit/671b49755953bf329a90076af60e4c596f400f41","node_id":"C_kwDOTEBHJtoAKDY3MWI0OTc1NTk1M2JmMzI5YTkwMDc2YWY2MGU0YzU5NmY0MDBmNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commit/f61f4e656ce5644329039ec18a88d3ab9db68eb9","sha":"f61f4e656ce5644329039ec18a88d3ab9db68eb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commits/f61f4e656ce5644329039ec18a88d3ab9db68eb9"}],"sha":"671b49755953bf329a90076af60e4c596f400f41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commits/671b49755953bf329a90076af60e4c596f400f41"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250924067?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Quat7","id":250924067,"login":"Quat7","node_id":"U_kgDODvTMIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commits/f61f4e656ce5644329039ec18a88d3ab9db68eb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:30:38Z","email":"kuatbek@doublefin.com","name":"Quatbek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:30:38Z","email":"kuatbek@doublefin.com","name":"Quatbek"},"message":"Fix Windows zip still producing backslash paths and including dist\n\nThe previous ZipArchive fix had two fragility issues that could still\ncause the old Compress-Archive behaviour to leak through or produce\nwrong output:\n\n1. Used `[char]92` as the separator constant, relying on implicit\n   .NET Framework type coercion for both `.Split()` and `.Replace()`.\n   PS 5.1 on .NET 4.x has no `String.Replace(char, char)` overload;\n   only `Replace(string, string)` works reliably. Replaced with\n   `-split ''\\''` (PS regex operator) and `.Replace(''\\'', ''/'')` (string\n   literals) which are unambiguous in all PS 5.1 environments.\n\n2. Wrote the output zip to `$appDir\\{{APP_NAME}}.zip` — inside the\n   source tree — before the file list was fully computed. Although\n   `$files` was populated before `ZipFile::Open`, lazy pipeline\n   semantics in some PS versions could include the partial zip itself.\n   Fixed by writing to a randomised `$env:TEMP` path and moving it to\n   the final destination only after `Dispose()` completes.\n\nAlso adds `--exclude ''*/.mf/*''` to both Mac/Linux blocks (the\nmodule-federation cache directory was never excluded) and aligns the\nbuild-orca-sub-app Windows block to use the same pattern as\ncreate-orca-sub-app (replacing the robocopy staging approach with a\nsingle Get-ChildItem pass).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"240f27fcda1164756aa0db8d25148c3f607d013e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/git/trees/240f27fcda1164756aa0db8d25148c3f607d013e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/git/commits/f61f4e656ce5644329039ec18a88d3ab9db68eb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250924067?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Quat7","id":250924067,"login":"Quat7","node_id":"U_kgDODvTMIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quat7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commit/f61f4e656ce5644329039ec18a88d3ab9db68eb9","node_id":"C_kwDOTEBHJtoAKGY2MWY0ZTY1NmNlNTY0NDMyOTAzOWVjMThhODhkM2FiOWRiNjhlYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/visdomtech/orca-react-sub-app-template/commit/f464ba0f432addb3c107fdb8998884340e6e6968","sha":"f464ba0f432addb3c107fdb8998884340e6e6968","url":"h