T15:24:32Z","email":"dungbachngoc20@gmail.com","name":"ngocdung12112000"},"message":"Initial commit: E-Commerce Micro-Frontend platform\n\n- Webpack Module Federation monorepo (pnpm workspaces)\n- Shell (host :3000) + 4 remote MFEs: Products :3001, Orders :3002, Account :3003, Checkout :3004\n- shared-ui: Button, Card, Header, Badge\n- shared-state: cartStore, authStore, orderStore (window singleton pattern)\n- Communication: Custom Events + URL State + Shared Store (3 mechanisms)\n- React ErrorBoundary for remote load failures\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab9e2aca055e31d87071453d533b091f492e09ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngocdung12112000/micro-FE/git/trees/ab9e2aca055e31d87071453d533b091f492e09ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngocdung12112000/micro-FE/git/commits/818a766d6a82a1195f4f40f27b5c98c054926aed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60036722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ngocdung12112000","id":60036722,"login":"ngocdung12112000","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDM2NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112000/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ngocdung12112