6-06-23T17:08:11Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T17:08:11Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(contabilidad): importacion de extractos bancarios CSV/XLSX con dedup (PR F)\n\nSube extractos por sociedad/cuenta/mes/anio, normaliza en movimientos_bancarios\ny deduplica. Solo importa y normaliza: no concilia, no toca facturas/pagos/Drive/\nOCR/Gmail. Extiende la infraestructura existente (parsers, categorizacion, vista).\n\n- Nueva tabla extractos_bancarios (migracion 202606231000): sociedad/cuenta/banco/\n  IBAN/mes-anio/archivo + archivo_hash + metricas + rango + estado (importado/\n  pendiente_revision/listo_conciliacion/deshecho). Columnas aditivas en\n  movimientos_bancarios: extracto_id, hash, referencia, tipo_movimiento,\n  cuenta_bancaria_id. Indices unicos parciales por archivo y por hash de fila.\n- Dedup doble hash: archivo_hash (fichero) + hash por fila\n  sha256(sociedad|iban|fecha|importe|concepto_norm|saldo|referencia). Logica pura\n  lib/extractoImport.ts (canonico + Web Crypto + adaptador XLSX->filas con xlsx\n  lazy-loaded + rango/avisos) + 15 tests.\n- RPC importar_extracto_bancario (atomica): crea extracto + inserta no-duplicados\n  (on conflict por hash) + devuelve resumen. RPC deshacer_importacion_extracto:\n  borra movimientos + marca deshecho (soft, sin CASCADE).\n- UI: pestanas Movimientos/Extractos; importador CSV/XLSX con cuenta+mes/anio y\n  preview (total/nuevos/duplicados/rango/avisos); lista de extractos con estado,\n  filtro por extracto y deshacer. Selectores con SelectField oscuro.\n\nRequiere aplicar la migracion 202606231000 post-merge. Fase 2: Norma 43, PDF-OCR,\nconciliacion, gestoria (no incluidos).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dc130a3410f152d01058cfab7d820fa9c65a486","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/0dc130a3410f152d01058cfab7d820fa9c65a486"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/897d859a4cf560db9bec939cfec8e2874ccbab42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/897d859a4cf560db9bec939cfec8e2874ccbab42","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDg5N2Q4NTlhNGNmNTYwZGI5YmVjOTM5Y2ZlYzhlMjg3NGNjYmFiNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/64a25796ad13c25c14cc6219038e9cd7d99fb4ee","sha":"64a25796ad13c25c14cc6219038e9cd7d99fb4ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/64a25796ad13c25c14cc6219038e9cd7d99fb4ee"}],"sha":"897d859a4cf560db9bec939cfec8e2874ccbab42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/897d859a4cf560db9bec939cfec8e2874ccbab42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api