3T14:21:04Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(contabilidad): dropdown oscuro en el modal de reglas de facturacion (PR E.1)\n\nLos <select> nativos del modal \"Reglas de facturacion\" abrian una lista blanca\ndel SO que tapaba el modal en dark mode. Hotfix solo visual: sin tocar logica de\nreglas, migraciones, Supabase, OCR, Drive, pagos ni datos.\n\n- Componente compartido components/SelectField.tsx (extraido del dropdown que ya\n  usaba el panel de factura: portal con z-index alto, fondo zinc-900, max-height\n  con scroll interno, posicionamiento sobre el boton). Panel de factura intacto.\n- Los 3 selects del modal (sociedad, metodo de pago, regimen IVA) pasan de\n  <select> nativo a SelectField. Mas contraste en etiquetas (zinc-400).\n\ntype-check, lint, tests (61) y build verdes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"019e79d3f7e44549fb0e664c687c9d021e8c332c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/019e79d3f7e44549fb0e664c687c9d021e8c332c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/4278013f9fb7dbe4b0623e71769469ca98594641","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":f