rl":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/23039b4bc262bbcbcacc5c0c2ccf0c6a8cbd4564/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:26:20Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:26:20Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(contabilidad): proveedores recurrentes / reglas de facturacion y domiciliadas (PR E)\n\nReglas por proveedor para sugerir campos de factura y marcar domiciliadas.\nv1 = SOLO sugerencias: nada se auto-valida, auto-aprueba, auto-paga ni\nenvia emails.\n\n- Tabla proveedores_reglas (migracion 202606230900, aditiva) anclada a\n  (contacto_id, sociedad_id_ref); sociedad null = regla global del proveedor.\n  Indices unicos parciales (una activa por sociedad + una global por contacto),\n  RLS authenticated, updated_at por trigger. Columnas aditivas en\n  facturas_recibidas: es_domiciliada, regla_aplicada_id.\n- Logica pura lib/proveedorReglas.ts (seleccion especifica>global, sugerencias,\n  alerta de importe, sub-estado domiciliada) + 18 tests. NO toca procesar-factura:\n  las reglas se aplican como sugerencias en cliente. Nunca pisa sociedad validada.\n- Domiciliadas: sin estados nuevos; sub-estado derivado pendiente_cargo/\n  cargada_sin_justificante/pagada; el cargo se registra como factura_pago\n  domiciliacion (RPC existente). Sin pago automatico.\n- requiere_aprobacion_javi: solo aviso en v1 (no toca la RPC de aprobaciones).\n- UI: card \"Sugerencias del proveedor\" + crear/aplicar regla + toggle/banner\n  domiciliada en el panel; Contactos > Reglas de facturacion (CRUD); filtro y\n  badge \"Domiciliadas pendientes de cargo\" en la lista.\n\nRequiere aplicar la migracion 202606230900 post-merge. No toca Gmail,\nconciliacion bancaria, paquete gestoria, OCR, routing de Javi ni estados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a2d4454e8edf46d98b6360e52b3b00541939907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/1a2d4454e8edf46d98b6360e52b3b00541939907"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/23039b4bc262bbcbcacc5c0c2ccf0c6a8cbd4564","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscription