feat(presupuestos): bucket proyecto-documentos privado + signed URLs (PR A2-bis)\n\nCierra el unico bucket publico real con datos sensibles. Visor firmado primero; el flip a privado queda en la migracion para aplicar SOLO post-merge tras verificar el visor en produccion (orden D1).\n\n- documentoUrl.ts: resolveDocumentoSource (puro) + getDocumentoUrl async (firma signed URL 1h desde storage_path; fallback archivo_url legado). TabDocumentos pasa de <a href=archivo_url> a boton que firma al clic.\n\n- Migracion 202606192300 (NO aplicada): politicas storage.objects {public}->authenticated, RLS tabla proyecto_documentos anon->authenticated, bucket->privado. No toca columnas. Validada con dry-run BEGIN/ROLLBACK (nada persiste).\n\n- Tests: resolveDocumentoSource (4). Solo presupuestos/proyecto-documentos; no toca facturas/pagos/Gmail/Drive/OCR/estados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"140ca87a84de906b92b72aa71aed36838d908918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/140ca87a84de906b92b72aa71aed36838d908918"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/d6468b06bb8dd567acfcd1f6a8925b9edbcb7b6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guill