,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/7755b843f151eb9e61b632f820040b839d989399/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T09:39:23Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T09:39:23Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(contabilidad): anadir columna motivo_rechazo a facturas_recibidas (hotfix)\n\nLa RPC avanzar_estado_factura_con_auditoria (PR B) actualiza facturas_recibidas.motivo_rechazo en CADA transicion, pero la columna nunca se creo en esa tabla (si existe en factura_aprobaciones). plpgsql no valida referencias a columnas al crear la funcion, solo al ejecutarla -> fallo latente. Al pulsar ''Dar visto bueno'' (accion valida) la RPC ejecuta el UPDATE y revienta con 42703, bloqueando toda transicion.\n\nFix minimo e idempotente: alter table facturas_recibidas add column if not exists motivo_rechazo text. Sin tocar RPC, frontend, Edge Function, pagos, Storage ni OCR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aba66feb57864ce7b14f9ab0eaaf2f4a6a4842b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/aba66feb57864ce7b14f9ab0eaaf2f4a6a4842b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/7755b843f151eb9e61b632f820040b839d989399","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/7755b843f151eb9e61b632f820040b839d989399","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDc3NTViODQzZjE1MWViOWU2MWI2MzJmODIwMDQwYjgzOWQ5ODkzOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/de83aa0555c1e19599d5f5330f5cce03cabf0583","sha":"de83aa0555c1e19599d5f5330f5cce03cabf0583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/de83aa0555c1e19599d5f5330f5cce03cabf0583"}],"sha":"7755b843f151eb9e61b632f820040b839d989399","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/7755b843f151eb9e61b632f820040b839d989399"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co