,"name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:12:36Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(contabilidad): pagos parciales + justificantes + comparacion de importes (PR C)\n\nLibro de pagos reales de tesoreria de la factura (factura_pagos, append-only) + incidencias (factura_incidencias), distinto de presupuesto_pagos. Referencia total_a_pagar (= total - retencion).\n\n- Migracion 202606192100: 2 tablas SELECT-only, accion ampliada (registra_pago/crea_incidencia/resuelve_incidencia), politica Storage INSERT acotada a recibidas/*/pagos/*, RPCs registrar_pago_factura y resolver_incidencia_factura (security definer, actor server-side, solo Alicia o single-operator).\n\n- Estado de pago DERIVADO (no toca el enum): sin_pagos/pago_parcial/pagada/sobrepagada/descuadrada, TOLERANCIA_PAGO_EUR=0.5. Logica pura facturaPagos.ts + 13 tests.\n\n- Sobrepago/infrapago crean incidencia; parcial no. Transicion a pagada dentro de tolerancia + sync presupuesto_pago. Justificantes en bucket privado, signed URLs. UI seccion Pagos en el panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1cbc49f177c990cb05c5be4e23bef583fd835b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/b1cbc49f177c990cb05c5be4e23bef583fd835b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/d0518e9ef34e5b632f48e9f7587f53fa7245db91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":27605986