la/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/6222b4f25e19d2a5363b4006690e7422dc54992a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:38:08Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T09:38:08Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(contabilidad): Storage privado de facturas + persistencia real de PDFs (PR A2)\n\nCrea el bucket `facturas` privado de origen, anade storage_path y pasa el visor\na signed URLs temporales. Corrige la subida de procesar-factura, que fallaba en\nsilencio porque el bucket nunca existio (0/16 facturas con PDF persistido -> no\nhabia fuga publica activa de facturas; el bucket publico real es\nproyecto-documentos, que queda para PR A2-bis).\n\n- Migracion 202606192000: storage_path + bucket privado + RLS SELECT en storage.objects\n- facturaPdf.ts: resolveFacturaPdfSource (puro) + getFacturaPdfUrl async (firma 1h)\n- Visor con loading/error/reintento; enlace abrir firma al clic; fallback drop manual\n- Edge Function guarda storage_path (requiere redeploy)\n- Sin backfill (0 archivo_url). No toca workflow/estados/aprobaciones/notificaciones\n- Tests: resolveFacturaPdfSource (signed/legacy/none + prioridad)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10a1e59ced133d2de0b7ed07c15fdb0d26936f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/10a1e59ced133d2de0b7ed07c15fdb0d26936f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/6222b4f25e19d2a5363b4006690e7422dc54992a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt