ranspilePackages), borra stub FacturasAppClient.tsx; mantiene redirect /facturas -> /contabilidad.\n- Helper central getFacturaArchivoUrl (sin cambio de comportamiento) como único punto para futuras signed URLs (PR A2).\n- Documenta flujo canónico, estados, módulo vivo vs archivado y riesgo Storage en ARQUITECTURA/CHANGELOG.\n- Sin Gmail, Drive, pagos parciales, justificantes, reglas de proveedor, paquete gestoría, notificaciones reales ni bucket privado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f39cb4c3cbd4dec4c50c89b1bfca9dcf9f0b55a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/6f39cb4c3cbd4dec4c50c89b1bfca9dcf9f0b55a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/0cc41f195d5fe098d5befd4271a264c5e3216bdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/0cc41f195d5fe098d5befd4271a264c5e3216bdb","node_id":"C_kwDOTE