essage":"feat(presupuestos): renta explotar-vs-liquidar, rediseño PDF y tests\n\n- Renta: nueva sección \"Explotar vs liquidar\" con rentabilidad neta sobre valor actual destacada frente a la tasa exigida (no es recomendación de venta; considera impuestos, deuda, liquidez, etc.).\n- PDF: logo real de Alsari (data URI base64), estados en texto en vez de iconos Unicode, mejor jerarquía/tablas/paginación, fórmulas en palabras, avisos de defaults (ocupación 100%, horizonte 10, etc.) y fila/sección de rentab. neta sobre valor actual.\n- Tests: Vitest en el módulo + renta.test.ts (10 casos de regresión).\n- No toca otros tipos (salvo común del PDF), KPIs, rutas, migraciones ni Prettier.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3fc00a03d1bec7589c1573c265d8a8646e12076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/a3fc00a03d1bec7589c1573c265d8a8646e12076"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/5796da4c1ade554849337b09bafea8ea52abeb44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevil