com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/58c5b7614805535d903f6ede3e0411d981c52019/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:57:58Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T14:57:58Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(presupuestos): veredicto de renta y simulador de financiacion\n\nCorrige tres problemas (caso real Villa el Chorro, sin deuda).\n\n- Veredicto de renta separa renta operativa de componente patrimonial:\n  nuevo vanSinResidual (VAN solo con rentas). Ya no marca \"Agresivo\" solo\n  por residual alto; solo Agresivo si depende casi en exclusiva del\n  residual o hay tension real de apalancamiento (con deuda). No menciona\n  apalancamiento si no hay deuda. Si la renta funciona y el residual\n  aporta mucho -> Atractivo con matiz patrimonial.\n- Simulador: escenarios sobre la INVERSION (50/60/70%), no sobre valor\n  actual con cap -> ya no salen tres tarjetas identicas; deudas, cuotas y\n  equity distintos. Anade LTV sobre valor actual como lectura separada.\n- Banner: diferencia TIR del activo vs TIR del equity; con equity ~0 o\n  sin TIR comparable muestra \"Analizar financiacion\" en vez de \"reduce\".\n- PDF hereda el veredicto corregido (misma evaluarVeredictoRenta). No\n  toca otros tipos, nombres de KPIs, rutas ni Prettier.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46ee340717bdd5fc89f46997551f298113d3c086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/46ee340717bdd5fc89f46997551f298113d3c086"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/58c5b7614805535d903f6ede3e0411d981c52019","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/58c5b7614805535d903f6ede3e0411d981c52019","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDU4YzViNzYxNDgwNTUzNWQ5MDNmNmVkZTNlMDQxMWQ5ODFjNTIwMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/1af9583201512e9bfd995082936afa44e6b4fcbf","sha":"1af9583201512e9bfd995082936afa44e6b4fcbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/1af9583201512e9bfd995082936afa44e6b4fcbf"}],"sha":"58c5b7614805535d903f6ede3e0411d981c52019","url":"https://api.github.com