ps://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/a3498dfee4ef307b2b9535c6eddde85425284c32","sha":"a3498dfee4ef307b2b9535c6eddde85425284c32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/a3498dfee4ef307b2b9535c6eddde85425284c32"}],"sha":"ec11b2ce4af91dd56299fd6be80f65bf627adcb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/ec11b2ce4af91dd56299fd6be80f65bf627adcb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/a3498dfee4ef307b2b9535c6eddde85425284c32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:54:24Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:54:24Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): vista ejecutiva de Alternativo (Fase 4.5, cierra Fase 4)\n\nHomogeneiza Alternativo con el patron ejecutivo. Con esto los 6 tipos de\nanalisis comparten el mismo patron. Sin renombrar KPIs.\n\n- Veredicto modulado por riesgo/liquidez: riesgo alto o liquidez baja\n  impiden \"Atractivo\"; sin informar -> mas prudente; retorno<=capital o\n  VAN<0 -> Revisar. Calidad del dato propia.\n- Modelo de dos flujos: ano 0 = -capital; salida = retorno esperado\n  total. VAN = retorno/(1+tasa)^anos - capital. TIR = (retorno/capital)^\n  (1/anos)-1. MOIC = retorno/capital. Beneficio = retorno - capital.\n  Aclaracion en UI: retorno total = capital + plusvalia (no el beneficio).\n- Plusvalia latente = valoracion - capital, NO se suma al VAN.\n- nivel_riesgo (bajo/medio/alto) y nivel_liquidez (alta/media/baja),\n  cualitativos; sin informar bajan calidad y prudencia. Migracion\n  aditiva 202606181200.\n- Escenarios resumidos + desplegables (operacion, riesgo/liquidez,\n  valoracion, supuestos). Validaciones suaves. Nuevos alternativoInsights\n  .ts y AlternativoView.tsx; KpisAlternativoView delega; FormAlternativo\n  en bloques; kpis.tsx queda como barrel. No toca otros tipos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"482a2f79e5694ff9e6ce01b036b27b2c38b40908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/482a2f79e5694ff9e6ce01b036b27b2c38b40908"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/a3498dfee4ef307b2b9535c6eddde85425284c32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u