rl":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/3db2e1792f38567c1054d9ad644d21bb76263abd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:31:27Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:31:27Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): vista ejecutiva de CAPEX interno (Fase 4.4)\n\nHomogeneiza CAPEX interno con el patron ejecutivo, sin renombrar KPIs y\nsin migracion (reutiliza campos existentes).\n\n- Veredicto (payback, VAN, TIR, impacto en caja, vida util, dependencia\n  del valor residual) + calidad del dato propia.\n- Correccion: VAN/TIR/payback usan caja neta = ahorro bruto - CAPEX\n  mantenimiento (antes ahorro bruto). El ahorro bruto queda informativo.\n- VAN/TIR: ano 0 = -inversion; caja neta durante la vida util; valor\n  residual (vacio = 0% conservador) sumado solo al ultimo ano y\n  descontado (no se duplica). TIR por biseccion; no convergente -> \"No\n  calculable\". Depreciacion contable, no entra en caja.\n- KPIs reorganizados (+ impacto en caja anual) + escenarios resumidos +\n  desplegables (desglose, depreciacion, supuestos). Validaciones suaves.\n- Nuevos capexInsights.ts y CapexView.tsx; KpisCapexView delega;\n  FormCapex en bloques. No toca renta, compra-venta, explotacion ni\n  prestamo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0aefd9aade9f0394ad342bc7d28c2e86157b96ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/0aefd9aade9f0394ad342bc7d28c2e86157b96ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/3db2e1792f38567c1054d9ad644d21bb76263abd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/3db2e1792f38567c1054d9ad644d21bb76263abd","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDNkYjJlMTc5MmYzODU2N2MxMDU0ZDlhZDY0NGQyMWJiNzYyNjNhYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/804d78c0c7a0a2d0767ceb4c90d32abbebe8f086","sha":"804d78c0c7a0a2d0767ce