ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/804d78c0c7a0a2d0767ceb4c90d32abbebe8f086","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDgwNGQ3OGMwYzdhMGEyZDA3NjdjZWI0YzkwZDMyYWJiZWJlOGYwODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/534cf7ce83d3651ed4c5d19469d36bef332b7021","sha":"534cf7ce83d3651ed4c5d19469d36bef332b7021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/534cf7ce83d3651ed4c5d19469d36bef332b7021"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/b6cb68749362254260417526034a2093dd50f3ef","sha":"b6cb68749362254260417526034a2093dd50f3ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/b6cb68749362254260417526034a2093dd50f3ef"}],"sha":"804d78c0c7a0a2d0767ceb4c90d32abbebe8f086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/804d78c0c7a0a2d0767ceb4c90d32abbebe8f086"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/b6cb68749362254260417526034a2093dd50f3ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:16:14Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:16:14Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): vista ejecutiva de prestamo/inversion financiera (Fase 4.3)\n\nHomogeneiza prestamo (Alsari prestamista) con el patron ejecutivo, sin\nrenombrar KPIs.\n\n- Veredicto (tipo, plazo, TIR vs tasa, VAN, VAN ajustado, cobertura,\n  PD/LGD, riesgo contraparte) + calidad del dato propia.\n- VAN/TIR sobre el calendario real del cuadro: ano 0 sale capital; cobros\n  mensuales (frances/bullet). VAN base = -capital + Sum cuota/(1+tasa/12)^m.\n  TIR = IRR mensual anualizada (reemplaza la aproximacion); no convergente\n  -> \"No calculable\".\n- Garantia: cobertura = valor garantia / capital (no se suma al VAN). Nueva\n  columna valor_garantia (migracion aditiva).\n- Riesgo separado: perdida esperada = capital x PD x LGD (solo si ambos);\n  VAN ajustado = VAN base - VP(perdida esperada), mostrado aparte (sin\n  mezclar rentabilidad y riesgo, sin doble penalizacion).\n- Escenarios resumidos + desplegables (cuadro, garantias, riesgo,\n  supuestos). Validaciones suaves. Nuevos prestamoInsights.ts y\n  PrestamoView.tsx; KpisPrestamoView delega; FormPrestamo en bloques. No\n  toca renta, compra-venta ni explotacion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dcd8fefdc938569395e40c2e407a1d7d1d700f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/0dcd8fefdc938569395e40c2e407a1d7d1d700f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila