ail":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): vista ejecutiva de negocio operativo/explotacion (Fase 4.2)\n\nHomogeneiza explotacion con el patron ejecutivo, sin renombrar KPIs.\n\n- Veredicto (EBITDA, margen, payback, VAN/TIR, punto muerto, estabilidad,\n  dependencia de supuestos) + calidad del dato propia.\n- KPIs reorganizados + VAN/TIR nuevos en calcKpisExplotacion (inversion\n  completa con flujos completos): inversion = adquisicion + circulante;\n  FCF = EBITDA - CAPEX - impuestos; VAN = -inv + Sum FCF(1+g)^(t-1)/\n  (1+tasa)^t; TIR = tasa que anula el VAN.\n- Valor de continuidad opcional (off por defecto): manual o multiplo de\n  EBITDA; se suma al ultimo ano y se descuenta a hoy (no duplica FCF).\n- Escenarios resumidos + desplegables (desglose operativo, valor de\n  continuidad, supuestos). Validaciones suaves.\n- Migracion 202606181000 (4 columnas aditivas, aplicada). Nuevos\n  explotacionInsights.ts y ExplotacionView.tsx; KpisExplotacionView\n  delega; FormExplotacion en bloques. No toca renta ni compra-venta.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2aae5baa0086fa4408878d22a1d0759c49e26f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/f2aae5baa0086fa4408878d22a1d0759c49e26f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/ca08aa865f5f685ae43d4c9928c4c44108a71b8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","