tps://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/3fcce5ef61cbbb9c5e18754645a5d763f16c23b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:31:09Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T09:31:09Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): vista ejecutiva de compra/reforma/venta (Fase 4.1)\n\nHomogeneiza compra/reforma/venta con el patron ejecutivo de renta, sin\nrenombrar KPIs existentes.\n\n- Veredicto ejecutivo (margen, beneficio, TIR vs tasa, VAN, plazo,\n  apalancamiento, sensibilidad a venta pesimista -10%) + calidad del dato\n  con campos propios de CV.\n- KPIs principales reorganizados + escenarios resumidos + desplegables\n  (desglose, financiacion si hay deuda, sensibilidad a precio de venta,\n  coste/m2). Validaciones suaves.\n- Correccion calcKpisCV: separa coste economico (margen, todo) del timing\n  de caja (VAN/TIR). Gastos de venta, comision e IS van al flujo de\n  SALIDA, no al ano 0. Contingencia entra en el coste. Deuda se devuelve\n  una vez (sin doble penalizacion). Equity = costes iniciales - deuda.\n- Nuevos cvInsights.ts y CompraVentaView.tsx; KpisCV delega; FormCV en\n  bloques; escenariosProyectoApi anade beneficioNeto/precioVenta. Renta\n  no se toca.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c995f9ea8cadd1f1bf5783bf20a782fcbb5ff41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/0c995f9ea8cadd1f1bf5783bf20a782fcbb5ff41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/3fcce5ef61cbbb9c5e18754645a5d763f16c23b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/3fcce5ef61cbbb9c5e18754645a5d763f16c23b5","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDNmY2NlNWVmNjFjYmJiOWM1ZTE4NzU0NjQ1YTVkNzYzZjE2YzIzYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/0b4a7f7775ec5b51c888a45b74dc53d5605536fc","sha":"0b4a7f7775ec5b51c888a45b74dc53d5605536fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/0b4a7f7775ec5b51c888a45b74dc53d5605536fc"}],"sha":"3fcce5ef61cbbb9c5e18754645a5d763f16c23b5","url