llevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/9b3d42ab9adf338d3dfcb75137196abba57372bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:55:41Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:55:41Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"refactor(presupuestos): andamiaje compartido del patron ejecutivo (Fase 4.0)\n\nExtrae a piezas compartidas el patron ejecutivo de renta, sin cambio\nfuncional. Renta queda visual y numericamente identica.\n\n- lib/insights.ts: tipos del veredicto + framework de calidad del dato\n  (DefCampo, evaluarCalidad) reutilizable por cada tipo de analisis.\n- tab-numeros/ejecutivo.tsx: VeredictoBlock, CalidadBlock (recibe\n  CalidadDato), EscenariosResumenTabla (recibe filas por tipo).\n- RentaView y rentaInsights pasan a usar lo compartido (-219 lineas).\n- Sin tocar calculos, UX visible, nombres de KPIs, rutas, unidades ni\n  Prettier.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7057a28dff9909f989b4f3bd56f5dd766ce3528d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/7057a28dff9909f989b4f3bd56f5dd766ce3528d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/9b3d42ab9adf338d3dfcb75137196abba57372bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_u