da0e24e329f2308f3359406b8cee36d9af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/d758db90f0447e675aac681a8e8d27c2a1ea5690/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:44:49Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T16:44:49Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(presupuestos): valor residual de renta con revalorizacion explicita\n\nEl metodo \"Valor actual estimado\" tomaba el valor de hoy como valor\nresidual del ano final sin revalorizarlo. Ahora:\n\n- Valor actual = valor de mercado HOY; se proyecta al horizonte con una\n  revalorizacion anual estimada (campo nuevo, reutiliza\n  tasa_crecimiento_anual_pct). Vacio = 0% (conservador; no cambia el\n  numero en proyectos existentes).\n  valorResidualFuturo = valorActual * (1 + reval)^horizonte\n  valorPresente       = valorResidualFuturo / (1 + tasa)^horizonte\n- Manual: valor del ano final introducido directamente; no se revaloriza,\n  solo se descuenta.\n- Cap rate: NOI / cap rate de salida (valor futuro), luego se descuenta.\n- Metodos consolidados a 3 (valor actual + reval / cap rate / manual);\n  crecimiento_anual se pliega en valor actual con compatibilidad.\n- UI: bloque \"Valor residual\" con valor actual, revalorizacion usada,\n  residual futuro, valor presente y aviso de 0% conservador.\n- calcKpisRentaExtended expone valorResidualPresente,\n  revalorizacionResidualPct y revalorizacionPorDefecto. Sin migracion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b9360516b3b4b5c234e81b2a2ef7f89fd1666ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/1b9360516b3b4b5c234e81b2a2ef7f89fd1666ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/d758db90f0447e675aac681a8e8d27c2a1ea5690","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/d758db90f0447e675aac681