d1952"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/dbfc1b2f5f0063ec9b3aa49a577728cdbec7c889","sha":"dbfc1b2f5f0063ec9b3aa49a577728cdbec7c889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/dbfc1b2f5f0063ec9b3aa49a577728cdbec7c889"}],"sha":"56ddf647a0a62e79c7707d42d84ca348bb10aa81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/56ddf647a0a62e79c7707d42d84ca348bb10aa81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/ae06ffbedc34be00a564e57548c04b08e4ab61ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:51:36Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:51:36Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(presupuestos): TIR/VAN sobre capital aportado real, no inversion x %equity\n\nLa TIR y el VAN usaban como inversion inicial inversionTotal x %equity\n(p. ej. 50%) pero mantenian el 100% de la caja y del valor residual sin\ncoste de deuda, inflando la TIR (~4,9% real mostraba 14,3%) y\ndesalineando la vista principal con el simulador.\n\n- equity = coste total - deuda real (hipotecaria en renta, promotora en\n  CV), no un % de la inversion. Sin deuda -> equity = coste total -> TIR\n  economica del activo. Con deuda, flujos netos de cuota y salida neta de\n  deuda pendiente -> TIR sobre equity apalancada.\n- Afecta calcKpisRentaExtended, calcKpisRenta y calcKpisCV.\n- El campo \"% que financia Alsari\" deja de gobernar el calculo; los\n  formularios muestran \"capital aportado = coste - deuda\". Nomenclatura\n  visible de KPIs sin cambios.\n- Verificado: con coste 1.416.700, NOI 57.100, residual 1.575.500 y 10\n  anos, la TIR pasa de 14,30% (bug) a 4,92%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c52d098c9dec029615e6e8a80a8959b1c3ff35a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/6c52d098c9dec029615e6e8a80a8959b1c3ff35a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/ae06ffbedc34be00a564e57548c04b08e4ab61ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/ae06ffbedc34be00a564e57548c04b08e4ab61ea","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKGFlMDZmZmJlZGMzNGJlMDBhNTY0ZTU3NTQ4YzA0YjA4ZTRhYjYxZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51","sha":"e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51"}],"sha":"ae06ffbedc34be00a564e57548c04b08e4ab61ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/ae06ffbedc34be00a564e57548c04b08e4ab61ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T14:26:35Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:30:31Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): vista ejecutiva del analisis de renta (Fase 1)\n\nReorganiza el analisis de proyectos en renta a una lectura ejecutiva:\nprimero veredicto y KPIs clave; el detalle, en bloques desplegables.\nNo se renombra ningun KPI existente.\n\n- Veredicto ejecutivo automatico (Atractivo/Defensivo/Agresivo/Revisar)\n  con motivo y 3-5 razones.\n- Calidad del dato (Alta/Media/Baja + %) con desglose completos /\n  estimados / faltantes y aviso de criticos.\n- VAN para renta conviviendo con la TIR (flujos + valor residual − deuda\n  a salida descontados; muestra tasa y diferencial TIR−tasa).\n- Desglose del flujo anual en cascada (renta bruta → ... → caja neta).\n- Financiacion mejorada: tipo, plazo y sistema (frances/bullet/manual);\n  intereses, amortizacion y deuda a salida; DSCR/LTV solo con deuda.\n- Fiscalidad opcional (cerrada por defecto): IS, amortizacion fiscal,\n  costes de venta y plusvalia. Sin activar = antes de impuestos.\n- Escenarios resumidos compactos en pantalla y bloque de mercado (€/m²).\n- Formulario reorganizado en bloques; validaciones suaves.\n- Migracion 202606180900 (7 columnas aditivas, aplicada). upsert\n  resiliente: omite columnas inexistentes y reintenta.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87e152834d724a5aff46e031b75210d739c3cac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/87e152834d724a5aff46e031b75210d739c3cac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKGUwYjgzMzdmZmU4YmRlZGU4ZmRlYzY4OTEzYzQ5MDFiYWQwMjJjNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da","sha":"030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da"}],"sha":"e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/e0b8337ffe8bdede8fdec68913c4901bad022c51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:30:24Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:30:24Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(presupuestos): no usar VAN absoluto como filtro del veredicto de financiacion\n\nEl VAN es un importe absoluto y, al financiar con menos equity, baja de\nforma natural; usarlo como filtro penalizaba el apalancamiento. El gate\nde ''apalancamiento positivo'' usa solo senales independientes de la escala\n(DSCR y mejora de TIR). El VAN se sigue mostrando por opcion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70d8d47b0fb669e347460b983900334b073267da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/70d8d47b0fb669e347460b983900334b073267da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDAzMGI0OTUyYjVjZWEyOTNhMTJkNTgxY2ExYzFiYzVkYjU1OWE3ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353","sha":"9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353"}],"sha":"030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/030b4952b5cea293a12d581ca1c1bc5db559a7da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:28:20Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T15:28:20Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(presupuestos): veredicto de financiacion basado en DSCR y medallas coherentes\n\nEl veredicto ya no se basa en comparar rentabilidad del activo vs tipo\nde interes (eso pasa a dato secundario). Prioriza DSCR, cash flow tras\ndeuda, rentabilidad sobre capital propio, TIR financiada vs sin deuda y\nVAN.\n\n- Con DSCR < 1 nunca sale \"apalancamiento positivo\"; DSCR 1-1,15 =\n  \"financiacion muy ajustada\"; \"positivo\" exige DSCR >= 1,25 y mejora de\n  TIR. Si libera capital pero empeora caja/TIR, lo dice. Marca riesgo\n  alto (DSCR < 1) aunque la TIR salga positiva.\n- Las medallas +-pp comparan siempre la misma metrica (TIR financiada vs\n  TIR sin deuda); en rojo si es negativa. Se elimina la comparacion\n  TIR-vs-cash-on-cash que daba verde enganoso.\n- TIR/VAN financiados con flujos coherentes: ano 0 = -equity; anos =\n  NOI - cuota; salida = valor residual - deuda PENDIENTE amortizada (no\n  la deuda inicial). Base y opciones con el mismo modelo. Anade VAN y\n  cash flow anual por opcion.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bf59e538548ce96da71ab797f837fc9795cb0b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/4bf59e538548ce96da71ab797f837fc9795cb0b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDk2OTRkMjMzNGYxYTcyMzUwZDZiZjhkZWYwOTFhNzhjZjFlYWYzNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/27161f50f0f15e64b9e0195bc2db6e19cee1758a","sha":"27161f50f0f15e64b9e0195bc2db6e19cee1758a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/27161f50f0f15e64b9e0195bc2db6e19cee1758a"}],"sha":"9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/9694d2334f1a72350d6bf8def091a78cf1eaf353"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/27161f50f0f15e64b9e0195bc2db6e19cee1758a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T10:18:41Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T10:18:41Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): simulador de financiacion por proyecto\n\nNueva sub-seccion \"Financiacion\" en la pestana Numeros: para proyectos\nno financiados genera 3 niveles de apalancamiento (50/60/70% de deuda) y\nlos compara contra la base sin financiar, para decidir si merece la pena\nfinanciar.\n\n- Veredicto en lenguaje claro segun apalancamiento positivo/negativo:\n  compara la rentabilidad del activo con el coste de la deuda y recomienda\n  la mejor opcion con DSCR sano.\n- Por opcion: deuda, capital propio, capital liberado, cuota y DSCR\n  (renta) o coste financiero y MOIC (compra-venta), rentabilidad sobre\n  equity y TIR apalancada, con semaforos y mejora en pp.\n- Supuestos editables (tipo de interes, plazo). Renta: hipoteca francesa\n  y TIR con valor residual. Compra-venta: prestamo promotor bullet.\n- Calculo en cliente, no se persiste (es exploratorio).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"588473ce15aac5be3c7320b70c02a9b766de60d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/588473ce15aac5be3c7320b70c02a9b766de60d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/27161f50f0