evila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/c210db3ef22de76ec56a73bed4c253e8fea01b7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T10:07:16Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T10:07:16Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): documentos justificativos por proyecto\n\nNueva pestaña \"Documentos\" en cada proyecto para adjuntar los archivos\ncon los que se calcularon datos (estudios de mercado, tasaciones,\nescrituras), con categoría y una nota de qué dato justifican. Así queda\ntrazable de dónde salió cada cifra (valor actual, renta…).\n\n- Subida a bucket de Storage ''proyecto-documentos'' vía REST desde el\n  cliente (mismo patrón público + RLS que ''facturas''); listado,\n  descarga y borrado con confirmación.\n- Migración 202606171400: tabla proyecto_documentos (FK a proyectos on\n  delete cascade, RLS) + bucket + políticas. API en documentosApi.ts.\n- Verificado el ciclo completo subida -> URL pública -> borrado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b1a1efcaac49a3e4c4b73cdd9b7bf0b2cd6e2c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/5b1a1efcaac49a3e4c4b73cdd9b7bf0b