/api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/867fadf42b877beed4863dc438791494300c13b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T07:54:55Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T07:54:55Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(presupuestos): yield bruto sobre el coste inicial total, no solo el precio\n\nLa rentabilidad bruta sobre coste de los análisis de renta dividía la\nrenta anual bruta entre solo el precio de adquisición, pese a la etiqueta\n''sobre coste''. Ahora divide entre la inversión total (precio + gastos de\nadquisición + capex), misma base que la neta sobre coste. Corregido en\ncalcKpisRentaExtended y calcKpisRenta; subtítulo y tooltip actualizados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd76e17c3266a77074ed4ee0a3529ce25b407e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/fd76e17c3266a77074ed4ee0a3529ce25b407e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/867fadf42b877beed4863dc438791494300c13b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"ava