ila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/6f10161d65f2c7ef98ee1473a7bacad6c9999bc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T08:53:56Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T08:53:56Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(financiero): leer sumas y saldos formato Navision/Dynamics NAV\n\nEl export de Microsoft Dynamics NAV (Rialsa) usa celdas combinadas que\ndescolocan las columnas respecto a los rótulos: el código de cuenta cae\nen la columna 0 aunque la etiqueta \"Cuenta\" esté en otra, con desfases\ndistintos por columna. El parser no encontraba ninguna línea.\n\nNuevo parser de respaldo anclado a datos (extractAnchoredLines), activo\nsolo cuando el principal no saca nada: detecta la columna de cuenta por\nlos códigos y la de saldo como la única columna numérica que cuadra a\ncero con signos mixtos (deudor = acreedor). No toca los formatos que ya\nfuncionaban.\n\nVerificado contra el archivo real: 121 cuentas, caja 5,64 M, PN ~7 M.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55b51e6666b2402e8a28cdc21d787111f679e304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/55b51e6666b2402e8a28cdc21d787111f679e304"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/6f10161d65f2c7ef98ee1473a7bacad6c9999bc5","verification":{"payloa