github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/398a63fe4d608e615c22eaf1b2ad44ee5cfc1f9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T12:04:55Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T12:04:55Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(financiero): deuda de socios no contaba la deuda a largo plazo\n\nEl KPI sumaba solo cuentas a corto plazo (550-553) + la 555 (partidas\npendientes, que no es deuda de socios). Faltaba el grueso a largo plazo:\nsubgrupo 16 (partes vinculadas) y 171 (préstamos de socios, p.ej. la\n1710 de Perisur: Iván, Javier y Maygar). En Perisur daba 31€ en vez de\n1.708.934,60€.\n\n- deriveKpis: deuda_socios = 550-553 + grupo 16 + 171, sin la 555.\n- Migración 202606151600 recalcula el caché kpis_sociedades.deuda_socios\n  desde el último balance de cada sociedad. Idempotente. Aplicada al remoto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44e7bb27aa077341a9ef6507cf3e9b79cfdfb68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/44e7bb27aa077341a9ef6507cf3e9b79cfdfb68a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/398a63fe4d608e615c22eaf1b2ad44ee5cfc1f9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatur