225c717950add3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:36:04Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T08:36:04Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): eliminar proyecto con confirmación informada\n\nBotón Eliminar en la ficha de proyecto + modal que muestra qué se\nborrará (presupuestos, objetivos, tareas) y avisa de las facturas que\nse conservan pero se desvinculan. Requiere escribir el nombre para\nconfirmar.\n\ndeleteProyectoCompleto borra primero los presupuestos del proyecto\n(FK SET NULL, si no quedarían huérfanos) y luego el proyecto. El\nresto cae por cascada de FK. La función deleteProyecto del API ya\nexistía pero no estaba conectada a ninguna UI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2636c991193642b55fae592141f80c323f9aa753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/2636c991193642b55fae592141f80c323f9aa753"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/49370e4d155cfeec54c204205225c717950add3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/49370e4d155cfeec54c204205225c717950add3c","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDQ5MzcwZTRkMTU1Y2ZlZWM1NGMyMDQyMDUyMjVjNzE3OTUwYWRkM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707","sha":"66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707"}],"sha":"49370e4d155cfeec54c204205225c717950add3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/49370e4d155cfeec54c204205225c717950add3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T17:39:19Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T17:39:19Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(facturas): detección de facturas duplicadas\n\nDetector con dos criterios: mismo proveedor (NIF si existe) + mismo\nnº de factura normalizado, o mismo proveedor + fecha + importe. Las\nrechazadas no cuentan: rechazar un duplicado lo resuelve.\n\nAvisos en 4 superficies: banner global con recuento, badge en fila\n(rose si la gemela ya está imputada a presupuesto), panel comparativo\nen el detalle con salto a la otra factura, y aviso en el modal de\nimputación para no contar el gasto dos veces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e92b05e8937ce3b714077b752f9e3fa050ea9c0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/e92b05e8937ce3b714077b752f9e3fa050ea9c0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDY2YzU2MTUyYjdhMjI5ODY4ZDczMGUwMTQzYjdkZDgzNjE4YmE3MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695","sha":"da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695"}],"sha":"66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/66c56152b7a229868d730e0143b7dd83618ba707"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T16:17:36Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T16:17:36Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(presupuestos): gasto real desde facturas vinculadas vs presupuesto\n\nEl detalle de presupuesto compara tres magnitudes: Presupuestado\n(estimación previa), Gasto real (base imponible de facturas vinculadas\n+ pagos confirmados sin factura) y Pagado (caja). Antes el importe de\nla factura nunca entraba en la comparación.\n\n- Desviación real-presupuestado con color en los 3 niveles: resumen\n  global (4 tarjetas + barra), capítulo (chip) y partida.\n- Comparación en base imponible (IVA recuperable, no es coste);\n  fallback a total si la factura no trae base desglosada.\n- FacturaMini incluye base_imponible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1084553cd14b4973f75a11a89b86057270f4343a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/1084553cd14b4973f75a11a89b86057270f4343a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKGRhMmJlYjg3YjlmZjBiZTZiYzc4MjMzNzhlMjk0NWI0YWIxNDE2OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/e9b3f36575599bf1a7d91e378d0b735291fd0b37","sha":"e9b3f36575599bf1a7d91e378d0b735291fd0b37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/e9b3f36575599bf1a7d91e378d0b735291fd0b37"}],"sha":"da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/da2beb87b9ff0be6bc7823378e2945b4ab141695"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/e9b3f36575599bf1a7d91e378d0b735291fd0b37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:43:03Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:43:03Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"feat(financiero): selector de período en la vista de entidad\n\nAl entrar en una sociedad, el bloque Balance Contable incorpora un\nselector con flechas (meses disponibles + \"Actual\"). Al elegir un mes,\nlos KPI cards se recalculan desde los balances de sumas y saldos de\nese período: la sociedad propia y todas sus participadas, ponderadas\npor su % efectivo (reutiliza la estructura de consolidación existente\ny deriveKpis). Aviso ámbar si alguna participada no tiene balance del\nperíodo seleccionado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ede75ea00a041d3d917b445b1c72bbd7ffa29767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/ede75ea00a041d3d917b445b1c72bbd7ffa29767"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/e9b3f36575599bf1a7d91e378d0b735291fd0b37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finan