dad en Entidades tiene un botón lápiz que abre\nla ficha completa in-situ (datos básicos, KPIs, histórico, balances)\nsin pasar por Datos Maestros. El click en la tarjeta mantiene el\ncomportamiento anterior (visión general de la sociedad).\n\n- EntityCard pasa de button a div (HTML no permite botones anidados)\n- SociedadDetail acepta backLabel para contextualizar el volver\n- DashboardLayout cablea onRefresh y navegación a patrimonio\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3eeef6b22a3f834d006384cd260d0667bb693320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/3eeef6b22a3f834d006384cd260d0667bb693320"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/f8e8eebe68d484b27fbb2cfcd9a8f5615aff36d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/f8e8eebe68d484b27fbb2cfcd9a8f5615aff36d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKGY4ZThlZWJlNjh