r (semántica emerald/rose según la\nnaturaleza del KPI) y gráfico de evolución con métrica seleccionable.\n\nLos KPIs de cada período se derivan al vuelo desde balance_sumas_saldos\nreutilizando deriveKpis (ahora exportada con tipo de entrada KpiLine):\nsin tablas nuevas y retroactivo para los balances ya importados.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3f0c688a99b2d0ee5fed7b996453062306f2781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/c3f0c688a99b2d0ee5fed7b996453062306f2781"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/2d72a97e6dcf8bc7512bed2a5ada539ab877bab9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/2d72a97e6dcf8bc7512bed2a5ada539ab877bab9","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKDJkNzJhOTdlNmRjZjhiYzc1MTJiZWQyYTVhZGE1MzlhYjg3N2JhYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/895a