a/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/d977991ce45cbea2e45a78e05c8c1c9997e23089/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:02:19Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:02:19Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"fix(db): RLS en alsari_knowledge y proyecto_escenarios + lote de migraciones aplicado\n\nDos migraciones nuevas (ya aplicadas al remoto con supabase db query --linked):\n\n- 20260611131000_rls_alsari_knowledge.sql: la tabla de documentos\n  confidenciales del sistema de conocimiento Python estaba sin RLS en\n  produccion (legible con la anon key publica). RLS activado sin politica\n  anon; el pipeline Python usa service_role y no se ve afectado.\n- 20260611130000_rls_proyecto_escenarios_financieros.sql: la tabla de\n  escenarios se creo sin RLS; activado con la politica estandar del proyecto.\n\nAdemas se detecto y corrigio drift de produccion: 5 migraciones de mayo/junio\n(20260531000001..20260601000000 — presupuesto maestro, escenarios, horizonte\nrenta, plazo CV, impuesto sociedades) existian en el repo pero nunca se\naplicaron al remoto; esas features estaban rotas en produccion. Aplicadas.\n\nVerificado: 0 tablas sin RLS en el schema public.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3805fdabe822e85d5f56c53ad5ef9f9bb75989c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/trees/3805fdabe822e85d5f56c53ad5ef9f9bb75989c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/git/commits/d977991ce45cbea2e45a78e05c8c1c9997e23089","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/276059860?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/d977991ce45cbea2e45a78e05c8c1c9997e23089","node_id":"C_kwDOTEDz0toAKGQ5Nzc5OTFjZTQ1Y2JlYTJlNDVhNzhlMDVjOGMxYzk5OTdlMjMwODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commit/9fab62b1a11d4586f76e751c5963e568000ae2d5","sha":"9fab62b1a11d4586f76e751c5963e568000ae2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/9fab62b