vila/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillevila","id":276059860,"login":"guillevila","node_id":"U_kgDOEHRW1A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillevila","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guillevila/Finanzas-GEAF/commits/cdf9c7e8f7266c9911cab6fff7de20ec19e19138/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:01:51Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:01:51Z","email":"guillermovila@alsari.net","name":"Guille Vila"},"message":"refactor(supabase-client): implementar cliente compartido y eliminar 15 duplicados\n\nEl paquete @alsari/supabase-client existia vacio (solo .gitkeep) aunque la\ndocumentacion afirmaba que centralizaba el acceso a Supabase. Ahora exporta\nSUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, getJwt() (bridge window.alsariToken ->\nlocalStorage -> anon), sbUrl() y sbHeaders().\n\n- Migrados 15 archivos de 4 modulos (financiero x8, contabilidad, facturas,\n  presupuestos x5) que duplicaban URL, anon key y getJwt() en local.\n- patrimonioImport, maestroImport y sumasSaldosImport firmaban siempre con la\n  anon key; ahora usan getJwt() como el resto (token de sesion si existe).\n- Rotar la anon key pasa de tocar 16 archivos a tocar 1.\n- CLAUDE.md del financiero: schema vencimientos actualizado (tipo prestamo)\n  y 