s://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commits/311f1b1effb07abd15d7c9d6d3ba26db11873157/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:30:11Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T18:30:11Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"docs: fix 25 documentation inconsistencies across 9 files\n\nComprehensive documentation audit against the actual codebase revealed\ninaccuracies that accumulated as the project evolved. Key corrections:\n\n- CLAUDE.md: fix Icon path (src/app/components/, not src/rhoai/), update\n  hook count to 6 (add useFavoriteProjects), fix container base images\n  (UBI9 Node 22 / Nginx 1.24, not Alpine), add markdownlint to lint desc\n- CUSTOMIZATION.md: fix 3 wrong \"Current value\" entries in the identifiers\n  table (package.json name, Chart.yaml name, values.yaml image.repository)\n- COMMUNITY_PLUGINS.md: fix extension count (7, not 3) and replace\n  \"purely presentational\" with actual API integration patterns\n- README.md: fix lint comment, expand Helm description to include BFF\n  service, add Makefile mention\n- PROJECT_LAYOUT.md: add missing useFavoriteProjects.ts, ProjectSelector.tsx,\n  and bff/src/types.ts to directory tree\n- OPENSHIFT_DEPLOY.md: fix image.tag defaults from \"latest\" to \"\" (resolves\n  to appVersion)\n- plugin.yaml: add bff_image section, RBAC user-permissions note,\n  [PLUGIN-SPECIFIC] annotations on maintainer fields, improve remoteEntry\n  placeholder\n- BFF_PATTERN.md: fix dashboard port (8443, not 8080/4010), update\n  Containerfile description to UBI9\n- Makefile: document CHART_NAME as help-only, add image-push-frontend and\n  image-push-bff targets for consistency with other per-component variants\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"617e45de5bcff39fe5e43b4f6fd248ec6277422a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/trees/617e45de5bcff39fe5e43b4f6fd248ec6277422a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/commits/311f1b1effb07abd15d7c9d6d3ba26db11873157","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commit/311f1b1effb07abd15d7c9d6d3ba26db11873157","node_id":"C_kwDOTEMGc9oAKDMxMWYxYjFlZmZiMDdhYmQxNWQ3YzlkNmQzYmEyNmRiMTE4NzMxNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commit/577c2ecc1733f43f4e7603d996c9085e9c25d870","sha":"577c2ecc1733f43f4e7603d996c9085e9c25d870","url":"https://api.githu