odel, image,\ninstall (method/helm/prerequisites/instructions), rbac, and support.\n\nUpdate sync-chart-version to handle top-level version field and sync\nimage.tag. Update rename-plugin to apply targeted image URL replacements\non plugin.yaml separately from generic identifier replacements.\n\nCharter issue: rh-ai-community-plugins/charter#1\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"adf764896b8ba4eba7700d449d753c2a192fb191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/trees/adf764896b8ba4eba7700d449d753c2a192fb191"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/commits/27785378cd19624dabf901710f934cff90b7df47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commit/27785378cd19624dabf901710f934cff90b7df47","node_id":"C_kwDOTEMGc9oAKDI3Nzg1Mzc4Y2QxOTYyNGRhYmY5MDE3MTBmOTM0Y2ZmOTBiN2RmNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commit/2df0bde233490c408e103e2c1da2d864578f7344","sha":"2df0bde233490c408e103e2c1da2d864578f7344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commits/2df0bde233490c408e103e2c1da2d864578f7344"}],"sha":"27785378cd19624dabf901710f934cff90b7df47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commits/27785378cd19624dabf901710f934cff90b7df47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commits/2df0bde233490c408e103e2c1da2d864578f7344/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T13:37:19Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T13:37:19Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"refactor: rename plugin from hello-plugin-world to hello-world\n\nSimplify the plugin name across the entire codebase:\n- hello-plugin-world → hello-world (kebab-case)\n- Hello Plugin World → Hello World (title case)\n- hello-world-plugin → hello-world (npm package, Helm chart, K8s services)\n\nUpdate rename-plugin.js to match the new naming: drop the\nhelmReplacements layer (chart name is now just the kebab identifier),\nuse contextual match for the npm package name field, and reorder\nimageReplacements to prevent partial-match collisions.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0aecdbf2b57e0bf4aec754f18122bade6e14225b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/trees/0aecdbf2b57e0bf4aec754f18122bade6e14225b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/commits/2df0bde233490c408e103e2c1da2d864578f7344","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commit/2df