r":{"date":"2026-07-12T20:57:14Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"feat: add rename-plugin script and Claude Code skills for plugin development\n\nAdd scripts/rename-plugin.js to automate renaming all plugin-specific\nidentifiers when forking this seed project. The script supports both\ninteractive mode (with prompts and defaults) and non-interactive mode\n(with CLI flags for coding agents). It updates ~33 files across npm\npackages, webpack/MF config, extensions, hooks, Helm chart, CI, and\ndocs. Also handles icon customization (initials + color).\n\nFix the Icon expose path in config/moduleFederation.js to point to\nthe correct location under src/app/components/.\n\nAdd four Claude Code skills under .claude/skills/:\n- rename-plugin: orchestrate the rename script end-to-end\n- add-page: scaffold a new routed page with nav entry and tests\n- remove-page: cleanly remove a page and all associated artifacts\n- add-bff-endpoint: add an Express route with matching frontend hook\n\nUpdate .gitignore to track .claude/skills/ while excluding local\nsettings and worktrees. Improve .gitignore with proper sections for\na Node.js/TypeScript project.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45b9bce8ce493aa2b7b6bb9dc119aec814a60c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/trees/45b9bce8ce493aa2b7b6bb9dc119aec814a60c61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/commits/8218921af75b4478bd463fabd4822e2d82316177","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/even