.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/commits/6c4f803a0fae8f5b5699e8eb1355be1f6114f00b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T14:47:51Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T14:47:51Z","email":"guimou@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Moutier"},"message":"build: switch container images from Alpine to UBI9\n\nAlign with the odh-dashboard base images to prepare for plugin\ngraduation. Frontend uses ubi9/nodejs-22 builder + ubi9/nginx-124\nruntime; BFF uses ubi9/nodejs-22 for both stages. Follow UBI9\nconventions (--chown=1001:0, USER 1001:0, /opt/app-root/src paths).\n\nAlso includes: markdown lint fixes across docs, package rename to\nhello-world-plugin, version bump to 0.3.0, and eslint/markdownlint\nconfig files.\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b88e279250ca35fc15b34568c06ccc515e5de9aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/trees/b88e279250ca35fc15b34568c06ccc515e5de9aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/commits/6c4f803a0fae8f5b5699e8eb1355be1f6114f00b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi