ce the demo Hello World page with two functional pages that\ndemonstrate real RHOAI dashboard integration patterns:\n\n- User & Projects: displays authenticated user info via /api/status,\n  project/namespace selector, and RBAC permission matrix\n- Cluster Resources: create, list, and delete Deployments and Services\n  via the dashboard''s /api/k8s/* pass-through proxy\n\nAdd community-plugins navigation section (matching kueue-visualizer\nconvention) with Community label flair on both nav items.\n\nNew hooks: useCurrentUser, useProjects, useAccessReview, useK8sResources.\n\nCloses #1, closes #2, closes #3, closes #4\n\n---\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume Moutier <guimou@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26c0cfff9b50d23fa81a54afaa9278cfc56eba79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/trees/26c0cfff9b50d23fa81a54afaa9278cfc56eba79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rh-ai-community-plugins/hello-world/git/commits/c15d366d2f80116ebf22ad420434a58b2da29a8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3944034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimou","id":3944034,"login":"guimou","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDQwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimou/subscriptions","t