onMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/0ae3ac20020d3d5597c130c6d3cc3f7538ff3590/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:24:17Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:24:31Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"test(example): add Vue and Lit MFEs — 4 of 5 built-in adapters now run in CI\n\nTesting plan L7. The Vue and Lit adapters existed but had never run in this\nrepo. The example now hosts four MFEs (React, Svelte, Vue, Lit) and the\ne2e asserts, in both build and dev mode:\n\n- mfe_vue: scoped SFC styles reach the shell (kit CSS injection) and the app\n  is interactive\n- mfe_lit: shadow-DOM styles apply and basePath reaches the element;\n  customElements.define is guarded against redefinition on remount\n\nBoth worked first try. Fault scenarios still pass with four remotes. The\nexample README is rewritten: it still described the specifier-import loader\n(review R7) and a CSS \"rough edge\" fixed in July.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8869a48099d7fb820c185149ac3553b9f5b0ef16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/