users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/dc0a41e780bc64fa8281323fc0e80716ae0057b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:21:49Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:21:49Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"test(example): run the browser e2e against Vite dev servers too\n\nTesting plan L5. Smoke and e2e only ever ran `vite preview` over production\nbuilds, while dev takes a different path — dev-server remotes, Vite''s own CSS\nhandling, the MF dev runtime. `pnpm --filter mfkit-example-minimal e2e:dev`\nruns the same mount/props/tick/styled/no-page-error assertions against `vite`\ndev servers; the build-only strict-CSP check is skipped there. Wired into CI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b21139026a7c15bc2f75ee0130b75db07f01755c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/b21139026a7c15bc2f75ee0130b75db07f01755c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/dc0a41e780bc64fa8281323fc0e80716ae0057b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/dc0a41e780bc64fa8281323fc0e80716ae0057b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTEe9e9oAKGRjMGE0MWU3ODBiYzY0ZmE4MjgxMzIzZmMwZTgwNzE2YWUwMDU3YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/917adf3995590e76668f640fa5149527f213bf66","sha":"917adf3995590e76668f640fa5149527f213bf66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/917adf3995590e76668f640fa5149527f213bf66"}],"sha":"dc0a41e780bc64fa8281323fc0e80716ae0057b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/dc0a41e780bc64fa8281323fc0e80716ae0057b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/917adf3995590e76668f640fa5149527f213bf66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:20:47Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:20:47Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"fix(kit/vite): one slow remote no longer delays the whole shell\n\nReview R10, found by the new slow-remote fault scenario: with a remote\nanswering after 3s, the shell rendered *nothing* for 3s. The MF plugin''s\ndefault shareStrategy, \"version-first\", initializes every remote during the\nhost''s first loadShare to pick the highest shared version, so boot waited on\nthe slowest remote (a hanging one would block it indefinitely; failures were\ncaught, which is why the hard-outage scenario didn''t show it).\n\nmfkitShell now defaults to `shareStrategy: \"loaded-first\"` — the shell''s own\nsingletons are used and remotes load only when an outlet asks. Overridable via\nthe new `shareStrategy` option.\n\nL6 is complete — all six scenarios from the testing plan:\n- slow remote → loading slot, shell interactive meanwhile, exactly 1 request\n- mount throws → quarantined with the mount error as the reason\n- strict strategy → error slot after exactly 1 request (example shell takes\n  `?mfkit-strategy=strict`, which also demonstrates swapping strategies)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",