","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/cd26e23d91b3f28926b59c6f75efe7378662a96c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:18:40Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:18:40Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"feat(kit/vite): injected remote styles honor the host''s CSP nonce\n\nReview O6. Under `style-src ''nonce-…''`, the un-nonced <style> kit injects\nfor each remote was blocked and the MFE rendered unstyled. Nonces are\nper-response, so the snippet reads the host''s at runtime from\n<meta property=\"csp-nonce\" nonce=\"…\"> (Vite''s convention; `html.cspNonce`\nemits it) and copies it onto the <style>.\n\n- happy-dom tests execute the generated snippet (idempotence, nonce, none)\n- example e2e serves the shell behind a strict style CSP via a loopback proxy\n  and asserts the Svelte MFE is styled; verified to fail without the meta\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4e821dae5fc6f553b9e3e52cbdbb175b66f3f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/c4e821dae5fc6f553b9e3e52cbdbb175b66f3f87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/cd26e23d91b3f28926b59c6f75efe7378662a96c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/cd26e23d91b3f28926b59c6f75efe7378662a96c","node_id":"C_kwDOTEe9e9oAKGNkMjZlMjNkOTFiM2YyODkyNmI1OWM2Zjc1ZWZlNzM3ODY2MmE5NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051","sha":"ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051"}],"sha":"cd26e23d91b3f28926b59c6f75efe7378662a96c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/cd26e23d91b3f28926b59c6f75efe7378662a96c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:16:33Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:16:33Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"feat(kit/healing): quarantine cooldown with half-open probes\n\nReview O5. Quarantine lasted until reload, so one bad deploy window kept an\nMFE dark for the life of the tab even after its remote recovered.\n\n- createQuarantineRegistry({ cooldownMs }) — records carry `retryAt`; after\n  it, the record is half-open (new optional `isHalfOpen`, so custom\n  registries still type-check). No cooldown = the old permanent behavior.\n- runWithHealing: a half-open attempt is a single probe. Success clears the\n  record; failure re-quarantines at once without consulting the strategy, so\n  a still-down remote doesn''t get a fresh retry storm.\n- Outlet controller: when quarantined with a cooldown, it schedules its own\n  probe at `retryAt` — recovers without a click or reload; cancelled by\n  stop()/start().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49102f034140017b8cfacaa3ff43d593e1057901","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/49102f034140017b8cfacaa3ff43d593e1057901"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051","node_id":"C_kwDOTEe9e9oAKGVhNzBhYjc2NWQ4NTJlMjRjNDQ3YjgxNjliZmYxMDhjNzhlMTMwNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/5d6c87e37b2c0ec71853a27271e9a722c703d52b","sha":"5d6c87e37b2c0ec71853a27271e9a722c703d52b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/5d6c87e37b2c0ec71853a27271e9a722c703d52b"}],"sha":"ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/ea70ab765d852e24c447b8169bff108c78e13051"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/5d6c87e37b2c0ec71853a27271e9a722c703d52b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:15:07Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:15:07Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"feat(kit): resolveConfig pipeline; plugins, discovery, and healing are live\n\nReview A1. Plugin surfaces were typed but nothing ran them. New\n`resolveConfig(config, { cwd })` in @mfkit/kit is the single place a manifest\nbecomes the config every consumer uses:\n\n- validates (defineConfig), then shape-checks plugin/strategy objects with\n  aggregated, path-addressed errors\n- healing: config.healing > last plugin''s > undefined (forgiving at runtime)\n- adapters: later plugins win; opts.adapters still win over all\n- discovery: config.discovery then plugins in order; discovered entries are\n  added, never replace a declared name (invariant 4), later strategies win\n  ties; the merged list is re-validated\n- every plugin setup runs once, in order, with the resolved config\n- memoized per config object; failures are not memoized\n\nmfkitMFE/mfkitShell resolve first, so discovered MFEs land in the shell''s\nremotes map (`root` option sets the discovery cwd). At runtime,\n`<MFKitProvider config={config}>` defaults entries and strategy from the\nmanifest, and resolveHealingStrategy honors plugins.\n\nplugin-api: JSDoc updated for the now-wired surfaces; discovery precedence\ndocumented as manifest-wins (it was unconsumed, so nothing relied on the old\nwording).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e6c67b2252ed1881e3a00871dbdb50b2a98519a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/7e6c67b2252ed1881e3a00871dbdb50b2a98519a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/5d6c87e37b2c0ec71853a27271e9a722c703d52b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka/mfkit/commit/5d6