/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/11d2e6273b72807e422296126d9ccc5cb6282aa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:56:10Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:56:10Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"docs: project review, testing & evaluation plan, README and CLAUDE.md refresh\n\n- docs/project-review-2026-10.md: fixed bugs R1-R6, open findings O1-O9,\n  architecture moves A1-A6, milestone sequencing\n- docs/testing-and-evaluation.md: test layers L1-L8, adoptability\n  evaluation E1-E6, quality gates per milestone\n- README: 60-second tour, install, \"what works today\" matrix, when not to\n  use MFKit\n- CLAUDE.md: doc index, easy-to-get-wrong facts, conventions, commands\n- port-resolution wording in architecture/design-decisions/integration-guide\n- track docs/ideas.md and docs/mfe-landscape.md (now linked from README)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"293e475551f2efbfea7504fe6a6d54c878570978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/293e475551f2efbfea7504fe6a6d54c878570978"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/11d2e6273b72807e422296126d9ccc5cb6282aa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","ht