ers/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/0131a4a6d78a87da2d4dea6873e074244f90bb71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:56:10Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:56:10Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"chore: open-source scaffolding, CI hardening, require Node >= 22\n\n- CONTRIBUTING, Code of Conduct (Contributor Covenant 2.1), SECURITY policy\n- issue forms, PR template with the invariant checklist, CODEOWNERS,\n  dependabot (grouped), .editorconfig, .nvmrc\n- CI: read-only permissions, PR concurrency, Node 22/24 matrix, separate\n  example job with a generated-artifact drift check, publint +\n  are-the-types-wrong on every package\n- release: npm provenance (id-token: write), serialized publishes\n- npm keywords/engines, canonical git+https repository URLs\n- engines.node >= 22 everywhere (Node 20 EOL 2026-04), @types/node ^22\n- lint no longer trips on per-developer .claude/settings.local.json\n- changeset for the fixes and the engines bump (0.1.0-alpha.1)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2635fe577e9c92d4a7a8dfac60cb26378875cd50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/2635fe577e9c92d4a7a8dfac60cb26378875cd50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/0131a4a6d78a87da2d4dea6873e074244f90bb71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a