e-step toVersion === fromVersion + 1 invariant), MigrationContext / MigrationResult / MigrationLogger, module-level registry (registerCodemod /\n   listCodemods / planMigration / __resetRegistry), CodemodRegistryError.\n  - src/cli.ts — mfkit-migrate with list / plan --from N --to N / up --from N --to N [--dry-run] / help. Extracted main(argv, io) so tests don''t shell out. Auto-detects direct invocation via\n  import.meta.url so importing the file in tests doesn''t run it.\n  - src/index.ts — re-exports the public surface.\n  - tests/ — 29 tests covering registry semantics (ordering, idempotency, gap/ambiguity/downgrade rejection, validation) and CLI exit codes + output for every subcommand path.\n  - tsconfig.json includes tests/**/*; @types/node added for process / URL.\n  - README.md rewritten with the actual CLI + a v0.3+ authoring example.\n  - CLAUDE.md Phase 1 status updated.","tree":{"sha":"db2c2e819358ce20b0dd66c9cfb01d74c3995841","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/db2c2e819358ce20b0dd66c9cfb01d74c3995841"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/f82be8a3afd80fb0d54b510c5215f2d3807cdc71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur