r"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T17:38:02Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"mfkit/kit/types subpath:\n  - generateRemoteTypes(config, opts?) — pure manifest → ambient .d.ts string, emits declare module \"<name>/<expose>\" blocks typed as MFEDefinition. Deterministic; handles default ./lifecycle,\n   custom exposes, and empty manifests.\n  - writeRemoteTypes(config, opts?) — persists to .mfkit/generated/remotes.d.ts (configurable), skips writes when content matches byte-for-byte.\n  - watchRemoteTypes(config, opts) — thin fs.watch wrapper taking a consumer reload() callback (kit doesn''t parse mfkit.config.ts itself — keeps \"manifest is the SoT\" decoupled from authoring\n  format). Forgiving by default: errors route through onError.","tree":{"sha":"b6ca825c54026b12824124669de98e34a972f6d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/b6ca825c54026b12824124669de98e34a972f6d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/b404066903e2bd417396bea1ad1a1fac455a91ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35594926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://