","html_url":"https://github.com/RJonMshka","id":35594926,"login":"RJonMshka","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk0OTI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RJonMshka","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/commits/d5d86949bd6f7eaeb09de8117812b67de9a0a6a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:45:21Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T05:45:21Z","email":"rajat1996kumar@gmail.com","name":"Rajat Kumar"},"message":"All behavior routes through the HealingStrategy\n  contract in @mfkit/plugin-api so enterprises can swap defaults without\n  touching the runner, outlet, or version check.\n\n  - forgivingStrategy / strictStrategy — default factories\n  - runWithHealing — orchestrator with retry/quarantine/fail, AbortSignal,\n    and a maxAttempts safety net against misbehaving custom strategies\n  - createQuarantineRegistry — shared give-up state across outlets\n  - checkSingletonVersion + SingletonVersionError — version-skew gate\n  - createManifestCache + memoryManifestStorage — last-known-good fallback\n  - resolveHealingStrategy — config.healing ?? forgivingStrategy()","tree":{"sha":"85ad5bcff2d9b4dbfab70f475709e5860fffa886","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/trees/85ad5bcff2d9b4dbfab70f475709e5860fffa886"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RJonMshka/mfkit/git/commits/d5d86949bd6f7eaeb09de8117812b67de9a0a6a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht