.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/347be1e9620e6930641245477a50986e163c4988/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:20:22Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"miltonejones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T18:20:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix toast federation loading error, restyle visualizer title, mobile player spacing (#9)\n\n- Toast component used toSignal() from @angular/core/rxjs-interop, a deep\n  subpath that Native Federation''s shareAll() doesn''t expose, breaking\n  module resolution at runtime. Switched to a manual subscription writing\n  into a signal, matching the pattern already used elsewhere (CastButton).\n- Restyled the visualizer''s \"SkyTunes\" title: smaller, regular weight,\n  moved to the top-right with an accent-gradient fill so it reads as a\n  title above the bars instead of a faint bottom-corner watermark.\n- Added 0.5rem gap between the audio player''s stacked rows on mobile.\n- Simplified the cast button icon to always show the broadcast-tower glyph.","tree":{"sha":"ef937ab3991f390f7c055604b8045a38fab75cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/trees/ef937ab3991f390f7c055604b8045a38fab75cab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/commits/347be1e9620e6930641245477a50986e163c4988","verification":{"payload":"tree ef937ab3991f390f7c055604b8045a38fab75cab\nparent 43270e10632a222d6dbbfba9c358971f445ee476\nauthor miltonejones <miltonejones@gmail.com> 1782411622 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782411622 -0500\n\nFix toast federation loading error, restyle visualizer title, mobile player spacing (#9)\n\n- Toast component used toSignal() from @angular/core/rxjs-interop, a deep\n  subpath that Native Federation''s shareAll() doesn''t expose, breaking\n  module resolution at runtime. Switched to a manual subscription writing\n  into a signal, matching the pattern already used elsewhere (CastButton).\n- Restyled the visualizer''s \"SkyTunes\" title: smaller, regular weight,\n  moved to the top-right with an accent-gradient fill so it reads as a\n  title above the bars instead of a faint bottom-corner watermark.\n- Added 0.5rem gap between the audio player''s stacked rows on mobile.\n- Simplified the cast button icon to always show the broadcast-tower glyph.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPXFmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKaoQABtoezFj0I9WiA/XqAy6yFvs\n649HBYCE80QudNuo8L91hoq3Y9r+GPHYswuPyxQ2GeR3ZWOapQSbbYG8ywdtkYvC\nI4IyMEZ27Scynl7t2ne9z5yNVPD1xikTOt9y2jGFFiOIywfe1Zps/Asdc1io26uR\nQR6H3godcLE/imxctpx8yZC3h90sGJ9IcPN43pzI+82qBenHBxfHBuYby+lg0DWx\na7IrSyLDaE/p1SU4X1ZlbQJ87uC6qKlTLdaR6JuCUbU/1Gyy6rdudVSOhrepNuyp\nDDAcZMLUofgFG7fGSP9JxH3Lrn9Cae9Lt+MKynmfQX3QxQagLRzAZijJNzD3t5d1\nMCZvDfZZzLUcxB0xS8pRa57p14BkKu84mltxeJ48DbewNpYYHSVjgC8wYjZ9hx+y\n0gVgGLjBY/PsfK0BQkfkDYtliyy/zcQtQD5qym/U7B9zY+txwrix06XBt/RigWqm\noPxWk29C9WGCDv7423rl9onLv/sF1Ns+hqXEQTKTkY5ISZ1wk8MPOGXWaANnhCSz\nDeyps40TeMqpb9