sers/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/43270e10632a222d6dbbfba9c358971f445ee476/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T16:10:22Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"miltonejones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T16:10:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix Cast volume control and add toast on successful cast connection (#8)\n\nThe Cast CAF Sender SDK''s setVolumeLevel() takes no argument; volume\nmust be set on remotePlayer.volumeLevel first, then pushed via the\nno-arg call (same pattern as seekTo/seek()). The slider previously\nupdated local state but never changed the receiver''s volume.\n\nAlso adds a lightweight ToastService/Toast component in shared-utils\nand shows \"Casting to <device>\" when a Cast session connects.","tree":{"sha":"5b8763bc7af27e834b16cc9157c7ad2df68db823","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/trees/5b8763bc7af27e834b16cc9157c7ad2df68db823"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/commits/43270e10632a222d6dbbfba9c358971f445ee476","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b8763bc7af27e834b16cc9157c7ad2df68db823\nparent 88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935\nauthor miltonejones <miltonejones@gmail.com> 1782403822 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782403822 -0500\n\nFix Cast volume control and add toast on successful cast connection (#8)\n\nThe Cast CAF Sender SDK''s setVolumeLevel() takes no argument; volume\nmust be set on remotePlayer.volumeLevel first, then pushed via the\nno-arg call (same pattern as seekTo/seek()). The slider previously\nupdated local state but never changed the receiver''s volume.\n\nAlso adds a lightweight ToastService/Toast component in shared-utils\nand shows \"Casting to <device>\" when a Cast session connects.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPVLuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgAoQAH5yc2y7jOFbazoEXTh2CS6Q\nZiP7Xtn+ykMY7aw/pLMDEPPhNBMRIIUMxqcicRI6ZhnSy4VA9db4zBTXk0CaOHVO\n8cqB/2qXbff4zyPlWYMbHHAN65YejuQo0+Yo8ZwZTlC4q0+tA7EgNJFNcxRtRKJc\nLTBl2DtiEM2VP0gU2Zcoobhz5EbEGThl3bkghTFcdEgN44Qa5yauhHyKSHVxgnUW\nxLTx1eoHy80q3rl1C+skzu/4/0xQSww9/9dhEfW6rwkPgPR+yfMz57ebbMvW+7ZC\nJ1akVTVV2ADWKBi1lq3npvUOVnJWRgYsbEjDIjSH1Ka6uJkulZpQlyP+KsA2VpD4\n2Qp3cMGDNXuD1g3R75eflWWgFPKKPrxOv0B+j261UXI8rCN3FhJTD8IOVT82UeGZ\nn/AbX9odhc52jVPlTcd7vkLL7Eurz3LukRdCYQRi40PEu8JKF3oFATAaEqgmcVBA\n1DUqDuUx9T7M8wI+w368a6ElQTNz++W85Gk1Lyyq107uPZxQNG+XFLMB8BwoJtGY\nW5QtpboYkY2tEJxNpf7gWk5S3+rbgN/aO7+DcNXSCdEm7fo1r83MTsnYQiRKYmtA\nHd6mzEvaHSgejdqvxxp/w7xMLUWNG79w6gYaienR5BM539h6hdOupMMf/6UcFr4O\nLCVCPzOHyVeH5A0XBAUp\n=MG5P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-25T16:10:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commit/43270e10632a222d6dbbfba9c358971f445ee476","node_id":"C_kwDOTElJHNoAKDQzMjcwZTEwNjMyYTIyMmQ2ZGJiZmJhOWMzNTg5NzFmNDQ1ZWU0NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commit/88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935","sha":"88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935"}],"sha":"43270e10632a222d6dbbfba9c358971f445ee476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/43270e10632a222d6dbbfba9c358971f445ee476"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/7a6b6b49c75416b2a64d080d6486d0c85a598a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:47:00Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"miltonejones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:47:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Cast volume slider and Media Session API (#7)\n\n* Add Google Cast support for audio playback\n\n- Create CastService wrapping the Cast CAF SDK (session, remote playback, position sync)\n- Add CastButton component with connect/disconnect and device name display\n- Update AudioPlayer to delegate play/pause/seek to CastService when connected\n- Add seamless handoff between local and Cast playback (position preserved)\n- Auto-advance queue on Cast track end\n- Show Cast overlay in visualizer panel during active Cast session\n- Load Cast SDK from gstatic CDN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix cast icon: use fa-broadcast-tower (free) instead of fa-cast (pro)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Duck Cast volume during TTS announcements and add .claude to gitignore\n\n- Cast device volume ducks to 30% during announcements so TTS is heard locally\n- Cast volume restores to 100% when announcement finishes\n- Add .claude/ to .gitignore to prevent local settings from being tracked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix announcing state stuck to true during Cast playback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix local playback not starting after announcement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add play/stop and shuffle buttons to artist banner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix visualizer Cast overlay: reactive local signals, device name retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll receiver.friendlyName for 5 seconds after connect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: read receiver.friendlyName from event session directly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: try all known SDK property paths with deferred retry\n\n* Hide Home button from toolbar nav on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast connection toast: shows ''Now casting to [name]'' or ''Failed to get device name''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast auto-advance skipping tracks: guard against transient IDLE state during track load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix banner stop button: actually pause audio when track is cleared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast disconnect on page load: stopInternal should not disconnect Cast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll session every 400ms for 3s before giving up\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove Cast toast/device-name complexity: always just show ''Casting'' in the visualizer overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide visualizer entirely when casting (no overlay, no toggle button)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Shrink visualizer 20%, add SkyTunes watermark, disable artist link on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide pagination when only one page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Guard CastService init and SW fetch against non-http requests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep screen awake while music is playing via Screen Wake Lock API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wake lock on isPlaying signal: keeps screen awake during Cast too\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Media Session API: track info, playback controls, and position sync on lock screen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast volume slider to audio player when casting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b08cc5a7756365e5a233ebb84239cabe541c05e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/trees/b08cc5a7756365e5a233ebb84239cabe541c05e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/commits/7a6b6b49c75416b2a64d080d6486d0c85a598a00","verification":{"payload":"tree b08cc5a7756365e5a233ebb84239cabe541c05e4\nparent d57e34022b06e81ac7c4d7333f35f2a74953587f\nauthor miltonejones <miltonejones@gmail.com> 1782402420 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782402420 -0500\n\nCast volume slider and Media Session API (#7)\n\n* Add Google Cast support for audio playback\n\n- Create CastService wrapping the Cast CAF SDK (session, remote playback, position sync)\n- Add CastButton component with connect/disconnect and device name display\n- Update AudioPlayer to delegate play/pause/seek to CastService when connected\n- Add seamless handoff between local and Cast playback (position preserved)\n- Auto-advance queue on Cast track end\n- Show Cast overlay in visualizer panel during active Cast session\n- Load Cast SDK from gstatic CDN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix cast icon: use fa-broadcast-tower (free) instead of fa-cast (pro)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Duck Cast volume during TTS announcements and add .claude to gitignore\n\n- Cast device volume ducks to 30% during announcements so TTS is heard locally\n- Cast volume restores to 100% when announcement finishes\n- Add .claude/ to .gitignore to prevent local settings from being tracked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix announcing state stuck to true during Cast playback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix local playback not starting after announcement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add play/stop and shuffle buttons to artist banner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix visualizer Cast overlay: reactive local signals, device name retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll receiver.friendlyName for 5 seconds after connect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: read receiver.friendlyName from event session directly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: try all known SDK property paths with deferred retry\n\n* Hide Home button from toolbar nav on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast connection toast: shows ''Now casting to [name]'' or ''Failed to get device name''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast auto-advance skipping tracks: guard against transient IDLE state during track load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix banner stop button: actually pause audio when track is cleared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast disconnect on page load: stopInternal should not disconnect Cast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll session every 400ms for 3s before giving up\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove Cast toast/device-name complexity: always just show ''Casting'' in the visualizer overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide visualizer entirely when casting (no overlay, no toggle button)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Shrink visualizer 20%, add SkyTunes watermark, disable artist link on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide pagination when only one page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Guard CastService init and SW fetch against non-http requests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep screen awake while music is playing via Screen Wake Lock API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wake lock on isPlaying signal: keeps screen awake during Cast too\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Media Session API: track info, playback controls, and position sync on lock screen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast volume slider to audio player when casting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPU10CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASn8QAJa5B0ojiHZE0ZkSomrCA5eD\nnHCaV3gOre7Iv20Gczg48z2/f5rx+/c5Snr2RzfstA+XvDIWeMEaz4vkkAOFV8w0\nfBzlargKfCMncDenK/84B6OHb3rt03dYCph7lvjZ76xO1HO2C1FIHxpQFVnBcgit\nWsxNzhzRyRd+NfFI9a4pGg3hUATKcR3JukBanSZwZSsh46MaMQAc9UqxSULpzg0w\nakwHUMcjDwjE8gdzrZADEZPUgG26v5bvkAkg9T4z8gtj6lUeHFWxO+tMfxpn2Nj5\nN3BlyzHC5+QPW5thdeF59ueNPEysh2pf8r1WLYfezOYnbF7Onp71X2TorABJxgQu\n2PBkhliWg6JH0mbJYWtK6abL1vZIOflV8J7FRZFUUGl1lxWgqeEmAiiean4fVSwz\n3c5ee/gJjiTAxoYmFMT24bUKPX3dOMt77SHnhJvufNCh84lS7Tq3i4mFWED3ecwB\n582JhWJlPnWjdsJAcyJQkzalXOSMbHCdNKQtrfvokSRpXGPpY30NHjOfByGmrrAU\nnOIbch+Zsg121c8iQ0Im9M4it+60FBrEfJOWKrMZk/zM7y06BTuaTnUa0Qv2bNz2\nu1dxnzwudCgLE/By4QKP8rDHeH9weyyTpJ0RRX4R117BOJwWLfpoOVeFZxbpOgcf\nxpvIExyMy94rV3mDDZvO\n=NbgI\n-----END PG