DQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commit/88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935","node_id":"C_kwDOTElJHNoAKDg4ZDU5NmU0NGFkMWI4OTI0NGQ4Yjc0MTFmMzViZDhlNWYwZDc5MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commit/171282981be65c3192a26f3fa4853fae5b2d62ca","sha":"171282981be65c3192a26f3fa4853fae5b2d62ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/171282981be65c3192a26f3fa4853fae5b2d62ca"}],"sha":"88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/88d596e44ad1b89244d8b7411f35bd8e5f0d7935"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/d57e34022b06e81ac7c4d7333f35f2a74953587f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:18:53Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"miltonejones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:18:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Media Session API: lock screen track info and playback controls (#6)\n\n* Add Google Cast support for audio playback\n\n- Create CastService wrapping the Cast CAF SDK (session, remote playback, position sync)\n- Add CastButton component with connect/disconnect and device name display\n- Update AudioPlayer to delegate play/pause/seek to CastService when connected\n- Add seamless handoff between local and Cast playback (position preserved)\n- Auto-advance queue on Cast track end\n- Show Cast overlay in visualizer panel during active Cast session\n- Load Cast SDK from gstatic CDN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix cast icon: use fa-broadcast-tower (free) instead of fa-cast (pro)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Duck Cast volume during TTS announcements and add .claude to gitignore\n\n- Cast device volume ducks to 30% during announcements so TTS is heard locally\n- Cast volume restores to 100% when announcement finishes\n- Add .claude/ to .gitignore to prevent local settings from being tracked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix announcing state stuck to true during Cast playback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix local playback not starting after announcement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add play/stop and shuffle buttons to artist banner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix visualizer Cast overlay: reactive local signals, device name retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll receiver.friendlyName for 5 seconds after connect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: read receiver.friendlyName from event session directly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: try all known SDK property paths with deferred retry\n\n* Hide Home button from toolbar nav on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast connection toast: shows ''Now casting to [name]'' or ''Failed to get device name''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast auto-advance skipping tracks: guard against transient IDLE state during track load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix banner stop button: actually pause audio when track is cleared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast disconnect on page load: stopInternal should not disconnect Cast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll session every 400ms for 3s before giving up\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove Cast toast/device-name complexity: always just show ''Casting'' in the visualizer overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide visualizer entirely when casting (no overlay, no toggle button)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Shrink visualizer 20%, add SkyTunes watermark, disable artist link on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide pagination when only one page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Guard CastService init and SW fetch against non-http requests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep screen awake while music is playing via Screen Wake Lock API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wake lock on isPlaying signal: keeps screen awake during Cast too\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Media Session API: track info, playback controls, and position sync on lock screen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39853a38da99667c06d868ad16595b6af29bbea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/trees/39853a38da99667c06d868ad16595b6af29bbea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/commits/d57e34022b06e81ac7c4d7333f35f2a74953587f","verification":{"payload":"tree 39853a38da99667c06d868ad16595b6af29bbea6\nparent e84b9a0a3733ea76ed9e182c08711a86cbe74d25\nauthor miltonejones <miltonejones@gmail.com> 1782400733 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782400733 -0500\n\nMedia Session API: lock screen track info and playback controls (#6)\n\n* Add Google Cast support for audio playback\n\n- Create CastService wrapping the Cast CAF SDK (session, remote playback, position sync)\n- Add CastButton component with connect/disconnect and device name display\n- Update AudioPlayer to delegate play/pause/seek to CastService when connected\n- Add seamless handoff between local and Cast playback (position preserved)\n- Auto-advance queue on Cast track end\n- Show Cast overlay in visualizer panel during active Cast session\n- Load Cast SDK from gstatic CDN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix cast icon: use fa-broadcast-tower (free) instead of fa-cast (pro)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Duck Cast volume during TTS announcements and add .claude to gitignore\n\n- Cast device volume ducks to 30% during announcements so TTS is heard locally\n- Cast volume restores to 100% when announcement finishes\n- Add .claude/ to .gitignore to prevent local settings from being tracked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix announcing state stuck to true during Cast playback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix local playback not starting after announcement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add play/stop and shuffle buttons to artist banner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix visualizer Cast overlay: reactive local signals, device name retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll receiver.friendlyName for 5 seconds after connect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: read receiver.friendlyName from event session directly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: try all known SDK property paths with deferred retry\n\n* Hide Home button from toolbar nav on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast connection toast: shows ''Now casting to [name]'' or ''Failed to get device name''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast auto-advance skipping tracks: guard against transient IDLE state during track load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix banner stop button: actually pause audio when track is cleared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast disconnect on page load: stopInternal should not disconnect Cast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll session every 400ms for 3s before giving up\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove Cast toast/device-name complexity: always just show ''Casting'' in the visualizer overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide visualizer entirely when casting (no overlay, no toggle button)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Shrink visualizer 20%, add SkyTunes watermark, disable artist link on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide pagination when only one page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Guard CastService init and SW fetch against non-http requests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep screen awake while music is playing via Screen Wake Lock API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wake lock on isPlaying signal: keeps screen awake during Cast too\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Media Session API: track info, playback controls, and position sync on lock screen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPUbdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHSkQAJEgyIwqG35xnlHMFGoRn3Ri\n3DLJnVEWLxU9a2C8J+z5K28O/dUGPU7sGI50Pw4zPYC58++U+V5gz8WEjcBHX15U\nB4vi5kn0n56/2Havx5nR7NlYbB7g3Ke69L/4XkLcNcl8tz/s0z0ZbvWJ7Fq3Dg0+\n5i99F80TGWMfo57ryfunzF6PI9lKxdikJVdPwfYZKyjNeYbVsT5HRkFg3XB8NqBK\ndfDL/KxcBPCbbx+IIsqRSz3IXR7omrExScIML1HSA4VRXO4XcY5W3SnJQlimQcX+\nm9LhuSXEChpZhKgNQmp0PWC4W2v3sWSvB/uVxFO4qBKIjgM55pdI2SpVBos0KAUO\ntDgchC6Mt6IUVKNnmPZfW6FOCMY2mbn9Gl0bRBezCGtvr0lHbabzqJI6GqsNpCWk\nna+GFC0DrBlsfRe8V51lWQYn8on98M+fq55s1nX4hjGxuy8z4lT33xbz0SVHOJXT\n9PFWaA5dSd9csWTTB++uEODdVCSEsF+jFm78Mjwzs00XqFocs7wDdmgwxzqKRuy9\nM+S+HCFfZ9CxU2ptBwEGyVkvgHGVBBJL4J1MW89AI1PwyZ64cbr7bZ6YIT3wB7Pv\nTw8/efbZwnmhCt6RxR0xIusaFdNG44g+BKwJxrHlzw7VgACe/CaklHgiUOib+wNY\nRRbETdSbR85uQxGrpfhk\n=MhaA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-25T15:18:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gi