view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commit/73bde933cd57db3e3742a33ce0973feca17b8aca","node_id":"C_kwDOTElJHNoAKDczYmRlOTMzY2Q1N2RiM2UzNzQyYTMzY2UwOTczZmVjYTE3YjhhY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commit/5e6bda42d42049be2e55b7eb29b4a8271dee2783","sha":"5e6bda42d42049be2e55b7eb29b4a8271dee2783","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/5e6bda42d42049be2e55b7eb29b4a8271dee2783"}],"sha":"73bde933cd57db3e3742a33ce0973feca17b8aca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/73bde933cd57db3e3742a33ce0973feca17b8aca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28455725?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/miltonejones","id":28455725,"login":"miltonejones","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDU1NzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miltonejones","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/commits/e84b9a0a3733ea76ed9e182c08711a86cbe74d25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:06:39Z","email":"miltonejones@gmail.com","name":"miltonejones"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:06:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Screen wake lock, visualizer polish, service worker fixes, and mobile tweaks (#5)\n\n* Add Google Cast support for audio playback\n\n- Create CastService wrapping the Cast CAF SDK (session, remote playback, position sync)\n- Add CastButton component with connect/disconnect and device name display\n- Update AudioPlayer to delegate play/pause/seek to CastService when connected\n- Add seamless handoff between local and Cast playback (position preserved)\n- Auto-advance queue on Cast track end\n- Show Cast overlay in visualizer panel during active Cast session\n- Load Cast SDK from gstatic CDN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix cast icon: use fa-broadcast-tower (free) instead of fa-cast (pro)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Duck Cast volume during TTS announcements and add .claude to gitignore\n\n- Cast device volume ducks to 30% during announcements so TTS is heard locally\n- Cast volume restores to 100% when announcement finishes\n- Add .claude/ to .gitignore to prevent local settings from being tracked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix announcing state stuck to true during Cast playback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix local playback not starting after announcement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add play/stop and shuffle buttons to artist banner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix visualizer Cast overlay: reactive local signals, device name retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll receiver.friendlyName for 5 seconds after connect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: read receiver.friendlyName from event session directly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: try all known SDK property paths with deferred retry\n\n* Hide Home button from toolbar nav on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast connection toast: shows ''Now casting to [name]'' or ''Failed to get device name''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast auto-advance skipping tracks: guard against transient IDLE state during track load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix banner stop button: actually pause audio when track is cleared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast disconnect on page load: stopInternal should not disconnect Cast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll session every 400ms for 3s before giving up\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove Cast toast/device-name complexity: always just show ''Casting'' in the visualizer overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide visualizer entirely when casting (no overlay, no toggle button)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Shrink visualizer 20%, add SkyTunes watermark, disable artist link on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide pagination when only one page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Guard CastService init and SW fetch against non-http requests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep screen awake while music is playing via Screen Wake Lock API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wake lock on isPlaying signal: keeps screen awake during Cast too\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5c5750b37bea4a70c68ccbd89e91f485713589c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/trees/f5c5750b37bea4a70c68ccbd89e91f485713589c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/miltonejones/micro-tunes/git/commits/e84b9a0a3733ea76ed9e182c08711a86cbe74d25","verification":{"payload":"tree f5c5750b37bea4a70c68ccbd89e91f485713589c\nparent 2a2328d120cc5480132cf17d051505e6c06b2e10\nauthor miltonejones <miltonejones@gmail.com> 1782399999 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782399999 -0500\n\nScreen wake lock, visualizer polish, service worker fixes, and mobile tweaks (#5)\n\n* Add Google Cast support for audio playback\n\n- Create CastService wrapping the Cast CAF SDK (session, remote playback, position sync)\n- Add CastButton component with connect/disconnect and device name display\n- Update AudioPlayer to delegate play/pause/seek to CastService when connected\n- Add seamless handoff between local and Cast playback (position preserved)\n- Auto-advance queue on Cast track end\n- Show Cast overlay in visualizer panel during active Cast session\n- Load Cast SDK from gstatic CDN\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix cast icon: use fa-broadcast-tower (free) instead of fa-cast (pro)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Duck Cast volume during TTS announcements and add .claude to gitignore\n\n- Cast device volume ducks to 30% during announcements so TTS is heard locally\n- Cast volume restores to 100% when announcement finishes\n- Add .claude/ to .gitignore to prevent local settings from being tracked\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix announcing state stuck to true during Cast playback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix local playback not starting after announcement\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add play/stop and shuffle buttons to artist banner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix visualizer Cast overlay: reactive local signals, device name retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll receiver.friendlyName for 5 seconds after connect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: read receiver.friendlyName from event session directly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: try all known SDK property paths with deferred retry\n\n* Hide Home button from toolbar nav on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Cast connection toast: shows ''Now casting to [name]'' or ''Failed to get device name''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast auto-advance skipping tracks: guard against transient IDLE state during track load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix banner stop button: actually pause audio when track is cleared\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast disconnect on page load: stopInternal should not disconnect Cast\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cast device name: poll session every 400ms for 3s before giving up\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Remove Cast toast/device-name complexity: always just show ''Casting'' in the visualizer overlay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide visualizer entirely when casting (no overlay, no toggle button)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Shrink visualizer 20%, add SkyTunes watermark, disable artist link on mobile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Hide pagination when only one page\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Guard CastService init and SW fetch against non-http requests\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Keep screen awake while music is playing via Screen Wake Lock API\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Wake lock on isPlaying signal: keeps screen awake during Cast too\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPUP/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtbwQAJKXvitu5eCrJQJYtbjDUgDF\nGG/8rHjQbYfCRdRtlPX+MXTUMO0/uC6VeDIPs/Z7elETl4D2OzKOFsv4KqFxKiGi\nNYyf1+bXKbc2vkwXqhTjyEUjG6xfrD/k1BS7EzM8jLbYQE3O/vzbQ34Y5OtTaJS7\nvNJoLdIAhasW+isGiJ+AnD4aEnG+Yfb8/dmvwWByKjNEuTS3HU3r7uew/f9T3vcv\nYoRv+D0fbYFI/N4clfeHvIK75LcSlJo8H3n7W8TfGgL4+8LMf/qT0S2wZs+L1fJN\nyTADhDevSYVe6DtPpa/slBnL8UJVBNV7W731hqPBMiyyrSzUH2YvPyL4ku3vJVTH\nLjoxr4f22oXEnRXp7bU046SKGD/edSkUxkEEQuL36zGU6pIAwAzoXD1ukvy3Nd10\n+v80FEG4gDz+MBeoH/rAJ2Vj5mmwlskEUMTdHgiwhKyidQDxeg/JJ0znNjYhZD4r\n3ElJ/qabQxAFnRJ7MUQcQ/+z8w68xtm1czOEvsCVx3+1PXRiz+P2AJbdR2dX9BSe\nVJtfV0UZXAct4zAZADuMNHRL9Resa3Tw19sZ4ilgPK8HI9n7UmW8FFk3g+7oQh6H\n5WX96VlNDongqh2FkIeKS3dycHgTcRYQtTG+SJWiiv7K7lJQlR7SuVoxaM/TkK0a\nojn22VQE3HVC7aUCKWbc\n=ah4D\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-25T15:06:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User