llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapiruwandercode94","id":292451294,"login":"tapiruwandercode94","node_id":"U_kgDOEW5z3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commits/1afb58e32c5eb6c07992e6255978624eb1ac7b46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T11:54:42Z","email":"tapiruwandercode94@gmail.com","name":"TapiruWanderCode94"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T11:54:42Z","email":"tapiruwandercode94@gmail.com","name":"TapiruWanderCode94"},"message":"feat: add Dockerfile, docker-compose, helm and terraform for apps/docs\n\nAstro Starlight docs site gets the same deploy shape as servers/auth\n(turbo prune Dockerfile, Traefik-routed docker-compose at docs.localhost,\nNodePort+Ingress Helm chart registered as module \"docs\" in root terraform).\n\nAlso fixes several pre-existing bugs that blocked docs from ever actually\nbuilding: missing starlight-versions dependency/removed since it requires a\nreal version snapshot that was never created, outdated Starlight config\nsyntax (social/autogenerate), two content files missing required title\nfrontmatter, and a telemetry write crash under the unprivileged container\nuser. Verified end-to-end: built the image, ran the container, curled real\npages, and rendered the Helm chart.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00da54db9896e946a23a760a3723292560203f3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/trees/00da54db9896e946a23a760a3723292560203f3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/commits/1afb58e32c5eb6c07992e6255978624eb1ac7b46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292451294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapiruwandercode94","id":292451294,"login":"tapiruwandercode94","node_id":"U_kgDOEW5z3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commit/1afb58e32c5eb6c07992e6255978624eb1ac7b46","node_id":"C_kwDOTEooENoAKDFhZmI1OGUzMmM1ZWI2YzA3OTkyZTYyNTU5Nzg2MjRlYjFhYzdiNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commit/07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80bb07976c78d709bcf1","sha":"07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80bb07976c78d709bcf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commits/07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80