rojects into\ntheir own directory''s centralized file instead of root.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63034960c91d9db267c2a6df31f16c3ae6f247ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/trees/63034960c91d9db267c2a6df31f16c3ae6f247ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/commits/07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80bb07976c78d709bcf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292451294?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tapiruwandercode94","id":292451294,"login":"tapiruwandercode94","node_id":"U_kgDOEW5z3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tapiruwandercode94","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commit/07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80bb07976c78d709bcf1","node_id":"C_kwDOTEooENoAKDA3ZTIyZTZmYjFlM2IyNTI1NTFiODBiYjA3OTc2Yzc4ZDcwOWJjZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commit/9413c6f4fbe81bb8ceab8626287e3a60bbcd006e","sha":"9413c6f4fbe81bb8ceab8626287e3a60bbcd006e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commits/9413c6f4fbe81bb8ceab8626287e3a60bbcd006e"}],"sha":"07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80bb07976c78d709bcf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commits/07e22e6fb1e3b252551b80bb07976c78d709bcf1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50095107?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardLim1994","id":50095107,"login":"EdwardLim1994","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDk1MTA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commits/9413c6f4fbe81bb8ceab8626287e3a60bbcd006e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T10:34:49Z","email":"edwardlimkoksiong1994@gmail.com","name":"Edward Lim Kok Siong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T10:34:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: full mTLS for internal service-to-service traffic (#82)\n\n* feat: add full mTLS for internal service-to-service traffic\n\nVault-issued mTLS across the web -> Apollo Router -> subgraph (-> future grpc)\nflow: GrpcDriver/ApolloDriver gain an optional tls config (ServerCredentials\ncreateSsl / a TLS-capable fork of startStandaloneServer, since Apollo''s own\nhardcodes plain http.createServer), backed by a new VaultTlsAdapter issuing\nshort-lived leaf certs from Vault''s PKI secrets engine (same AppRole per\nserver already used for dynamic DB creds). Wired end-to-end for auth <->\nApollo Router (the only real peers in this repo today) in both docker-compose\nand Helm; GrpcDriver''s mTLS is framework-ready, proven by a real\n@grpc/grpc-js round-trip test since no gRPC server exists yet to integrate against.\n\n* chore: update bun.lock for services/apollo''s new server dependency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: TapiruWanderCode94 <tapiruwandercode94@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"000895d59f9fe8186e373ae6623e055179cde92f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/trees/000895d59f9fe8186e373ae6623e055179cde92f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/commits/9413c6f4fbe81bb8ceab8626287e3a60bbcd006e","verification":{"payload":"tree 000895d59f9fe8186e373ae6623e055179cde92f\nparent faffe41da45096c81dbdc102ecf3b35edb233f74\nauthor Edward Lim Kok Siong <edwardlimkoksiong1994@gmail.com> 1784198089 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784198089 +0800\n\nfeat: full mTLS for internal service-to-service traffic (#82)\n\n* feat: add full mTLS for internal service-to-service traffic\n\nVault-issued mTLS across the web -> Apollo Router -> subgraph (-> future grpc)\nflow: GrpcDriver/ApolloDriver gain an optional tls config (ServerCredentials\ncreateSsl / a TLS-capable fork of startStandaloneServer, since Apollo''s own\nhardcodes plain http.createServer), backed by a new VaultTlsAdapter issuing\nshort-lived leaf certs from Vault''s PKI secrets engine (same AppRole per\nserver already used for dynamic DB creds). Wired end-to-end for auth <->\nApollo Router (the only real peers in this repo today) in both docker-compose\nand Helm; GrpcDriver''s mTLS is framework-ready, proven by a real\n@grpc/grpc-js round-trip test since no gRPC server exists yet to integrate against.\n\n* chore: update bun.lock for services/apollo''s new server dependency\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: TapiruWanderCode94 <tapiruwandercode94@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWLPJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiu0QAHViIbpnIAmZgDmCzY+dlxmW\nDDNBADLFHGu3p6o79Dinj2A2YvRvuwHj4ESb/66QI3y9El1OtamVdO8cxVnIEO7h\ntGyCoXQgaNPW71ebyXNlVGgs/7CH53HcryhWlX0ycy4UBepIdeTnoQP2K4tOljlJ\nzTud/LbOpS5xnFAhxeR32nAbC72+yuu4tcv1eBC069lhRY7LSFaXmI6bLg0zUqp1\nGFTUDvzYB0tcSB0RSAIyRuFclONdgWxS25DWmaJcYEjVqWjiGcnpVSp6EdQBKzfx\nfmNE2znCsLZeHJgrZIWmvL+j9KVnSibmYHerwhCL0mrDpxOGNX+q2YxpLPnYrXyb\nOcz8lmiA8xZyN6v2OgJ25zrD7cfhLwNNph7OcO37CkP+2q6vCuYuXB65867lHfBB\nBhs42NYQ/bLAy87DipziNUjKDxLHNwKGDV9gCnOT2I6V8wacdS6va8IiIK1YOmFQ\niMffKdNqoFL8fgBayQC/Gau8f0WqJ3mzOk6xQiLtzzvb4y1yQCpHs1+MIxUVOaIb\nuYdWhP/JMqOvcwqP2iUpBHaw3J3vcE9QrB0c9pqwjcl8fjgk07TjHVTso8Q3gU4T\noTYUTwK0JLIEpjP/chWRgJmdCzYQNozE2ZUVeY7mLD6m/Hcc0jjyeIGyIY0XQs7R\n7olut+yWWZX85X6dWSJ+\n=lzeE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T10:34:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starr