owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardLim1994","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/commits/4f901fdc6851e0573b7556c54ca47d00cca47aff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:44:01Z","email":"edwardlimkoksiong1994@gmail.com","name":"Edward Lim Kok Siong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T07:44:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: fix dangling test1/test2/mfe1/web1 and demo1/demo2/frontend1/portal references (#81)\n\nservers/test1, servers/test2, frontends/mfe1, and apps/web1 were removed\nin #78, but 7 CLAUDE.md files still pointed at their files/directories\nas if they existed. Deeper issue found in the same pass: root CLAUDE.md,\nterraform/CLAUDE.md, services/terraform/CLAUDE.md, and packages/api/\nCLAUDE.md predate that removal entirely — they still describe an even\nolder naming scheme (demo1/demo2/frontend1/portal) that was renamed to\ntest1/test2/mfe1/web1 in the same commit that added the Terraform/k8s\nwork, with the prose never updated to match.\n\nReworded every dangling reference: illustrative examples stay (e.g.\n\"demo1\" as a placeholder server name), but claims of current existence,\nverification, or dangling file paths are corrected to reflect that no\nservers/**, frontends/**, apps/** project exists today, with historical\nverification notes (minikube deployment, RBAC findings, etc.) kept but\nexplicitly marked as run against the now-removed prototype examples.\n\nCo-authored-by: TapiruWanderCode94 <tapiruwandercode94@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"329e24c2cc54586391e750128215a676ace43141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/trees/329e24c2cc54586391e750128215a676ace43141"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EdwardLim1994/microservice-rnd1/git/commits/4f901fdc6851e0573b7556c54ca47d00cca47aff","verification":{"payload":"tree 329e24c2cc54586391e750128215a676ace43141\nparent 885ddf57d4e45091c1e1a5d5648ede81c0de3f51\nauthor Edward Lim Kok Siong <edwardlimkoksiong1994@gmail.com> 1784101441 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784101441 +0800\n\ndocs: fix dangling test1/test2/mfe1/web1 and demo1/demo2/frontend1/portal references (#81)\n\nservers/test1, servers/test2, frontends/mfe1, and apps/web1 were removed\nin #78, but 7 CLAUDE.md files still pointed at their files/directories\nas if they existed. Deeper issue found in the same pass: root CLAUDE.md,\nterraform/CLAUDE.md, services/terraform/CLAUDE.md, and packages/api/\nCLAUDE.md predate that removal entirely — they still describe an even\nolder naming scheme (demo1/demo2/frontend1/portal) that was renamed to\ntest1/test2/mfe1/web1 in the same commit that added the Terraform/k8s\nwork, with the prose never updated to match.\n\nReworded every dangling reference: illustrative examples stay (e.g.\n\"demo1\" as a placeholder server name), but claims of current existence,\nverification, or dangling file paths are corrected to reflect that no\nservers/**, frontends/**, apps/** project exists today, with historical\nverification notes (minikube deployment, RBAC findings, etc.) kept but\nexplicitly marked as run against the now-removed prototype examples.\n\nCo-authored-by: TapiruWanderCode94 <tapiruwandercode94@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVzpBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWp4QAJSy+mhMdna/dvwGbygA2JEB\noIjDqRE1M+D0aBmodZ1hWZnKpM4P27vqIYDGC4gBwLE3P3VBqRdJybgUg+aeAYba\nx7JjlatSZNDabQl7epjSHTVfJNWOzZlW11vccybnptI65Y8RUIRPkyIzlB3PlyOr\n/8Rg/EF1f3qbGcpL2nSJXBfO9xY7tvcVL/GrRMwk3DF5lay+Vl0LQr2qGQn9gZ3j\nbHU6Unjsshq3FYIk/KYYKs/ntMUJZNQpKKRDvYqXSt8HrpPhFCdkGZn3Rc+kqvm6\nSK4H+ZV9AuyNTYa0K7MgGUJ1Ld3tmsH5kjGSo8UsT4oK6fOsePcj6YcMPaYmsKBp\nC1RtaqMEXk9Kn