":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commit/7172f244bd425cb4e3816ca566ec5782362c6a32","node_id":"C_kwDOTEqIjtoAKDcxNzJmMjQ0YmQ0MjVjYjRlMzgxNmNhNTY2ZWM1NzgyMzYyYzZhMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commit/7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939","sha":"7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939"}],"sha":"7172f244bd425cb4e3816ca566ec5782362c6a32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/7172f244bd425cb4e3816ca566ec5782362c6a32"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T06:36:23Z","email":"jovidonjon8885@gmail.com","name":"BinyominYusufov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T06:36:23Z","email":"jovidonjon8885@gmail.com","name":"BinyominYusufov"},"message":"feat: real Memberships & Specialist screens + indigo design system\n\nReplace P0 placeholders: full Memberships screen (list/sell/freeze) and a real Specialist dashboard; remove PlaceholderPage. Systemic visual overhaul via design tokens: deep indigo brand + amber accent (was green), serif display headings, dark indigo sidebar, split-panel login, unified StatusBadge colour system, skeleton loading, sticky/aligned tables. No new deps; logic and i18n unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7c93b7b5f3a6d597e2005f63283f9a40a2ef7e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/git/trees/c7c93b7b5f3a6d597e2005f63283f9a40a2ef7e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/git/commits/7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commit/7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939","node_id":"C_kwDOTEqIjtoAKDdiZTJiNjM2NjVkNWRhNDI3MmUwNDEyYWVlZDU4ZWJlM2FkMDI5Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commit/e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621","sha":"e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621"}],"sha":"7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/7be2b63665d5da4272e0412aeed58ebe3ad02939"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T12:29:20Z","email":"jovidonjon8885@gmail.com","name":"RUH AFZUN Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T12:29:20Z","email":"jovidonjon8885@gmail.com","name":"RUH AFZUN Dev"},"message":"RUH AFZUN CRM v1 - full build (P0-P4)\n\nDjango 5.2 + DRF + JWT backend; React 19 + TS + Vite SPA; bilingual ru/tj UI; roles reception/specialist/management.\n\nP0 auth+i18n+UI kit. P1 clients/memberships/visits + transactional sale/check-in(4 cases)/freeze with non-negative visits_left (logic + DB CheckConstraint + row lock), 22 tests. P2 retention segments + leads kanban with transactional convert, 4 tests. P3 events/coworking/payments/analytics + specialist & management roles; every payment is a Payment row with purpose + source FK. P4 demo seed (all 4 retention segments), i18n complete (tj typed vs ru), deploy docs.\n\nVerified: 26 backend tests pass (SQLite); frontend builds 0 type errors; live API smoke green across roles. Dev DB is SQLite per request; Railway Postgres deploy + pre-prod test run are documented user acceptance steps.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b65c97f5bfeb4c24ef175846351160e6c604d86c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/git/trees/b65c97f5bfeb4c24ef175846351160e6c604d86c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/git/commits/e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commit/e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621","node_id":"C_kwDOTEqIjtoAKGUwY2E0YWNmNjkxMzY4MWJmMjQzYjE4YWFmZGFmNDM1MzUxNDk2MjE","parents":[],"sha":"e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits/e0ca4acf6913681bf243b18aafdaf43535149621"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/BinyominYusufov/RuhAfzunCRM/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=72d203890437eea561f4d9bd6f6b80f47cd54da0&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A21%3A39.315Z"}');
