ency-os/commits/1fa8f7da2f226e5d0adc185fb626cba21af79a36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T23:00:02Z","email":"read.musik@gmail.com","name":"Antonio Reid"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T23:00:02Z","email":"read.musik@gmail.com","name":"Antonio Reid"},"message":"feat: unified app with auth, routing, sidebar, and venture creation\n\nArchitecture:\n- Single app with React Router v7 replacing 7 separate apps\n- Sidebar navigation with role-based visibility\n- Auth system (login/signup) with Zustand + persist\n- JWT-like tokens, session persistence\n\nAuth:\n- Admin account: admin@aigency.os / admin123 (technical expert)\n- Domain expert signup: creates domain_expert role accounts\n- Role-based route guards (admin, technical_founder, domain_expert)\n\nPages:\n- / — Canvas (main, authenticated)\n- /brain — Knowledge graph + search (all roles)\n- /crm — Deal pipeline + contacts (all roles)\n- /planner — Plan review with RBAC sections (all roles)\n- /quality — AEGIS risk heatmap + findings (admin/tech only)\n- /agents — HCOM agent monitor (admin only)\n- /venture/new — Idea → PAUL plan → approve → canvas flow\n\nNavigation:\n- Brain and CRM links now work (were dead)\n- Sidebar with collapsible design\n- New Venture button prominent in sidebar\n- User profile + logout in sidebar footer","tree":{"sha":"f4d64cd338f9192417324b33fd33cbc3049ae539","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/trees/f4d64cd338f9192417324b33fd33cbc3049ae539"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/commits/1fa8f7da2f226e5d0adc185fb626cba21af79a36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26177884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/following{/