ervices/plannotator (port 3013): Plan review server with RBAC\n  section filtering, annotations, version diffs\n\nNew app:\n- apps/plannotator-ui (port 3003): Plan review UI with section-based\n  access control, annotation threads, diff viewer, role toggle\n\nCanvas BMAD widgets:\n- BMC Card: 9-section Business Model Canvas with editable cells\n- Revenue Card: Calculator with subscription/usage/one-time models,\n  live MRR/ARR/LTV/CAC metrics\n- Gate Card: Milestone approval workflow (pending/approved/rejected)\n- Spec Card: Collapsible TECH-SPEC viewer with 5 sections\n\nShared packages:\n- @vscp/shared-types: bmad.ts, paul.ts, carl.ts, gstack.ts\n- New CardType variants: bmc, revenue, gate, spec\n\nInfra:\n- Updated docker-compose.yml with bmad, paul, gstack, plannotator\n- Tests for all new services\n- All 41 turbo tasks pass: lint, typecheck, test, build","tree":{"sha":"6063d0903635c470b9a503228daca7a88951c649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/trees/6063d0903635c470b9a503228daca7a88951c649"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/commits/3caabda91101be119665a2f3d0234f5786f4c913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26177884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AReid987","id":26177884,"login":"AReid987","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTc3ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/