m/ applied:\n- Dark theme: near-black backgrounds (#05070a), glass surfaces\n- Colors: primary teal #12a594, accent magenta #D6409F, amber #e09646\n- Fonts: Supreme (display), Satoshi (body/UI), Geist Mono (code/data)\n- Glass panels with backdrop-filter blur\n- Sharp corners (4px radius), minimal shadows\n- Lucide icons, no emoji in UI\n\nChanges:\n- PRODUCT.md: register, users, purpose, brand personality, design principles\n- DESIGN.md: color palette, typography, spacing, components, animation\n- packages/ui/src/styles/aigency-tokens.css: shared Tailwind v4 theme\n- packages/ui: Button, Card, Avatar, Badge, ProgressBar rewritten\n- All apps import design tokens via @vscp/ui/styles/aigency-tokens.css\n- TicketBoard: Badge variant ''default'' → ''neutral''","tree":{"sha":"1725b184a1a6fbbb36fe989ae3c65a2a29654fcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/trees/1725b184a1a6fbbb36fe989ae3c65a2a29654fcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/commits/3d30824197bfdfdef33bb58ba97d2fcc2b85dbb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26177884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AReid987","id":26177884,"login":"AReid987","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTc3ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/subscr