"feat: Sprint 1 complete — all UIs, APIs, and canvas components\n\nEpic 1 — Agor Canvas Foundation:\n  - Canvas.tsx with CSS transform pan/zoom\n  - Zone.tsx with Business (amber) + Engineering (blue) zones\n  - Card.tsx with draggable + snap-to-grid\n  - Grid.tsx, Minimap.tsx, Toolbar.tsx, Cursors.tsx\n  - Card types: TextCard, ImageCard, LinkCard, EmbedCard\n  - Zustand stores: canvasStore (277 lines), userStore\n  - WebSocket hook with real-time card/cursor sync\n  - RBAC: DE full access Business, read-only Engineering\n\nEpic 2 — Paperclip Venture Orchestration:\n  - API: 8 route files (companies, agents, goals, tickets, budgets, heartbeat, board, dashboard)\n  - In-memory store (576 lines) + Zod schemas\n  - UI: OrgChart, TicketBoard, BudgetTracker, AgentCard, BoardActions\n  - CompanyDashboard page with full layout\n\nEpic 5 — HCOM Agent Communication:\n  - API: 6 route files (agents, messages, collisions, lifecycle, subscriptions, dashboard)\n  - SQLite schema (87 lines)\n  - UI: AgentList, MessageFeed, TerminalPreview, CollisionAlert\n  - Full dashboard with demo data\n\nturbo run build: 9/9 tasks, 5.7s, zero errors","tree":{"sha":"8034996ecdeeb258587a61d0862cd6d15886b867","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/trees/8034996ecdeeb258587a61d0862cd6d15886b867"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AReid987/aigency-os/git/commits/b09eee816d4e59a197dd981fc9db5919c3cf5751","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26177884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AReid987/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AReid987","id":26177884,"login":"AReid987","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlc