 1Hz 闪烁) / STATE_ENROLL_SPEAK (绿色常亮)\n- 注册间隔延长至 3s，含 2s 绿色说话窗口\n- 首次循环蓝色快闪标记进入，后续跳过\n- fsm/led_indicator/enroll 三模块联动","tree":{"sha":"2249dbfc2314a07f25f68f217c19ba2b2dc9e363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/2249dbfc2314a07f25f68f217c19ba2b2dc9e363"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/f825252d6d22ea42214ebf46811efec0b114fa3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/f825252d6d22ea42214ebf46811efec0b114fa3c","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGY4MjUyNTJkNmQyMmVhNDIyMTRlYmY0NjgxMWVmZWMwYjExNGZhM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1","sha":"cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1"}],"sha":"f825252d6d22ea42214ebf46811efec0b114fa3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/f825252d6d22ea42214ebf46811efec0b114fa3c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:31:10Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T03:31:10Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Fix: 适配 ESP-IDF v5.5.4 编译 + 多项可靠性修复\n\n- 修复 esp_chip_info.h 缺失、flash_size 类型错误\n- 移除 task_decision.c 未使用的 wait_bits 变量\n- 修复 led_strip v3.x API (led_pixel_format → color_component_format)\n- 修复 MALLOC_CAP_* 缺失头文件\n- kws/sv 引擎以 C++ 编译 (set_source_files_properties LANGUAGE CXX)\n- SV resolver 堆分配修复生命周期\n- 修复 SV/Decision 事件竞态 (新增 EVENT_SV_STARTED)\n- 修复 LED 颜色颠倒 (GRB 色序)\n- 修复 xRingbufferGetCurFreeSize 参数\n- 添加 esp-dsp 到 idf_component.yml\n- 添加缺失的 esp_timer REQUIRES\n- 转换 mel_filterbank_const.h UTF-16→UTF-8\n- 删除无用的 tools/ 转换脚本\n- 更新 README.md (硬件连接/资源占用/展望)","tree":{"sha":"6b1d52e07eea4d6ec1129bfb6e6d6e2932dd576d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/6b1d52e07eea4d6ec1129bfb6e6d6e2932dd576d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGNiNmIyMjEwZDA3NWM3NWFkZGM3YWY0NjcwMzlkZDQ2NzI2MWNjYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727","sha":"ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727"}],"sha":"cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/cb6b2210d075c75addc7af467039dd467261ccc1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T10:04:15Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T10:04:15Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Fix: 移动 config/ → components/config/ (ESP-IDF 标准组件路径)","tree":{"sha":"b6d6f033d8f0661a027d34e1cedf19dff0d66e4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/b6d6f033d8f0661a027d34e1cedf19dff0d66e4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGZmODFiYThlMjg2NTZjOWFkMGI0MTAzMWU4ZTcxNzUzNDA1Nzk3Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b","sha":"a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b"}],"sha":"ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/ff81ba8e28656c9ad0b41031e8e7175340579727"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T09:30:31Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T09:30:31Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Feat: ONNX→TFLite 本地转换成功 (纯 flatbuffers+onnx, 零ML依赖)\n\n转换工具:\n- tools/onnx2tflite_v2.py: 手写 TFLite FlatBuffer 构建器\n  仅需 onnx+flatbuffers (均已本地安装), 无需 onnx2tf/tensorflow\n\n模型文件:\n- models_fat/model_kws.tflite: 12.8KB INT8 (≤20KB 目标)\n- models_fat/model_sv.tflite:  15.5KB INT8 (≈15KB 目标, 略超0.5KB)\n\n可直接烧录:\n  python IDF_PATH/components/fatfs/fatfsgen.py models_fat models.img\n  parttool.py write_partition --partition-name=models --input=models.img","tree":{"sha":"a219f3235179b6af88399501af06d414c8cc1d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/a219f3235179b6af88399501af06d414c8cc1d3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGEzODJkN2ZkYjcyOWMyMzk1ZmFhZTUwNjJiNjExMTQ5ZjBmM2YwOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf","sha":"d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf"}],"sha":"a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/a382d7fdb729c2395faae5062b611149f0f3f08b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T09:17:36Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T09:17:36Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Fix: ONNX→TFLite v2 脚本 — 直接保留 ONNX INT8 量化 (非 float32 PTQ)\n\n原转换 27KB/42KB 是因为权重存为 float32。v2 脚本用 onnx2tf\n直接保留 ONNX 中已有的 INT8 量化参数, 不在转换过程中重新 PTQ。\n预期输出: KWS ~11KB, SV ~14KB。\n\n在 GPU 服务器运行:\n  python tools/convert_kws_v2.py\n  python tools/convert_sv_v2.py","tree":{"sha":"697c310a3cbd74aa41c2df8150c7f4938ecad187","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/697c310a3cbd74aa41c2df8150c7f4938ecad187"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGQ2N2Y4YzdkNDZkYzc1MjFlOWVlYTEyMDM5ZmZlMjI1MTEzZTNlYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/3cf24a1002d6571e2ef46939fd278d95e607f877","sha":"3cf24a1002d6571e2ef46939fd278d95e607f877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/3cf24a1002d6571e2ef46939fd278d95e607f877"}],"sha":"d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/d67f8c7d46dc7521e9eea12039ffe225113e3ebf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/3cf24a1002d6571e2ef46939fd278d95e607f877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T08:48:44Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T08:48:44Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Align: 固件前端 40→13维 MFCC + ONNX→TFLite + 架构文档更新\n\nPhase 1 - 前端对齐:\n- MF_NUM_CHANNELS/FB_NUM_CHANNELS/KWS_FEATURE_DIM/SV_FEATURE_DIM: 40→13\n- mel_filterbank_const.h 重新生成: 13ch×257bins=3.3KB Flash\n- Feature buffer: 6KB→1.95KB BSS\n\nPhase 2 - 模型转换:\n- tools/convert_kws.py: .keras→TFLite INT8 (在GPU服务器运行)\n- tools/convert_sv.py: ONNX→TFLite (onnx2tf)\n- models_fat/: 模型存放目录+README\n- model-data/README.md: 部署指南\n\nPhase 3 - 架构注释:\n- KWS: MixedNet→DS-CNN (11.4KB, 89.3%)\n- SV: x-vector mini→1D CNN (14.3KB, ~8K参数)\n- SV OpResolver: 14→10 ops\n\nPhase 4 - 文档:\n- KWS/SV README 重写为实际架构\n- tech-stack: 内存219KB (43%余量)\n- TASK_STATUS: 模型状态表","tree":{"sha":"8fcd3750af2bec51ed2880969eab2e099486f07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/8fcd3750af2bec51ed2880969eab2e099486f07f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/3cf24a1002d6571e2ef46939fd278d95e607f877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_