l":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Fix: 第二轮审计修复 — 构建+并发+内存+健壮性 (23 issues)\n\nBUILD (B1-B5):\n- config/ 升级为正式 ESP-IDF 组件 (新增 CMakeLists.txt)\n- 6个子组件 INCLUDE_DIRS+REQUIRES 完整修复\n- 移除 unused esp_spi_flash.h include\n\nCONCURRENCY (C1-C6):\n- C1: g_sv_similarity 移到 no-template bypass 之后\n- C2: VERIFYING 状态 3s 超时回 IDLE\n- C3: FSM 添加 mutex 保护多任务并发访问\n- C5: 删除未使用事件位 EVENT_KWS_RESULT_READY/EVENT_TIMER_100MS\n\nDATA FLOW (D1-D5):\n- D2: 无模板行为统一: SV 标记 ACCEPT by default → Decision -2.0→ACCEPTED\n\nMEMORY (M1-M5):\n- R1: KWS OpResolver 泄漏修复 (s_resolver 保存+deinit 释放)\n- M1/M3: filterbank 41KB BSS 标注 TODO (运行时计算无法 const)\n\nROBUSTNESS (R1-R9):\n- R2: UART driver leak (uart_driver_delete on error paths)\n- R3: nvs_commit 返回值检查 (模板静默丢失修复)\n- R4: I2S portMAX_DELAY → 100ms 超时 (HW 故障不挂死)\n- R6: SV feature_buffer 不足时不再 tight spin\n- R7: size_t format %d → %zu","tree":{"sha":"53f3d903c1ac2cdbc6c0c4c304caea1ba4d4e50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/53f3d903c1ac2cdbc6c0c4c304caea1ba4d4e50d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/cc3caa7f1cbe870275eb4057d1b5dc60a97f797f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/cc3caa7f1cbe870275eb4057d1b5dc60a97f797f","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGNjM2NhYTdmMWNiZTg3MDI3NWViNDA1N2QxYjVkYzYwYTk3Zjc5N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435","sha":"bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435"}],"sha":"cc3caa7f1cbe870275eb4057d1b5dc60a97f797f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/cc3caa7f1cbe870275eb4057d1b5dc60a97f797f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:40:12Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:40:12Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Fix: 审计修复 — 4 CRITICAL + 4 HIGH + 4 MEDIUM\n\nCRITICAL:\n- C1: sdkconfig ESP32S3→ESP32C3 CPU freq key\n- C2: 定时器回调阻塞200ms → 改为独立Task_Frontend\n- C3: 定时器回调栈溢出(5.9KB→timer daemon 3.5KB) → 独立Task\n- C4: SV resolver static重复注册 → 移除static\n- C5: 模型加载整分区(1MB→OOM) → FAT+fopen按文件名读\n\nHIGH:\n- H1: 任务栈从96KB降至44KB(对齐PRD)\n- H2: KWS模型内存泄漏20KB → 保存+释放\n- H3: SV结果接入Decision(占位移除,g_sv_similarity)\n- H4: EVENT_TIMER_100MS未设置 → KWS改为100ms轮询+2s冷却\n\nMEDIUM:\n- M1: KWS无触发冷却 → 2s冷却\n- M2: 按键死循环 → 10s超时保护\n- M3: 缺少esp_timer.h → 补全\n- M4: EventGroup xWaitForAllBits TRUE→FALSE","tree":{"sha":"7d347f9b0e6a46610902ee34507b94de9fe961e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/7d347f9b0e6a46610902ee34507b94de9fe961e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKGJmYzc2ZTM3ODM1NzE0NjAzMmU0NGQyZjc5NTRhZDEyOTJjYzI0MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43","sha":"1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43"}],"sha":"bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/bfc76e378357146032e44d2f7954ad1292cc2435"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:20:24Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:20:24Z","email":"16863820+ruyuehao@user.noreply.gitee.com","name":"如月皓"},"message":"Initial commit: ESP32-C3 Voice Wake-up System v1.3\n\n- KWS + SV cascade architecture (TFLite Micro)\n- I2S INMP441 audio capture + ring buffer\n- TFLM microfrontend (40ch Mel spectrogram + PCAN)\n- WS2812 RGB LED state indicator + BOOT key enrollment\n- UART JSON event reporting\n- ESP-IDF v5.4 + esp-tflite-micro + led_strip","tree":{"sha":"35705ae60a59bc33f1fda6cc450f17ccda4bd7e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/trees/35705ae60a59bc33f1fda6cc450f17ccda4bd7e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/git/commits/1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commit/1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43","node_id":"C_kwDOTE2sy9oAKDFlMTM1ZDQzZThlODIzZDdmZTYyN2I5M2M3YjdjMmM3YmYzZDNmNDM","parents":[],"sha":"1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits/1e135d43e8e823d7fe627b93c7b7c2c7bf3d3f43"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruyuehao/only-listening-your-voice/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=f825252d6d22ea42214ebf46811efec0b114fa3c&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A43%3A10.419Z"}');
