api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/5595be4714a77d00cb5b9ad2066834dd6451b1da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T08:07:18Z","email":"info@antifragil.net","name":"antifragil-tech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T08:07:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tesoreria): mostrar el saldo REAL anclado (banco+caja), no el flujo del periodo (#64)\n\nGuille: \"tesorería pone 0 €\". La página calculaba el saldo como cobros − pagos\ndel periodo (≈0 porque casi no hay movimientos del mes en el OS), ignorando el\nsaldo real anclado. Ahora usa cargarSaldosCuentas(): Banco 8.713,12 + Caja\n9.481,24 = 18.194,36, cada uno partiendo de su ancla confirmada. Sin ancla cae\nal flujo del periodo. Texto del hero actualizado.\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0831855f7ba55d998be4bb5368349824188ec6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/trees/0831855f7ba55d998be4bb5368349824188ec6bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/commits/5595be4714a77d00cb5b9ad2066834dd6451b1da","verification":{"payload":"tree 0831855f7ba55d998be4bb5368349824188ec6bf\nparent e535fde90d19a37e1efc91640695f9aedcc7244f\nauthor antifragil-tech <info@antifragil.net> 1785398838 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785398838 +0200\n\nfix(tesoreria): mostrar el saldo REAL anclado (banco+caja), no el flujo del periodo (#64)\n\nGuille: \"tesorería pone 0 €\". La página calculaba el saldo como cobros − pagos\ndel periodo (≈0 porque casi no hay movimientos del mes en el OS), ignorando el\nsaldo real anclado. Ahora usa cargarSaldosCuentas(): Banco 8.713,12 + Caja\n9.481,24 = 18.194,36, cada uno partiendo de su ancla confirmada. Sin ancla cae\nal flujo del periodo. Texto del hero actualizado.\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqawY2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAABgQAJ2PTXTWKFoGl+nIdiyPrGWE\n50tgxJ3E55J3g4DlR9C2xyXNjtMISoRioYgKG7Kse4uZwhB9suhfeToHaBom6WU4\nT7rCntZy9jAkvQFupkyL9x8bce1vulpR8O+zatQNfO6+k7YwrfTQdENd837EI1FY\npPnbdlrC43fnElvvGrOltRK4kdaL2RaWpu86iNGQjF8vJ5lM4YKjSKhmYBHERpiG\noazwBLQB0fUTm/le2dtEg/iZD0TP059QAzwK54gKkmEPEhNva/CSmZf8KbVsmcNk\nUScyjTyzdCDrVyJ9tv9/9k1J4tCQAVDDMSGlEHdl9qL939/ijasEwKsD+DPeN0mC\n6VmGVNuRBWRY/N7sF2BUvLLFNvDzKLLHG794rJBkda1f6PVmBbzV/8ABd7rsTqav\n3eIBjmOCeUKc4mE7X6/BsdqvQJKa2yvYA9rRzxHwmdKJvjbeyIHBZR51+luLb9af\nkW6zfUZNPoh8HgXkww2HP/OQH9hKBMeUh0XnF8hLYUUJy8KhsNH4SqVPkGJIdBDL\nkameIfmky7C9bxHmSvTIeo0c+2C3KTI3lZ7NHQ3AG1ZUuNLNiwtOou/8NchmffK/\nXICYaFEV7PmEgCSOz2sKR6UKAhVsHeHeRO+fsLkAh65gjHCW1lrg6vzoMlwgfeGQ\nFImOmFJE6e/5rw35TIk9\n=OAMY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-30T08:07:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commit/5595be4714a77d00cb5b9ad2066834dd6451b1da","node_id":"C_kwDOTFFNWdoAKDU1OTViZTQ3MTRhNzdkMDBjYjViOWFkMjA2NjgzNGRkNjQ1MWIxZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commit/e535fde90d19a37e1efc91640695f9aedcc7244f","sha":"e535fde90d19a37e1efc91640695f9aedcc7244f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/e535fde90d19a37e1efc91640695f9aedcc7244f"}],"sha":"5595be4714a77d00cb5b9ad2066834dd6451b1da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/5595be4714a77d00cb5b9ad2066834dd6451b1da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290677293?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech","id":290677293,"login":"antifragil-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOEVNiLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/e535fde90d19a37e1efc91640695f9aedcc7244f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T07:57:20Z","email":"info@antifragil.net","name":"antifragil-tech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T07:57:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(datos): paginar lecturas grandes de PostgREST (tope de 1.000 filas) (#63)\n\nCausa raíz de \"no se ven todas las reservas\": PostgREST corta cada respuesta\na 1.000 filas (config del proyecto), aunque se pida limit=8000. La agenda solo\nrecibía 1.000 citas (las más antiguas del rango) y los meses posteriores salían\nvacíos. Nuevo restTodo() pagina de 1.000 en 1.000 con offset hasta agotar.\nclinica_citas y cobros de cita pasan a restTodo → la agenda carga las ~2.725\ncitas del rango completo.\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a1fab6757659b8a6794f68ede2370a17434cdf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/trees/5a1fab6757659b8a6794f68ede2370a17434cdf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/commits/e535fde90d19a37e1efc91640695f9aedcc7244f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a1fab6757659b8a6794f68ede2370a17434cdf6\nparent 78d3d14cbff8e34e861a5b9fc305062c97a29bf0\nauthor antifragil-tech <info@antifragil.net> 1785398240 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785398240 +0200\n\nfix(datos): paginar lecturas grandes de PostgREST (tope de 1.000 filas) (#63)\n\nCausa raíz de \"no se ven todas las reservas\": PostgREST corta cada respuesta\na 1.000 filas (config del proyecto), aunque se pida limit=8000. La agenda solo\nrecibía 1.000 citas (las más antiguas del rango) y los meses posteriores salían\nvacíos. Nuevo restTodo() pagina de 1.000 en 1.000 con offset hasta agotar.\nclinica_citas y cobros de cita pasan a restTodo → la agenda carga las ~2.725\ncitas del rango completo.\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@ant