,"parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commit/15c2f0317b47bb819cd5eb98bb62e92b3128bf6d","sha":"15c2f0317b47bb819cd5eb98bb62e92b3128bf6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/15c2f0317b47bb819cd5eb98bb62e92b3128bf6d"}],"sha":"4870bd6821fe318e8fa76c2f34c06a3916d99a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/4870bd6821fe318e8fa76c2f34c06a3916d99a5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290677293?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech","id":290677293,"login":"antifragil-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOEVNiLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/15c2f0317b47bb819cd5eb98bb62e92b3128bf6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T07:16:35Z","email":"info@antifragil.net","name":"antifragil-tech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T07:16:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(reservas): cobro a un toque con medio de pago + alta de cita con nombre y servicio (#50)\n\nIteración de UX del Bloque B (directriz: intuitivo y fácil de usar):\n\n- Panel de cita: la sección Pago sustituye \"Registrar pago\" por una fila\n  \"Cobrar {precio}: Efectivo | Tarjeta | Bizum\" — un toque por medio. En modo\n  real registra el COBRO de verdad: el servidor resuelve importe y cliente\n  desde la cita y lo apunta en `cobros` contra la cuenta de tesorería por\n  tipo (efectivo→caja, resto→banco); la cita queda pagada solo si el cobro\n  entró. La vista Cobros pendientes gana botones Efectivo/Tarjeta por fila.\n- Alta de cita en dos pasos: al pinchar un hueco (o \"Nueva cita\") se abre un\n  mini-formulario con nombre del cliente (autofocus, Enter crea, Esc cierra)\n  y servicio precargado según el rol del profesional — se acabó el \"Nuevo\n  cliente\" fijo. Funciona igual en demo y en real.\n- Store: `cobrar(id, medio)` write-through + `crearCita(..., opts)`;\n  `AccionesRealesAgenda.registrarCobro`. Host: `registrarCobroCitaReal`\n  resuelve cita→importe/cliente en servidor (la UI nunca envía importes).\n- Seed de `clinica_servicios` aplicado en la base real con autorización de\n  Guille (Fisioterapia 45'' · Nutrición 30'' · Entrenamiento 60''): las altas\n  reales quedan desbloqueadas.\n\nGates locales: type-check 12/12 · lint 9/9 · tests 4/4 · build 6/6.\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c59d330c178a50f0e146f2e84abfa59174a7364","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/trees/2c59d330c178a50f0e146f2e84abfa59174a7364"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/commits/15c2f0317b47bb819cd5eb98bb62e92b3128bf6d","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c59d330c178a50f0e146f2e84abfa59174a7364\nparent 484a73f6e66780ef4fdc8fafae470048343c77a2\nauthor antifragil-tech <info@antifragil.net> 1784272595 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784272595 +0200\n\nfeat(reservas): cobro a un toque con medio de pago + alta de cita con nombre 