":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commit/e122a2613e798f7ae1bb08473f270ce35a9e07fa","node_id":"C_kwDOTFFNWdoAKGUxMjJhMjYxM2U3OThmN2FlMWJiMDg0NzNmMjcwY2UzNWE5ZTA3ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commit/ec55b61e9a0e83d62fc9ed3c47f5c5cdf82b8652","sha":"ec55b61e9a0e83d62fc9ed3c47f5c5cdf82b8652","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/ec55b61e9a0e83d62fc9ed3c47f5c5cdf82b8652"}],"sha":"e122a2613e798f7ae1bb08473f270ce35a9e07fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/e122a2613e798f7ae1bb08473f270ce35a9e07fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290677293?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antifragil-tech","id":290677293,"login":"antifragil-tech","node_id":"U_kgDOEVNiLQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antifragil-tech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/commits/ec55b61e9a0e83d62fc9ed3c47f5c5cdf82b8652/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T13:36:14Z","email":"info@antifragil.net","name":"antifragil-tech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T13:36:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): entrada manual de datos + emision de facturas operativas OPS (#41)\n\nCiclo completo \"entrada de datos manual + emision de facturas\" sobre las\ntablas reales de Supabase (fallback demo sin entorno intacto para CI):\n\n- Selector de periodo (?mes=YYYY-MM) en /tesoreria y /rentabilidad:\n  form GET con input type=month, enlace \"Todo el historico\" y titulo/\n  descripcion indicando el periodo activo (Next 15: searchParams await).\n- Server actions (''use server'') en lib/datos/acciones.ts: crearGasto,\n  crearIngreso (con cobro opcional al libro de cobros), crearFacturaRecibida\n  y emitirFacturaOperativa (serie OPS, numero = max+1, reintento ante 409).\n  Validacion en servidor (fecha ISO, importe>0, enums exactos del schema MVP)\n  y errores legibles via redirect ?error= — nunca crash sin entorno.\n- Seccion \"Anadir datos\" en /tesoreria: 4 <details> colapsables (gasto,\n  ingreso/cobro, factura recibida, emitir factura) con el panel kit y los\n  21 tipos de gasto agrupados por categoria A-D desde CATEGORIA_DE.\n- Facturas emitidas y recibidas REALES en /tesoreria (v_facturas_recibidas_\n  operativas para el vocabulario operativo del producto).\n- Vista imprimible /tesoreria/factura/[id]: fondo blanco, wordmark\n  ANTIFRAGIL, desglose base/IVA o linea de exencion sanitaria\n  (art. 20.Uno.3 Ley 37/1992), pie \"documento operativo interno\", boton\n  Imprimir (unico client component) y reglas @media print en globals.css.\n\nPayloads verificados contra la base viva (insert+delete de humo en las\n5 tablas) y build/type-check/lint en verde.\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38ed35eb6535d97334f2c8bcbad0fb9743fec365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/trees/38ed35eb6535d97334f2c8bcbad0fb9743fec365"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech