o por dinero real aplicado.\n- Regla anti-duplicado: bono cobrado pendiente de devengar NO es CxC\n  (es deuda de servicio); un compromiso por hecho generador.\n- Vistas de trabajo (hoy, vencidos, aging, por responsable/partner/\n  proyecto/centro/canal), KPIs (DSO/DPO, sin-responsable=0) y roles.\n- Pendientes A2-P1..P8 (política de reclamación, incobrables,\n  cancelación solo CEO, deuda legacy, visibilidad recepción).\n\nSolo docs/finanzas/**. Sin SQL, sin datos reales ni clínicos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(finanzas): formato prettier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSlNmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAR3AQAITYBEDKkHlqtPPjmwfqxLsR\nHZc14gu42voQLFesr45HouoBW7GHn0AW5k7V2Oux4UOOpKnp7dIrYRozc+Q5hOQC\nWsDvVUnRslDtYlzRhIxUjoPBL7XcOIrw1U5Gg/6a8ExO8JcUb1Yt5KRuacvSKXiU\nzYRYYlfANUg6gn2P/J93HMDDdTUSx7wj6KnKYKYatPQbNEhJXQusUWVWnDhaDxV2\nHGZWstyA/2W3IE98zOnamMOWVQcCTIajOQJMgzgdpqRRpzAF6WMaxd9QDH9MB3ni\nis/22Oy6nX+saFUMw0YrWLJg8XxpNxCq5AHjdYfGOYuqBO0aJPT3sNHYlk7D6oNg\ntTm3O8yRH1ntRnvGSb57uU8hh9Z2fpwOrSvqIuTEJ1tP9eUYkZxYThVagGDa1gzJ\n+4yWSBj3sruhQvoK2ciXjoRDBJ5UdIxil9cMdtAN4/thEt8o3t5h2oo5jaXSZD5u\nC+UB7iiyS7C7Yl+5bZSzmQK/r4ixX6ap8w7l2qTwoQYBOHZ4Oma64iHx9mVjCN6/\n7z1pRWTvUlK5JkCDsAxMr+zKQ46Nyv/SFnvq4RbNWq5Fe9wwrG4TRxulQgChhA/B\nMiCmxX5S9zUgST1HE2B1pBVzbUR8+gAKNg6d5IpGWdFbrFEQwx2a24rmeQpE2KIL\nuarcDXITm1iCwGAfuzS5\n=p1qV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T12:51:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api