ronizar modelo operativo con PR #4 (A1) y PR #1 (facturacion)\n\n- Doc 06: medio_pago sin ''banco'' (A1-D6, alineado con draft SQL del PR #4);\n  nuevo par. 10 con estado real de A1 (Draft/NO APPLY, A1b diferido).\n- Doc 05: estado real de F-Op A1; riesgos y salvaguardas transversales.\n- Doc 04: D-op-3 precisado (banco = tipo de cuenta); D-op-6 firme (emision\n  delegada en gestoria, OS precontable); referencia a PR #1.\n- Docs 00/01: punteros al estado vivo (PR #1 y PR #4).\n- Nuevo doc 07: sincronizacion PRs, principios del modelo operativo y riesgos.\n\nSolo documentacion. Sin codigo, sin SQL aplicado, sin Supabase real,\nsin datos reales ni clinicos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(finanzas): formato prettier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSlNBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhVcQAKyh4E9XFB640CZ6yN5Wf433\njn86BiGQWkhenztFqLYJoVadYFgywrPGFQUEmeidl9PBSJ88Pe274Zt3xqRQayBW\ngQu55SsFQzdeWMZOUp+audZ4C7ioOyM1nXDKVbHii5yC7Flf1uXbaG+3M7wCeJ9D\n6UuVr7Lb1Rud67m1fYEbO2j4AJJ/vDoAlavGVakVjnwIP+SoP9gCLU/XqJMBSBix\nOzMSqiO1VxBHBgFj5EF4jAZlYqEKApEcAJk9uA0QcFV7QeztcAnkQ6IrsRcqck6q\ndctUDC43a67H6cfcFAtQze7fEStL4Usj6L0u8lezC2DV8voDZkOG8JFwMNpnwUjB\nm7VtiAWI0MQm/xXiu8/X68ruGfCQapDZJToluMvSy4LTTJwugEINMDNxGNyCqPL3\nFVfWTsfZLMaY7T0YpoBbesMrVbtslOQabK7XtwslMhoEMywCPz7qP1ZkYHMux799\nBPOn6CJyOUxABcrRAgKjwjp0eBzmjipVZYYcSqwwiUZcbRjm6C7TXcZp166I5WJ7\nTXLVgw7aCYkGTscBtZ1bqtybpWVrBepylvu2WLM3BkvWlfBU5gU7j2c9PvoNV/H1\naKlaDaZbYIZzVAHhO085eoNOeAWRsNXEGEsW0FWN3fYoAS6FWKfhNTys9PGCBRLd\nmI+Adbp6b/rOCuzYpKFP\n=0//x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-05T12:51:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/priv