22c4801c804d11a07080daffacf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T11:52:05Z","email":"info@antifragil.net","name":"antifragil-tech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T11:52:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"DRAFT — ci(host): permitir build sin credenciales Supabase reales (#26)\n\n* ci(host): permitir build sin credenciales Supabase reales\n\nEl prerender de next build ejecutaba createClient() en el cuerpo del\nrender de LoginForm y AppShell; sin NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL/ANON_KEY\nel build fallaba en /login y en todas las rutas del layout (app).\n\n- Nuevo guard apps/host/src/lib/env/supabaseEnv.ts: lee las env publicas\n  sin lanzar error y expone isSupabaseConfigured().\n- LoginForm crea el cliente dentro del submit; sin entorno muestra\n  estado operativo de configuracion pendiente.\n- AppShell crea el cliente dentro del useEffect (no corre en prerender).\n- Middleware fail-closed: sin entorno, toda ruta salvo /login redirige\n  a /login. Nunca se sirve la app sin auth.\n\nSin secrets, sin datos, sin tocar packages/supabase-client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(ci): documentar build sin secrets reales\n\nRegistra la decision en docs/governance/06-ci-build-without-secrets.md:\ncausa raiz, patron aplicado, rutas afectadas, pendiente para entorno\nreal y lo que explicitamente no se ha hecho.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ba68b29ca30e7b8618bc05ae86202078e59da60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/trees/4ba68b29ca30e7b8618bc05ae86202078e59da60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antifragil-tech/Finanzas-antifr-gil/git/commits/4e772494336522c4801c804d11a07080daffacf4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ba68b29ca30e7b8618bc05ae86202078e59da60\nparent f9cf8bafd7e9cefd9f4bbd5fe548687bc0fc70b0\nauthor antifragil-tech <info@antifragil.net> 1783252325 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783252325 +0200\n\nDRAFT — ci(host): permitir build sin credenciales Supabase reales (#26)\n\n* ci(host): permitir build sin credenciales Supabase reales\n\nEl prerender de next build ejecutaba createClient() en el cuerpo del\nrender de LoginForm y AppShell; sin NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL/ANON_KEY\nel build fallaba en /login y en todas las rutas del layout (app).\n\n- Nuevo guard apps/host/src/lib/env/supabaseEnv.ts: lee las env publicas\n  sin lanzar error y expone isSupabaseConfigured().\n- LoginForm crea el cliente dentro del submit; sin entorno muestra\n  estado operativo de configuracion pendiente.\n- AppShell crea el cliente dentro del useEffect (no corre en prerender).\n- Middleware fail-closed: sin entorno, toda ruta salvo /login redirige\n  a /login. Nunca se sirve la app sin auth.\n\nSin secrets, sin datos, sin tocar packages/supabase-client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(ci): documentar build sin secrets reales\n\nRegistra la decision en docs/governance/06-ci-build-without-secrets.md:\ncausa raiz, patron aplicado, rutas afectadas, pendiente para entorno\nreal y lo que explicitamente no se ha hecho.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: antifragil-tech <guillermovila@alsari.net>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSkVlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMgYQADk1Fd8yI1SWg4j9c5I0IRyx\n4i6AU3Rdc34A2OwSJbpMotAb3reNnWcUsB8DjaumYRkikccC/+L+yHPYdaV5n32x\nO3GxK8Rml8bO1imwqM63hXYWYp+XjNy4QfHSHFAA8it4ImnLuMo8IS3S5p1p095v\nmOBFc+xSE89kpCtvo+SUOyuLW+ZCA70L3Jql3Xd2t2Bec4DpgIAU/IdG8pfVO1AD\n0psTxB/yV7DmQ+QpqxEXDXTeNiZXRsq/sv5xCeV/kP62G2uIIzuYvzQAnXuJnG7r\n8GiFZhAZz8UiEVklsxpW73J3NAwXWeS0biWo1aNK9o6HPHKSxvILiIGupdi7OH8P\nhS0vh9rk8G9aWaiSpm16PI7dkW6RWTEuJrbQUcabQtgQ43K8t177pVmiaU