en-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/commits/ef84675906e415e989b07c92a795502828bbdc0e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/commits/4f1b9b6d1db99b56f54d35b6b5318a76fc9e9ac9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T16:03:32Z","email":"virendra.ahire@amdocs.com","name":"Virendra Ahire"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T16:03:32Z","email":"virendra.ahire@amdocs.com","name":"Virendra Ahire"},"message":"fix(ci): resolve dependencies from public npm registry\n\nThe lockfile pinned tarballs to an internal Artifactory mirror that\nis unreachable from GitHub Actions and Cloudflare, breaking install.\nRepoint all tarball URLs to registry.npmjs.org (identical artifacts,\nsame integrity hashes) and pin the registry in .npmrc so installs are\nreproducible on any machine or CI runner.","tree":{"sha":"a217575c04c09c0956d467028f0becbe7c505f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/git/trees/a217575c04c09c0956d467028f0becbe7c505f42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/git/commits/4f1b9b6d1db99b56f54d35b6b5318a76fc9e9ac9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/commit/4f1b9b6d1db99b56f54d35b6b5318a76fc9e9ac9","node_id":"C_kwDOTFJQWNoAKDRmMWI5YjZkMWRiOTliNTZmNTRkMzViNmI1MzE4YTc2ZmM5ZTlhYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/commit/97d162b2f47c70fe6017620c994c4f89deb90cbe","sha":"97d162b2f47c70fe6017620c994c4f89deb90cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/commits/97d162b2f47c70fe6017620c994c4f89deb90cbe"}],"sha":"4f1b9b6d1db99b56f54d35b6b5318a76fc9e9ac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viren-ahire-1999/frontend-platform-kit/commits/4f1b9b6d1db99b56f54d35b6b5318a76fc9e9ac9"},{"author":