Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/2ab3f0296820fbb33ef0972aee147ff5e0bbff78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:25:57Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:25:57Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"feat(a11y): label core interactive components\n\n- Button (both projects): add `accessibilityRole=\"button\"` + `accessibilityLabel`\n  so the control keeps a stable label even while it shows the loading spinner\n  (the label is otherwise derived from the now-hidden title). Brings the\n  screen-based Button up to parity with the feature-based one, which already\n  carried the role/state.\n- QuantityStepper: the icon-only \"-\"/\"+\" controls had no accessible name; add\n  role + \"Decrease/Increase quantity\" labels + disabled state, and label the\n  quantity TextInput.","tree":{"sha":"fadf3edd624d7d6ee6fce6bddbe418536c6fa811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/fadf3edd624d7d6ee6fce6bddbe418536c6fa811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/2ab3f0296820fbb33ef0972aee147ff5e0bbff78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/2ab3f0296820fbb33ef0972aee147ff5e0bbff78","node_id":"C_kwDOTFLNFtoAKDJhYjNmMDI5NjgyMGZiYjMzZWYwOTcyYWVlMTQ3ZmY1ZTBiYmZmNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80","sha":"59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80"}],"sha":"2ab3f0296820fbb33ef0972aee147ff5e0bbff78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/2ab3f0296820fbb33ef0972aee147ff5e0bbff78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:25:57Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:25:57Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"chore(lint): extend the View-purity rule to presentational components\n\nThe no-restricted-imports guard that keeps Views off the data/navigation layers\nwas scoped to `*View.tsx` only, so a presentational sub-component (a `*ReadyList`,\na `*Card`) could quietly import a query/service — the exact trap the old\nself-fetching AuthorChip fell into, since those files aren''t named `*View.tsx`.\n\nBroaden the rule''s glob to also match `src/**/components/**/*.tsx` in both\nprojects. All existing components already comply, so nothing else changes; the\nrule now fails the build if any presentational component reaches into\nservices/queries/mutations/stores/coordinators/navigation (or, in feature-based,\na deep cross-feature path).","tree":{"sha":"0097c0959869d4560284b4353929de5cff90846d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/0097c0959869d4560284b4353929de5cff90846d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80","node_id":"C_kwDOTFLNFtoAKDU5YTExYWEyODAwMWJlZjNlM2UyYjRmMjBhZjIyZDk1NjU0ODlhODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454","sha":"84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454"}],"sha":"59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/59a11aa28001bef3e3e2b4f20af22d9565489a80"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:41:01Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:41:01Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"refactor(profile): model ProfileViewModel as an empty|ready union\n\nThe feature-based ProfileViewModel exposed `profile: ProfileItem | null`, a\nnullable field rather than the discriminated union the screen-based sibling and\nthe documented invariant use. Convert it to `empty | ready`, move the empty copy\ninto the contract (`emptyMessage`) so the View renders a ready string and decides\nnothing, and switch the View on `status`.\n\nPer-layer tests updated to assert the contract by `status`.","tree":{"sha":"8016e34294c4f6d80c406db07dd7b10ca3d379e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/8016e34294c4f6d80c406db07dd7b10ca3d379e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454","node_id":"C_kwDOTFLNFtoAKDg0MTYzYTU3ZDRlYzdjY2M1OTYyMDg2NTIzOTQ5ZjE5YzBlZmM0NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab","sha":"e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab"}],"sha":"84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/84163a57d4ec7ccc5962086523949f19c0efc454"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:41:01Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:41:01Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"refactor(recipes): migrate ViewModels to the discriminated status union\n\nThe recipes feature was the lone hold-out still exposing async render state as\nparallel `isLoading` + `error` flags with always-present data — the exact\nanti-pattern the README''s \"ViewModel contracts at scale\" section forbids, and\nout of step with the sibling `products` feature.\n\nConvert all three to `loading | error | ready` unions:\n\n- Recipes & RecipesByTag: thin View that switches on status (with assertNever)\n  and delegates the ready branch to a new `RecipesReadyList` /\n  `RecipesByTagReadyList` — mirroring Products/Posts/Users. The extraction is\n  required because the list''s memoized `renderItem` depends on a ready-only\n  handler, which can''t be referenced before the union is narrowed.\n- RecipeDetail: inline switch in the View (the ProductDetail pattern).\n- Drop the now-dead `title` from the RecipesByTag contract (it only ever fed\n  `useScreenTitle`).\n\nPer-layer tests reworked to assert the contract by `status`.","tree":{"sha":"e2fe435c8bb3a50f0c7cb09beacb0cf401164e0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/e2fe435c8bb3a50f0c7cb09beacb0cf401164e0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab","node_id":"C_kwDOTFLNFtoAKGUwZWY0MTViYTkxMmMyM2FmMDkxNDNiYTFhYmZmZGZlZjcyY2FhYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/67c5502981ec4e4efdf51004e76cedb226767055","sha":"67c5502981ec4e4efdf51004e76cedb226767055","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/67c5502981ec4e4efdf51004e76cedb226767055"}],"sha":"e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/e0ef415ba912c23af09143ba1abffdfef72caaab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/67c5502981ec4e4efdf51004e76cedb226767055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:07:49Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:07:49Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"docs(feature-based): replace \"capability component\" with the public-hook pattern\n\nRewrite the README to match the orthodox refactor. The old \"capability\ncomponent\" section documented AuthorChip fetching its own data; replace it with\n\"Cross-feature data — a public hook, not a smart component\", explaining that the\nowning feature exposes a data hook the consumer''s ViewModel orchestrates while\nthe component stays dumb.\n\nAlso update the dependency graph, the component and hook tier tables, the ISP\nand testing bullets, and the screen-less-feature callout to reference\n`useAuthorSummary` + the dumb `AuthorChip`.","tree":{"sha":"9d18cfa6799d24e8dc414e29590aca7b0642e8e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/9d18cfa6799d24e8dc414e29590aca7b0642e8e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/67c5502981ec4e4efdf51004e76cedb226767055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexa