arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/207dd4881a410d8da92ec772e7c64fbf5ac41d9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:07:49Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T19:07:49Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"refactor(posts,users): orchestrate the author in the VM, keep AuthorChip dumb\n\nAuthorChip previously fetched and formatted its own user behind a `userId`\nprop — a \"smart component\" that hid I/O and a model dependency inside something\nthe app treats as pure presentation. Replace it with orthodox MVVM:\n\n- `users` exposes a public data hook `useAuthorSummary(userId)` returning a ready\n  `pending | ready{author}` contract, hiding its query + formatter behind one\n  surface.\n- `AuthorChip` becomes a dumb presentational component taking a ready\n  `AuthorSummary`.\n- `PostDetailViewModel` orchestrates: it resolves the author via\n  `useAuthorSummary` and folds the summary into its ready contract;\n  `PostDetailView` passes that down to the dumb chip.\n- Drop the now-dead `authorId` from `PostDetailItem`.\n\nThe cross-feature seam stays one public hook + one type; components stay dumb\nand the screen orchestrates. Per-layer tests updated; 516 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"96f515fd6c5c4be5951a90c9f3923b37e3f179ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/96f515fd6c5c4be5951a90c9f3923b37e3f179ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/207dd4881a410d8da92ec772e7c64fbf5ac41d9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifi