{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/68e707bfca579e75797df1bb5e4748bddb088bd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T23:05:44Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T23:05:44Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"docs(root): restore audience descriptor on Rung 3 cell\n\nTreat modular monolith and micro-frontend as parallel alternatives at the same\ntier and share one audience line (\"large org, many teams\") between them — the\nprevious \"(usual next step)\" / \"(rarer)\" qualifiers carried editorial weight\nbetter placed in the deeper scaling-ladder discussion of the screen-based\nREADME. Each option gets a one-line definition so the cell still distinguishes\nthem at a glance:\n\n- modular monolith: one build, isolated packages\n- micro-frontend: independent builds, runtime composed\n\nCells 1 and 2 padded with two blank rows so the borders still align in ASCII.","tree":{"sha":"1dd51ffaa360081040f438ceda6abf66ee17483a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/1dd51ffaa360081040f438ceda6abf66ee17483a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/68e707bfca579e75797df1bb5e4