l":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/c3c325c5eb0ffd8738002c886476ec91005a2243/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:35:18Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:35:18Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"docs: align with AppError pipeline; Rung 3 skip-on-first-read; gloss + table fix\n\n- Drop the \"neutral read hooks\" framing in feature-based; queries/ owns the\n  TanStack choice and exposes its return shape as the contract. The earlier\n  prose oversold a portability layer the code didn''t actually project.\n- Rewrite the screen-based `services/` section and add an end-to-end error\n  pipeline callout, anchored to seven concrete `file:line` locations:\n  client.ts → classifyTransportError → AppError → service → queryClient (by\n  reason) → VM `status: \"error\"` → toLoginErrorMessage → View.\n- Inline a one-line \"discriminated union\" gloss at both first-uses in the\n  screen-based README (the \"three things\" callout and the \"View consumes\n  ready-to-render data\" rule); replace the lone \"tagged\" with \"discriminated\"\n  for term consistency.\n- Add a \"Skip this section on a first read\" callout at the head of Rung 3 in\n  the screen-based README, mirroring the pattern feature-based already uses\n  for advanced subsections.\n- Fix the broken 3-column table at `mvvm-screen-based/README.md:1056-1057` —\n  the EAS-Update-channels row had its \"What it really is\" and \"Cost\" cells\n  merged, and the Separate-apps row was missing its Cost cell entirely.","tree":{"sha":"8e21b63ec2d7bd0b8325e4bbc41785dfaf036017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/8e21b63ec2d7bd0b8325e4bbc41785dfaf036017"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/c3c325c5eb0ffd8738002c886476ec91005a2243","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/c3c325c5eb0ffd8738002c886476ec91005a2243","node_id":"C_kwDOTFLNFtoAKGMzYzMyNWM1ZWIwZmZkODczODAwMmM4ODY0NzZlYzkxMDA1YTIyNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commit/3eb2b89679b597920a72d235d56ef0115f767346","sha":"3eb2b89679b597920a72d235d56ef0115f767346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/3eb2b89679b597920a72d235d56ef0115f767346"}],"sha":"c3c325c5eb0ffd8738002c886476ec91005a2243","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/c3c325c5eb0ffd8738002c886476ec91005a2243"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/3eb2b89679b597920a72d235d56ef0115f767346/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:35:07Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:35:07Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"refactor: classify transport errors as AppError; remove axios from queryClient\n\nIntroduce a shared `AppError` + `AppErrorReason` taxonomy in\n`{shared/,}errors/AppError.ts` and a single `classifyTransportError` in\n`{shared/,}api/` — the one place outside `client.ts` allowed to import axios.\n\nBoth queryClients now decide retry from `error.reason` only and import zero\ntransport concepts. The feature-based `shared/config/queryClient.ts` regression\n(it used `isAxiosError`) is fixed; the screen-based version is generalized off\nthe feature-specific `ProductsError` it used to switch on.\n\nAll five feature-based services that previously bubbled raw axios failures\n(`products`, `posts`, `comments`, `users`, `recipes`) now wrap in `AppError` so\ntheir VMs and formatters can finally distinguish `network` / `not_found` /\n`server` / `unauthorized` / `validation` rather than shipping a single generic\nmessage.\n\n`LoginError` extends `AppError` and carries an optional `invalid_credentials`\nrefinement — preserving the credential-rejection message while letting retry /\ninterceptor logic see the shared `reason` like every other service.\n`RegisterError` and `ProductsError` had no extra state and are deleted; their\nservices throw `AppError` directly.\n\nTests rewritten to assert both `instanceof AppError` (or `LoginError`) and the\nmeaningful field combo (`reason` + `refinement`), locking the contract instead\nof just the class shape.\n\nSB 201/201, FB 511/511; `tsc --noEmit` and `eslint .` clean in both repos.","tree":{"sha":"cd01d954608a57fe52e9a80ab689297cae82b234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/cd01d954608a57fe52e9a80ab689297cae82b234"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/3eb2b89679b597920a72d235d56ef0115f767346","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"veri