i.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/commits/37b9c013998fc79854a2e298a7316ea8fc730c56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T16:40:25Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T16:40:25Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"docs: editorial pass — plain-English glosses, worked Rung 3 example, navigation polish\n\nReduces architecture-speak across both READMEs without changing rigor:\n- Three-things callout at the top of screen-based; data-flow diagram legend\n- Plain-English follow-ups for lint→compile, TS project references, DIP\n- Minimal worked tsconfig.json/package.json example for Rung 3a\n- Rung 3a split into Phase 1 (should you climb?) / Phase 2 (how) / Phase 3 (pitfalls)\n- Consolidated duplicate native-module-drift warning into RN-specific costs section\n- Relocated heavy contract-uniformity callout from feature-based intro into a dedicated, opt-in advanced section\n- Renamed \"api ⇄ auth cycle\" heading to a plain-English form; updated cross-link\n- Removed accidentally duplicated Rung 3b tooling table","tree":{"sha":"13085e9e2c26