:15:46Z","email":"alexandrecoura96@gmail.com","name":"Alexandre Coura"},"message":"refactor: extract Ready-branch children to keep Views passive\n\nRemoves three hook-ordering hacks (PLACEHOLDER_BOUNDS in ProductDetailView,\nnoOp callbacks in PostsView and ProductsView) by moving the ready-branch body\ninto a child component that owns its hooks. Parent Views now just switch on\nviewModel.status — no stateful hook ever runs with bogus state, no callback\never wraps a no-op default.\n\n- QuantityStepper owns useStepper(bounds)\n- PostsReadyList / ProductsReadyList own the FlatList renderItem useCallback","tree":{"sha":"fa3197912bceb7d8fe46573777362333d4f00c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/trees/fa3197912bceb7d8fe46573777362333d4f00c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexandrecoura96/react-native-mvvm/git/commits/b7382b0ad5647928a2ddeb912272d9394b6ddae9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64710438?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandrecoura96","id":64710438,"login":"alexandrecoura96","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NzEwNDM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexandrecoura96/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap