vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commit/6deb4f8d0514f88d1c02407ee8554f89da5abd74","node_id":"C_kwDOTFOOOdoAKDZkZWI0ZjhkMDUxNGY4OGQxYzAyNDA3ZWU4NTU0Zjg5ZGE1YWJkNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commit/8aaae4604a97264ba4f6c58cc64b639b74ac7857","sha":"8aaae4604a97264ba4f6c58cc64b639b74ac7857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commits/8aaae4604a97264ba4f6c58cc64b639b74ac7857"}],"sha":"6deb4f8d0514f88d1c02407ee8554f89da5abd74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commits/6deb4f8d0514f88d1c02407ee8554f89da5abd74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10894099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/navinkarkera","id":10894099,"login":"navinkarkera","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk0MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commits/8aaae4604a97264ba4f6c58cc64b639b74ac7857/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T18:44:36Z","email":"navin@opencraft.com","name":"Navin Karkera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T18:44:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: index and entity link sync issues on parent block deletion (#37541)\n\nMeilisearch index documents were not synced properly when any block with children blocks like units, subsections, sections etc. were being deleted as the `XBLOCK_DELETED` is only triggered for the deleted block.\nThis PR fixes it by deleting all index documents that contain the deleted block in its `breadcrumbs` field as only blocks that are children of this block will have it its breadcrumbs field.\n\nSimilarly, the entity links that store links between course and library blocks was not synced properly due to children `ContainerLinks` not being deleted.","tree":{"sha":"2318660ec992af4204c47b4d9c843c26558a3f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/2318660ec992af4204c47b4d9c843c26558a3f7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/8aaae4604a97264ba4f6c58cc64b639b74ac7857","verification":{"payload":"tree 2318660ec992af4204c47b4d9c843c26558a3f7d\nparent 121fee30355ac5362001eafe2de76a8a1e80290d\nauthor Navin Karkera <navin@opencraft.com> 1761590676 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761590676 -0500\n\nfix: index and entity link sync issues on parent block deletion (#37541)\n\nMeilisearch index documents were not synced properly when any block with children blocks like units, subsections, sections etc. were being deleted as the `XBLOCK_DELETED` is only triggered for the deleted block.\nThis PR fixes it by deleting all index documents that contain the deleted block in its `breadcrumbs` field as only blocks that are children of this block will have it its breadcrumbs field.\n\nSimilarly, the entity links that store links between course and library blocks was not synced properly due to children `ContainerLinks` not being deleted.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo/72UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABLUQAAV7ynxTzXO4DYLDCgtMefa1\nBWxaJJ5YoF+LExMsazfZEdWgx8Qw9sFDeBJwmReI0L5LEQ65L5U4t4MF2Slk5kMY\na9Pt6qUdqrhj8oaxiciJTC7uU3cS418wVXnymZ0zv0CpaEyAPrJOUGc1fMRMUv6m\nZaOKQImtAbTwo06XO9gKu9YMVNuUkr3K5XZGBhwiw8UJLkhdAzAud6ifGkvGxZzf\ntRGDwPf06lHpdZq2+s/pJAZVf1m1e1CUXxdJSyLy4NIjoGmP1Ojne+Fv5HmeNyb8\nf80rJLZkA/9g/mQdMx3Ci5Zo0A9l9HnkbwCa4HDRj+2KPD8BMkSiwIouA5jURCFf\njgrsyB0vrqWWaFJK2rPlz98niZXj6wUEn9jc9EcxGc9it1fBJGcTvo9QaX0TkdkD\nIukqxNQWi+R4alQH3WS8EGIkeHYUtXHkRdAPqcwThdHOAIFf/AMeNnjtU5Uys9mA\nSdR4FbMqdKFaMdDRi9tqD6SYlp/4Y0kXGahG/XCohbUDjPGImErKVzLHRys7CqM9\nMjpwgsNnfHkHS+/vLFtEON+EubpzhTr2ACSvjQI3MWX9yMleiXZH/dKPQzvIN2vB\nyDGI/wbcuENi6FULTMDqjXO5TubKP2ZfH1Gth/9TXYyleqwIP+v7Ar7bSM3kydTv\ndgLfASbM12qNzK2/HR+A\n=y82T\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-25T17:42:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"