nt` for\nevery component that was in an iframe that was not the split test\ncomponent.  We''re changing the logic to say that we should not render\nthe old buttons on pages where the authoring view provides an\nalternative set of buttons.  Which in this case is just the\nunit/vertical page.  All other containers should render the old buttons\nsince the new authoring MFE does not provide them.","tree":{"sha":"91a2a280f1bc321bc7f07000bc1297a6174ecbea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/91a2a280f1bc321bc7f07000bc1297a6174ecbea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/3c5cc6fffd0bf90cbf62bc4afee431a09e4151e0","verification":{"payload":"tree 91a2a280f1bc321bc7f07000bc1297a6174ecbea\nparent 4afff6ef5c4433088f3dde8671ab8a8dc456910a\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1761249421 -0400\ncommitter Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1761249421 -0400\n\nfix: Adding components to xblocks with children.\n\nPreviously the container JS would remove the `add-xblock-component` for\nevery component that was in an iframe that was not the split test\ncomponent.  We''re changing the logic to say that we should not render\nthe old buttons on pages where the authoring view provides an\nalternative set of buttons.  Which in this case is just the\nunit/vertical page.  All other containers should render the old buttons\nsince the new authoring MFE does not provide them.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDFYRWaLkJgizbOvA88L1WtWKAr\nP17funxYmxKSkYVCkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLWxyDbu+dFhHlzolfFXEqz220W2HA05WBlqvxMXlCUVZvqfg8F7YVP8ReVegjj8DY\nLFjTchZQhxMM9eTb7gxwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.