omments service references (#37503)\n\nThis commit removes all remaining references to cs_comments_service\nexcept the ForumsConfig model. The only purpose of keeping the model\nand table around is so that the webapp processes don''t start throwing\nerrors during deployment because they''re running the old code for a\nfew minutes after the database migration has run. We can drop\nForumsConfig and add the drop-table migration after Ulmo is cut.\n\nAlso bumps the openedx-forum version to 0.3.7\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Taimoor  Ahmed <taimoor.ahmed@A006-01711.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo+kBHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVVAQAIvHGtLPE+HWHUUaNxAqBe2W\nMsPsB3/w9uHJs+AY4Z/EoqRvH3KmmSsheqo1CMMSJK0YHE8L+4RfSfZ9dadTSX32\nrNwtGE0Rf1AtGtnrr7tzy6cDIGZY9ZfWjSn6dGbrHEJGtHzTCfE7Xiny9PwzWP2z\nVWilqUiH3esEITv87cWlFZ7+VVn0rU178kSPWAa9vqbs3kDakgLpXP5JwySy9IBx\n/8jxQs0H9B4sNYr8GtVU4sPmR/PvjcnUQYVuhvc+cokb8kRX9uRnjSoPvYP/tR7f\nchtVMksy2Mbv9fMa773QbQ5rqIGtKb+qkHNVczhjEXxGEOv77Mt3T0fmkRtK3U1e\nR7ttCkVbrqN8DQP8WUGo9gKXNY6WHZWxSTGE0edwaE5QPnRnr8E2LBPxXYbb7xzO\ngEnCLiWGwd3ZBr27qlUGhuHWigELehMyNDrOK66vQcQAh3lWwACXzBlgFxw971xz\nk6Sql2o0AvLSAHdX98POBVVz4N9vC8dhNeCOGD5AGlMWYk7XRsR99z029mELhk48\nMlb0Ud/wzRVMBFLo0FxH5n+ccDPkOPQQGvBnfzyO+BXLIYa1j4WVrsyJcqYASsXO\nobPIepFP+w2cGFHKEteLtMHJpVUYKNnsn+H3EWMmHCbmXsr5MUN/FAhPDxXu8gHm\ni0iQs280LJbNQ/bJ04zD\n=8J0i\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-25T17:42:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://a