.github.com/users/Anas12091101/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anas12091101/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anas12091101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anas12091101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anas12091101","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commits/4afff6ef5c4433088f3dde8671ab8a8dc456910a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T14:15:42Z","email":"88967643+Anas12091101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Muhammad Anas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T14:15:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: shift progress calculation to backend, add never_but_include_grade (#37399)\n\nThis commit migrates the data calculation logic for the GradeSummary\ntable, which was previously in the frontend-app-learning.\n\nThis commit also introduces a new visibility option for assignment\nscores: “Never show individual assessment results, but show overall\nassessment results after the due date.”\n\nWith this option, learners cannot see question-level correctness or\nscores at any time. However, once the due date has passed, they can\nview their overall score in the total grades section on the Progress\npage.\n\nThese two changes are coupled with each other because it compromises\nthe integrity of this data to do the score hiding logic on the front\nend.\n\nThe corresponding frontend PR is: openedx/frontend-app-learning#1797","tree":{"sha":"6f2e10eecb5f0cf56851f620e95f19f8a1c5fc6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/6f2e10eecb5f0cf56851f620e95f19f8a1c5fc6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/4afff6ef5c4433088f3dde8671ab8a8dc456910a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f2e10eecb5f0cf56851f620e95f19f8a1c5fc6d\nparent bf8ffe4cf7a879649ad405d252b