16:11:57Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"fix: Handle a case that could cause infinite redirects.\n\nIf ENABLE_MKTG_SITE is True, MKTG_URLS[''ROOT''] must be set.  However if\nit is set to the same value as the LMS_ROOT_URL (which points to this\nview), you can end up in an infinite redirect loop.  If the two URLs do\nmatch, don''t redirect, just fall through to the content that this page\nwould have responded with instead.","tree":{"sha":"19beed272c406e6f0881685275a3a0778d15def0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/19beed272c406e6f0881685275a3a0778d15def0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/a0ab48921f016a47ecd3429c590632771e7e6af5","verification":{"payload":"tree 19beed272c406e6f0881685275a3a0778d15def0\nparent 82073d395c989b315887743b556454d1a593e6f5\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1760988580 -0400\ncommitter Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1761063117 -0400\n\nfix: Handle a case that could cause infinite redirects.\n\nIf ENABLE_MKTG_SITE is True, MKTG_URLS[''ROOT''] must be set.  However if\nit is set to the same value as the LMS_ROOT_URL (which points to this\nview), you can end up in an infinite redirect loop.  If the two URLs do\nmatch, don''t redirect, just fall through to the content that this page\nwould have responded with instead.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDFYRWaLkJgizbOvA88L1WtWKAr\nP17funxYmxKSkYVCkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPoY6DoJkL/WGyI6g1I2yj2bxdo8asEUdOYHxXyVVuD7eSpF0QpC78yoMidsEp+V2V\nLkQb+/OWIieyH82ownuwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.g