unt":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-20T22:02:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Update `on_commit_changes_to` of modulestore to check MySQL transaction [FC-0097] (#37485)\n\n- `handle_update_xblock_upstream_link` is called asynchronously with celery. In `update_upstream_downstream_link_handler`, the xblock has the updated version, but when calling `handle_update_xblock_upstream_link` inside Celery, the xblock is outdated in a previous version, which is why the error occurs. This happens because `on_commit_changes_to` is executed before the MySQL transaction ends.\n- Added `ImmediateOnCommitMixin` to be used in tests that need to call `on_commit_changes_to`. See https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/pull/37485#issuecomment-3412979170  for more info","tree":{"sha":"9ac5a46e5a84e00451bee8738e72501a711ed9c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/9ac5a46e5a84e00451bee8738e72501a711ed9c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/3f5ac6ddbc98dc1a17c86396f1bfcf8c1ab72c58","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ac5a46e5a84e00451bee8738e72501a711ed9c9\nparent 23295c5e18aa9192655338790158c0e2d6c25b7d\nauthor Chris Chávez <xnpiochv@gmail.com> 1760997724 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1760997724 -0500\n\nfix: Update `on_commit_changes_to` of modulestore to check MySQL transaction [FC-0097] (#37485)\n\n- `handle_update_xblock_upstream_link` is called asynchronously with celery. In `update_upstream_downstream_link_handler`, the xblock has the updated version, but when calling `handle_update_xblock_upstream_link` inside Celery, the xblock is outdated in a previous version, which is why the error occurs. This happens because `on_commit_changes_to` is executed before the MySQL transaction ends.\n- Added `ImmediateOnCommitMixin` to be used in tests that need to call `on_commit_changes_to`. See https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/pull/37485#issuecomment-3412979170