 replaced with an equivalent page in the authoring MFE\nwhich has been on by default since Teak.  This change removes the\nability to fallback to the old page using waffle flags.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The `legacy_studio.course_outline` waffle flag will be removed\nand the code will behave as if it''s always set to `False`. Preventing\nyou from falling back to the old Course Outline page.","tree":{"sha":"cc0073a42269489bfb5aafbb9599260d25990a1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/cc0073a42269489bfb5aafbb9599260d25990a1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/e64d4cee8db4d9c0f0a2067e8781590b76a39da8","verification":{"payload":"tree cc0073a42269489bfb5aafbb9599260d25990a1b\nparent 1ca24ee71c469a2bb343a4a9071bf92b576abd1c\nauthor Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1760114634 -0400\ncommitter Feanil Patel <feanil@axim.org> 1760970408 -0400\n\nfeat!: Drop the legacy course_outline page.\n\nThis page has been replaced with an equivalent page in the authoring MFE\nwhich has been on by default since Teak.  This change removes the\nability to fallback to the old page using waffle flags.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The `legacy_studio.course_outline` waffle flag will be removed\nand the code will behave as if it''s always set to `False`. Preventing\nyou from falling back to the old Course Outline page.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgDFYRWaLkJgizbOvA88L1WtWKAr\nP17funxYmxKSkYVCkAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHzMBtH/6PYC1W3UYOf70oGnVKj8wwWs7Fg8UzQu+DI5Ecs9QQqb0jisSvwZrOkj38\nnnVqMeBpTeoCF7nWbfLgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.g