":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/commits/20bc7113e3aa44702680453b7edb80b6ed5038ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-10T16:48:00Z","email":"kyle@axim.org","name":"Kyle McCormick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-10T16:48:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat!: Remove Studio Maintenance & Announcements (#37432)\n\nThe announcements editor was never ported to frontend-app-authoring, and\nthe announcements display was never ported to frontend-app-learner-dashboard.\nThis announcements feature is rarely used, undocumented, non-a11y-friendly, and\nthere were no volunteers to port it to the new frontends. It is the last\nremaining part of the legacy Studio \"Maintenance\" dashboard. So, we are\nremoving it.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: This removes...\n* Studio Maintenance dashboard legacy frontend\n* Studio Edit Announcements legacy frontend\n* The snippet of legacy learner dashboard which renders announcements\n* openedx/features/announcements djangoapp\n* The ENABLE_ANNOUNCEMENTS feature flag\n\nNot removed:\n* The announcements_announcement table from openedx/features/announcements .\n  The table is most likely very small, as it is only populated by administrators. Removing\n  it would be more labor for us and more risk of toil for operators than is worthwhile.\n\nCloses: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36263","tree":{"sha":"8ec07fd065ac8863ea97edabe90936c5836a8372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/trees/8ec07fd065ac8863ea97edabe90936c5836a8372"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/animorphixx-7/openedx-platform/git/commits/20bc7113e3aa44702680453b7edb80b6ed5038ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ec07fd065ac8863ea97edabe90936c5836a8372\nparent 09e86e24b215620f351c532649dacf5db38da8f6\nauthor Kyle McCormick <kyle@axim.org> 1760114880 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1760114880 -0400\n\nfeat!: Remove Studio Maintenance & Announcements (#37432)\n\nThe announcements editor was never ported to frontend-app-authoring, and\nthe announcements display was never ported to frontend-app-learner-dashboard.\nThis announcements feature is rarely used, undocumented, non-a11y-friendly, and\nthere were no volunteers to port it to the new frontends. It is the last\nremaining part of the legacy Studio \"Maintenance\" dashboard. So, we are\nremoving it.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: This removes...\n* Studio Maintenance dashboard legacy frontend\n* Studio Edit Announcements legacy frontend\n* The snippet of legacy learner dashboard which renders announcements\n* openedx/features/announcements djangoapp\n* The ENABLE_ANNOUNCEMENTS feature flag\n\nNot removed:\n* The announcements_announcement table from openedx/features/announcements .\n  The table is most likely very small, as it is only populated by administrators. Removing\n  it would be more labor for us and more risk of toil for operators than is worthwhile.\n\nCloses: https://github.com/openedx/edx-platform/issues/36263","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo6TjACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWLsQADru0odKLXLWrtwnlQxzXTmv\nK6wo0SJAlXM+Z45ehMGvcWgNfMtC5DO/hAYCEAtIFQ4XFjBWBr9kwd4K8D7o95nk\nYLzAIwdvfGzTID+lg3vVi1u/6N9xWXzTJP/nTHSN0vJP9tRFQP+sJpqXbAj4IZ95\n3FqpHQRzwL15hFdRM118ohuiIeRv8IPxeeSu3m7nDBdNEHFx26curn4wspdaTwFb\nO4ZksswQbev4dNgx2tL4Sn1K7KYJF9tN+GXrnZc631UTH1YgL9LeyV/H5kctij54\nuvxdhOlJKX3DmG3yv7R9Sg3UWdhzQ2H5ceeffH6O+00eb1ktBIqt9+FsvNTe8vPc\np6sktYXXfAsAoZG/2ovaPPIIGhO9zEh72VsVYy7cApWL5Ss57Z8ogcFlmAYd8r3R\n9rlrlGsfV1P4Dd3YWk//aWLdzkVJxtkGJ6z5835eFGXSD6A+e10mLmKsjl2p7s5o\n+AA5awqfvyxpEQzn+4cx4jrBfwk+6jxrIxAIgblKswmIeAp7efR/QdsPf5kHmwWI\nM6oJTt8HMmLfNchd96qWlblTjLi28KwNKY1H2