c01dd8bb33369694aea236ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commits/80da31849e66ac0c01dd8bb33369694aea236ae5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1045033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpeterso","id":1045033,"login":"gpeterso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDUwMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commits/081bfd8453e7f087c4bb14a5aeeea21aa336f392/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T19:20:20Z","email":"1045033+gpeterso@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeff Peterson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T19:20:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update hathi-trust add-on headers (#5)\n\n- allow CORS preflight requests\n- cache hashed js chuck files for 30 days\n- don''t cache remoteEntry.js\n\nTechnically, this last one isn''t needed because Primo includes a\ncache-busting query param when it loads remoteEntry.js. However,\nthis behavior could change at some point in the future, and we\nwouldn''t know about it.","tree":{"sha":"785441d1e55a8432ec56c1f58ca22b9cd15d3027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/git/trees/785441d1e55a8432ec56c1f58ca22b9cd15d3027"},"url":"