riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commits/ebd2d1d76c1b90edfc7c689c37c0dc7b920a3092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:05:18Z","email":"1045033+gpeterso@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeff Peterson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T17:05:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Isolate @vendor/custom-module library (#4)\n\nBecause we''re crudely using webpack''s NormalModuleReplacementPlugin\nto replace customComponentMappings with a project''s local\ncomponent-mappings.ts file, this can cause problems when two MF\nremotes depend on @vendor/custom-module because webpack shares all\nworkspace libraries by default. The workaround is explicitly remove\nthis library from the list for shared mappings. Without this fix\nthe component mappings from the first-loaded remote module will\nget applied to the subsequently-loaded remote modules.","tree":{"sha":"2b0938816e0c0374cf9f5a077de603cd002d1ca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/git/trees/2b0938816e0c0374cf9f5a077de603cd002d1ca0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/git/commits/ebd2d1d76c1b90edfc7c689c37c0dc7b920a3092","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b0938816e0c0374cf9f5a077de603cd002d1ca0\nparent 67eba769934dbe5adc724b9f12a5eda7878da724\nauthor Jeff Peterson <1045033+gpeterso@users.noreply.github.com> 1789578318 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789578318 -0500\n\nIsolate @vendor/custom-module library (#4)\n\nBecause we''re crudely using webpack''s NormalModuleReplacementPlugin\nto replace customComponentMappings with a project''s local\ncomponent-mappings.ts file, this can cause problems when two MF\nremotes depend on @vendor/custom-module because webpack shares all\nworkspace libraries by default. The workaround is explicitly remove\nthis library from the list for shared mappings. Without this fix\nthe component mappings from the first-loaded remote module will\nget applied to the subsequently-loaded remote modules.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqsxOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAigsQAEtCTCDELEU2e0JakoWa8eSe\nRs8znHVPN/Cr4vYciVHRO+jvKHxE/MCJhLwd5HtBFgiA0qXBkr0P5G7h/5juP6/S\ne2VPkbizyb5a37uj/bLyonxBRrLS728LmzMAB+GmZgIyqLNe96w3GtsJe0tvwAQZ\nRvNAckKYr6FC5LBt8hNhgkJegRJxiKUTaPhXwPePcg2ZBN07TQEuS6YWCsFVy1cc\n47kjC91VLmLCzE0fbjnVklGFxuAf6Hakm+DYiaIKY0DAoAo9NV9MdQO/97uCKuqM\nwvvROa4RaaZ6em7P59TTqINacpf3vqjUUloVMquF2mXfNQeVcMk5MGD2j5KoBGEB\naXtg/Rtnu4r49FCd43pV/cCIy8l+dHjRo1qm9cBOh9uq/PZVEL/1BVbe90x9yuqr\nxw1Cf8uO/DFz4dKioYKxfNyiYhIJkIqxbmzdcxvLUVhDRSqQHCjAh4J7bVNpmaJ4\nGlRdsSdc39sXZzApB6YlC4iFgdj72fc0iTsDMulIwdWte66oxd6OLUUpaESINrr3\nYbEKTgHlUWuMlZFvj7fqkX0ALWIuZLyeIJ8PPfsoAqGuM1DclZu1lIksG16EUpBm\nHYmFRxR2wLuHkk1y1YsCL1dusFYXohh4yth49KauuJ6bPT4XoPZtBfhgQXLtXg1m\njLW13xBwmIaenpOCORjN\n=56BP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T17:05:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commit/ebd2d1d76c1b90edfc7c689c37c0dc7b920a3092","node_id":"C_kwDOTFR8JdoAKGViZDJkMWQ3NmMxYjkwZWRmYzdjNjg5YzM3YzBkYzdiOTIwYTMwOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commit/67eba769934dbe5adc724b9f12a5eda7878da724","sha":"67eba769934dbe5adc724b9f12a5eda7878da724","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commits/67eba769934dbe5adc724b9f12a5eda7878da724"}],"sha":"ebd2d1d76c1b90edfc7c689c37c0dc7b920a3092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commits/ebd2d1d76c1b90edfc7c689c37c0dc7b920a3092"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1045033?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gpeterso","id":1045033,"login":"gpeterso","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDUwMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gpeterso","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/commits/67eba769934dbe5adc724b9f12a5eda7878da724/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:55:22Z","email":"1045033+gpeterso@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeff Peterson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T14:55:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix minor add-on issues (#3)\n\n* Fix GHA package & deploy steps\n\nUnlike `run-many`, `--projects` is not a valid argument for the nx\n`affected` command, but nx will quietly ignore extraneous arguments\nwhich can sometimes cause problems. In this case, the filtering\nperformed by `--projects` is redundant, given the plugin definitions.\n\n* Add add-on dev server notes to readme\n\n* Remove hathi-trust from base view\n\nPlanning to use the add-on going forward...\n\n* Fix hathi-trust lib name","tree":{"sha":"6be0c20e09b17edbad36986d6fbe38c0fa4ba520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/git/trees/6be0c20e09b17edbad36986d6fbe38c0fa4ba520"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UMNLibraries/primo-nde/git/commits/67eba769934dbe5adc724b9f12a5eda7878da724","verification":{"payload":"tree 6be0c20e09b17edbad36986d6fbe38c0fa4ba520\nparent 80d045e7e67d3eb699bbaaf0b010244d199d1545\nauthor Jeff Peterson <1045033+gpeterso@users.noreply.github.com> 1789484122 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789484122 -0500\n\nFix minor add-on issues (#3)\n\n* Fix GHA package & deploy steps\n\nUnlike `run-many`, `--projects` is not a valid argument for the nx\n`affected` command, but nx will quietly ignore extraneous arguments\nwhich can sometimes cause problems. In this case, the filtering\nperformed by `--projects` is redundant, given the plugin definitions.\n\n* Add add-on dev server notes to readme\n\n* Remove hathi-trust from base view\n\nPlanning to use the add-on going forward...\n\n* Fix hathi-trust lib name","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqVxaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1BkQACy2+ej/qc9wTwpvf/NcNXmH\nIeNN8R6O+AsmZNrexSS/lV3hisQ5YDqM3REafL19+HaBP1o61GtcDojqE5DMJVFm\nOkcmy2ZR4oVfFUY89iBj0JMrfI8k2VRA2tyz7M3WQNUGaJzT0RS7AURXj+/kSKhH\nv3nk04/50V0UWYih9dp3KUbLJVl3w+brQ3IHQtxTE99AlPl3kRZbVEWVvLG08U/a\nQyfh2mSCSjAdbdPvoVRx2Mb5V0hcRzlBS8cQJFQw+zbGjLjeGpiYMcY6V3vfCAZF\nSbl6feN6mxtQwux5SyxsNqvZe3PmAIXw84DDayTsRtq8UXtMQB+NiEJnIEDNQIC2\nSFpQbv7Md