ope/commits/81edb4d110ac2b333c03e77acf9d08a20a92af3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:48:31Z","email":"rajveerpall04@gmail.com","name":"Rajveer Singh Pall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:48:31Z","email":"rajveerpall04@gmail.com","name":"Rajveer Singh Pall"},"message":"Add federated report plots and PDF export\n\nFederatedReport gains plot_auc_forest (per-node AUC with DeLong CIs),\nplot_calibration (per-node reliability curves via core.reliability_diagram,\nusing each node''s retained (y, score)), and to_pdf (multi-page summary + forest +\ncalibration via matplotlib PdfPages, no extra dependency). Mirrors the healthcare\nreport.","tree":{"sha":"1e5bdb10c8e07647a1fde970d0a39279d140f364","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/git/trees/1e5bdb10c8e07647a1fde970d0a39279d140f364"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/git/commits/81edb4d110ac2b333c03e77acf9d08a20a92af3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code","id":180284229,"login":"Rajveer-code","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7rRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commit/81edb4d110ac2b333c03e77acf9d08a20a92af3a","node_id":"C_kwDOTFSTHtoAKDgxZWRiNGQxMTBhYzJiMzMzYzAzZTc3YWNmOWQwOGEyMGE5MmFmM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commit/cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419","sha":"cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commits/cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419"}],"sha":"81edb4d110ac2b333c03e77acf9d08a20a92af3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commits/81edb4d110ac2b333c03e77acf9d08a20a92af3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code","id":180284229,"login":"Rajveer-code","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7rRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commits/cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:44:20Z","email":"rajveerpall04@gmail.com","name":"Rajveer Singh Pall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:44:20Z","email":"rajveerpall04@gmail.com","name":"Rajveer Singh Pall"},"message":"Add per-node recalibration with pre/post ECE to federated report\n\nFederatedReport.recalibrate() fits temperature scaling (Guo et al., 2017) or\nisotonic regression (Zadrozny & Elkan, 2002) per node on that node''s own scores\nand reports pre/post ECE. Temperature scaling operates on logits, so per-node\nprobabilities are converted to logits first; both core helpers are unpacked as\n(_, calibrated). Reuses fairscope.core; invents no statistics. Documented as an\nin-sample diagnostic.","tree":{"sha":"d11a0a71f3d57e9b8960e9ddd2baf4bf04aed9fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/git/trees/d11a0a71f3d57e9b8960e9ddd2baf4bf04aed9fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/git/commits/cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code","id":180284229,"login":"Rajveer-code","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7rRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commit/cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419","node_id":"C_kwDOTFSTHtoAKGNhZGQ2ZTQ4ZjI5MWU4M2ViNDVjMGE3OWRmYTJkNjQwNmEzZmQ0MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commit/b95535054e068e841e875f62bce42f5a2fe71c20","sha":"b95535054e068e841e875f62bce42f5a2fe71c20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commits/b95535054e068e841e875f62bce42f5a2fe71c20"}],"sha":"cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commits/cadd6e48f291e83eb45c0a79dfa2d6406a3fd419"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code","id":180284229,"login":"Rajveer-code","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7rRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commits/b95535054e068e841e875f62bce42f5a2fe71c20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:39:19Z","email":"rajveerpall04@gmail.com","name":"Rajveer Singh Pall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T07:39:19Z","email":"rajveerpall04@gmail.com","name":"Rajveer Singh Pall"},"message":"Add FederatedFairnessAudit per-node metrics and cross-node disparity\n\nFirst task of the federated module: audit per-node predictions of a multi-site\n(federated) model. Per node, compute the DeLong AUC confidence interval, ECE,\nBrier, and F1; across nodes, compute the max-min AUC gap and Bonferroni-corrected\npairwise unpaired DeLong tests. Pure composition of fairscope.core plus direct\nsklearn metric calls; no new statistics, no model training, no privacy claim.","tree":{"sha":"adf5184d40fe9a7dc8922972e77aa1e0b968c82f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/git/trees/adf5184d40fe9a7dc8922972e77aa1e0b968c82f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rajveer-code/fairscope/git/commits/b95535054e068e841e875f62bce42f5a2fe71c20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284229?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code","id":180284229,"login":"Rajveer-code","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7rRQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rajveer-code","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commit/b95535054e068e841e875f62bce42f5a2fe71c20","node_id":"C_kwDOTFSTHtoAKGI5NTUzNTA1NGUwNjhlODQxZTg3NWY2MmJjZTQyZjVhMmZlNzFjMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rajveer-code/fairscope/commit/579a7ac361