anshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T16:23:39Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Add the review that motivated the schema v2 work\n\nThe change plan the last three commits implement. Worth keeping in the repo\nrather than in a chat log: it records why HMAC had to go, why the signer\nmoved to the proxy, and what was deliberately left unbuilt — which is the\ncontext that makes the P0 commits legible later.","tree":{"sha":"03567b9d09eee561c1eb1376685a61491d6c0f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/03567b9d09eee561c1eb1376685a61491d6c0f26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/ae4df2eb2062cad6952cdbbf7d5a1a26e016142e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/ae4df2eb2062cad6952cdbbf7d5a1a26e016142e","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKGFlNGRmMmViMjA2MmNhZDY5NTJjZGJiZjdkNWExYTI2ZTAxNjE0MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64","sha":"b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64"}],"sha":"ae4df2eb2062cad6952cdbbf7d5a1a26e016142e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/ae4df2eb2062cad6952cdbbf7d5a1a26e016142e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:35:14Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:35:14Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Make the backend a store that cannot forge\n\nThe backend signed receipts with HMAC-SHA256 under a shared secret it also\nheld. Verifying required the key that could forge, so an auditor could not\ncheck a receipt without being handed the ability to fabricate one — and the\noperator could rewrite any record retroactively and have it verify\nperfectly. Receipts were an integrity checksum presented as evidence.\n\n/tools/record now stores instead of signing. It verifies what arrives and\nrejects the rest: unknown key_id 401, bad signature or payloads that do not\nhash to the signed values 422, wrong schema_version or sig_alg 400, replay\n409. The signing key lives with whoever observed the call, and this process\nnever sees it.\n\nChain continuity is deliberately not enforced on write. Rejecting a\nnon-contiguous seq would hand the store authority over the chain — the role\nthis change exists to remove from it — and would also drop receipts a proxy\nreplays from its spool after an outage. A gap is a finding for the verifier.\n\nGenesis and close records live in session_chain, not receipts. In receipts\nthey would land in the ledger, skew both stats endpoints, and count as\nunclaimed receipts in verify-claim, marking every session CONTRADICTED for\nfailing to claim its own genesis.\n\nDeleting a row straight out of SQLite is now caught. Verified live: the\nsurviving receipts still pass signature and content checks individually,\nand the chain reports the gap and a close record that counts two receipts\nwhere one remains.\n\nThe demo path keeps its own key, since mock tools run in this process and\nnothing else can sign for them. It is labelled \"not evidence\" in the key\nregistry, exposed as demo_key on the integrity endpoint, and warned about\nat startup — a receipt signed by the party storing it is exactly what this\ndesign exists to stop being mistaken for proof.\n\nAlso fixed while verifying against a live backend: demo_run sets a verdict\ndirectly, which takes the session out of ''open'', so the inactivity sweep\nnever closed it and auto_verify never ran. Its chain stayed unterminated\nand every demo receipt read as TAMPERED for a missing close record.\n\nPre-v2 rows move to receipts_v1 and are served by nothing.","tree":{"sha":"34de7b6ab24f44a1d083d0f535a16664aded1e1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/34de7b6ab24f44a1d083d0f535a16664aded1e1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKGI2YTY4ZWFhZDhhOGM5NzQ2ODQ0Y2I5MTY4ZTUwYmU1NmZiOWNmNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8","sha":"5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8"}],"sha":"b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/b6a68eaad8a8c9746844cb9168e50be56fb9cf64"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T17:35:28Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T17:35:28Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Add receipts_core: Ed25519 receipt format, hash chaining, published spec\n\nGroundwork for moving signing out of the backend. Nothing imports this yet;\nthe HMAC path is untouched and every existing test still passes.\n\nTwo properties the old format could not have:\n\nEd25519 instead of HMAC-SHA256. HMAC proves only that someone holding the\nshared secret produced the record, and verifying requires the key that\nforges — so an auditor cannot check a receipt without being handed the\nability to fabricate one. With a keypair the private half stays with the\nsigner and the public half goes to anyone who wants to check.\n\nA per-session hash chain. Each receipt carries seq and prev_hash inside\nthe signed region, anchored by a signed genesis record and terminated by a\nsigned close record pinning the final seq and count. Individually signed\nreceipts made deleting a row from SQLite invisible; now it leaves a gap.\nGenesis matters more than it looks: without it, \"the agent called no\ntools\" and \"someone deleted every receipt\" are the same picture.\n\nkey_id and sig_alg sit inside the signed region so a valid signature\ncannot be re-pointed at another key or downgraded.\n\ndocs/RECEIPT_FORMAT.md is the contract, receipts_core is one\nimplementation of it. The published vectors are signed with a throwaway\nkey and, because Ed25519 is deterministic, pin exact signature bytes —\nso an independent verifier in another language has something to check\nitself against, and canonical serialisation cannot drift silently.","tree":{"sha":"56e966098a3425fdcd9eb1f67f2d8b870344c5d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/56e966098a3425fdcd9eb1f67f2d8b870344c5d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKDVlNjk1MmJiMjNiYWRhMmUyOTI2NTVkMzUwNjQzYTA0NjhhNmJhYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320","sha":"0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320"}],"sha":"5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/5e6952bb23bada2e292655d350643a0468a6bac8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T17:25:32Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T17:25:32Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Make the project legally usable: Apache-2.0 and a disclosure policy\n\nCode with no LICENSE is unusable by anyone else — no company can install\nit, no one can contribute, and it cannot be called open source. That was\nblocking every potential adopter of a tool whose whole value is trust.\n\nApache-2.0 rather than MIT: the explicit patent grant is what enterprise\nlegal looks for in a security/compliance tool, and it matches the\nsurrounding ecosystem (SPIFFE, Sigstore, OpenTelemetry).\n\npyproject declared MIT with no LICENSE file to back it. Fixed to the\nPEP 639 SPDX form — the old `license = { text = ... }` table also failed\noutright on setuptools >= 77, so the package did not build.\n\nSECURITY.md states the limitations as plainly as the guarantees: a\ncompromised proxy host, an agent that bypasses the proxy, and a lying\nupstream are all outside what receipts can attest to.","tree":{"sha":"914a4ee8ef0951036c5ea02a1bce6561e580eeb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/914a4ee8ef0951036c5ea02a1bce6561e580eeb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKDAwMTQyNjdlODBiMjcyNmExZDNhOWEzMTdlN2MzNjM0NjQxYzgzMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/c93a523478762d43e930369f820700cc94e7fe34","sha":"c93a523478762d43e930369f820700cc94e7fe34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/c93a523478762d43e930369f820700cc94e7fe34"}],"sha":"0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/0014267e80b2726a1d3a9a317e7c3634641c8320"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten