"email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:11:11Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Redact channel secrets from the PATCH /alerts response\n\nGET /alerts and GET /alerts/{id} mask smtp_user/smtp_pass and webhook URLs,\nbut PATCH returned the stored config verbatim. Toggling a rule''s `enabled`\nflag -- which sends no config at all -- handed back the SMTP password and the\nfull webhook URL for a rule the caller never supplied them for.\n\nPOST stays unredacted on purpose: it only echoes what the caller just sent.","tree":{"sha":"12328f69a9593974deceaaf7e6fbed080711b52b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/12328f69a9593974deceaaf7e6fbed080711b52b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/94c46d3d2f3690e13fbe6b6870f8ed324a9a3241","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/94c46d3d2f3690e13fbe6b6870f8ed324a9a3241","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKDk0YzQ2ZDNkMmYzNjkwZTEzZmJlNmI2ODcwZjhlZDMyNGE5YTMyNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/cff41b59fd9081b7614ca31011331600cd01fe41","sha":"cff41b59fd9081b7614ca31011331600cd01fe41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/cff41b59fd9081b7614ca31011331600cd01fe41"}],"sha":"94c46d3d2f3690e13fbe6b6870f8ed324a9a3241","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/94c46d3d2f3690e13fbe6b6870f8ed324a9a3241"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/cff41b59fd9081b7614ca31011331600cd01fe41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:10:00Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T16:10:28Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Alert UNVERIFIED, not CONTRADICTED, for missing receipts\n\n_verdict_str mapped every non-verified, non-tampered verdict to CONTRADICTED,\nincluding the case where the claimed receipt was never recorded at all\n(signature_valid is None). verifier.derive_verdict already treats that as\nUNVERIFIED, so the session verdict and the alert disagreed, and an alert rule\nwith trigger=''UNVERIFIED'' could never fire -- for the exact scenario it exists\nfor, an agent claiming tool calls it never made.\n\nFixed in the shared helper so /verify, /sessions/{id}/verify-claim and\n/demo/run all pick it up.","tree":{"sha":"0c0e851f4906b6371308db49f7145101b8b7709f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/0c0e851f4906b6371308db49f7145101b8b7709f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/cff41b59fd9081b7614ca31011331600cd01fe41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a