\nDeliveries were already persisted to alert_deliveries but had no read path,\nso a silently failing channel looked identical to no alerts firing. Adds\nGET /alerts/deliveries and a delivery log panel under the Alerts view;\nrows outlive their rule (rule_name is null once the rule is deleted).","tree":{"sha":"4e9464dc8907b34ac04f97eb1ee95e2817e8083a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/4e9464dc8907b34ac04f97eb1ee95e2817e8083a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/8f8d05f815f7105a3f255305e0b53778eaa1bede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/8f8d05f815f7105a3f255305e0b53778eaa1bede","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKDhmOGQwNWY4MTVmNzEwNWEzZjI1NTMwNWUwYjUzNzc4ZWFhMWJlZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/c692a273f83508bf50ac32598ef0ff24e0e2f8af","sha":"c692a273f83508bf50ac32598ef0ff24e0e2f8af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/c692a273f83508bf50ac32598ef0ff24e0e2f8af"}],"sha":"8f8d05f815f7105a3f255305e0b53778eaa1bede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/8f8d05f815f7105a3f255305e0b53778eaa1bede"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/c692a273f83508bf50ac32598ef0ff24e0e2f8af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:47:54Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:47:54Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Add per-receipt integrity check\n\nGET /receipts/{id}/integrity re-runs the HMAC and payload-hash checks on a\nsingle stored row and returns INTACT/TAMPERED. T