71aa9935a9574af3904b40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/148046f22683373fe471aa9935a9574af3904b40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/2047c2568994aa5b4499d083e0a978a0dab09aba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/2047c2568994aa5b4499d083e0a978a0dab09aba","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKDIwNDdjMjU2ODk5NGFhNWI0NDk5ZDA4M2UwYTk3OGEwZGFiMDlhYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/fbcd1aa6f446d9aa2a03d491f12acb3a3f0cf20c","sha":"fbcd1aa6f446d9aa2a03d491f12acb3a3f0cf20c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/fbcd1aa6f446d9aa2a03d491f12acb3a3f0cf20c"}],"sha":"2047c2568994aa5b4499d083e0a978a0dab09aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/2047c2568994aa5b4499d083e0a978a0dab09aba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/fbcd1aa6f446d9aa2a03d491f12acb3a3f0cf20c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:27:18Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T17:27:18Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Fix legacy-receipt regression, add key provisioning and CI, harden alert delivery\n\nRegression fix: verify_receipt_content no longer misclassifies receipts with\nlegacy/NULL tool_input/tool_output as TAMPERED.\n\nAPI keys + CI: add POST /api-keys (mint) and GET /whoami; add a CI workflow\nrunning the full test suite, lint, and build on every push/PR; fix publish.yml\nto run the full suite instead of one file.\n\nAlert reliability: persist every delivery attempt (alert_deliveries table),\ndedup the same event across auto_verify/verify/verify-claim, and retry once\nbefore recording failure.\n\nFrontend: fix the ledger/report silently capping at 50 receipts, add a\nfetch-limit control and truncation indicators, surface remaining silent\nfetch failures (sessions, reconciliation, alerts, session-close, key revoke),\nand warn before revoking your own authenticating key.\n\nBackend/proxy resilience: SQLite connections now use WAL mode + busy_timeout\nand are explicitly closed; the MCP proxy retries a failed receipt POST and a\nfailed upstream connect once, and logs an aggregate drop count at shutdown.\n\nDocs/packaging: document previously-missing env vars, pin dependency upper\nbounds, sync frontend/backend package versions, add CHANGELOG.md.","tree":{"sha":"473675c170eaa97563b795eb5cdf38bd6f0b132d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/473675c170eaa97563b795eb5cdf38bd6f0b132d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/fbcd1aa6f446d9aa2a03d491f12acb3a3f0cf20c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u