ommits/cb70ce8ffa6a89c6e5792d82862901159e7cc10b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:49:13Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:49:13Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Harden receipt integrity, close alert-firing gaps, add key revocation and UX fixes\n\nSecurity/correctness: gate /demo/run behind ENABLE_DEMO_TOOLS, redact alert\nchannel secrets for viewer-role reads, detect raw tool_input/tool_output\ntampering that leaves hash columns untouched, add admin-only API key\nrevocation, fail fast on a misspelled ENVIRONMENT, stop relabeling verdicts\nas PASS/FAIL, and fire alerts even when an agent claims a receipt_id that\nwas never recorded (also fixes the \"lying\" demo mode never creating a\nsession row).\n\nBugs: fix ledger pagination dead-end, surface backend auth/server errors\ninstead of swallowing them, stop using fire-and-forget tasks for tamper\nalerts, and don''t let one malformed upstream entry crash the whole MCP\nproxy.\n\nUX: add a manual close-session action, make alert delivery observable\n(structured logging, status checks, config validation) and reliable,\nadd real API key management to Settings, confirm before destructive\nactions, add keyboard accessibility, and persist UI preferences.\n\nTests/docs/deploy: add coverage for alerts, rate limiting, CORS, and the\nnew verify-claim/tamper-detection paths; fix stale docs; add container\nhealthchecks.","tree":{"sha":"9ba1d022f34f835ed1ce79089e81263b297f49d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/9ba1d022f34f835ed1ce79089e81263b297f49d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/cb70ce8ffa6a89c6e5792d82862901159e7cc10b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2