son without re-running verification\n- demo_agent.py now calls /sessions/{id}/verify-claim (persists verdict) instead of\n  /verify (ephemeral) so Reconciliation shows the real stored verdict on load\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d08740601313fb80f8970b0bb42984f7f45b063c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/d08740601313fb80f8970b0bb42984f7f45b063c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/4d2d56d38835b89ae5daf2d15e41798914758aba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/4d2d56d38835b89ae5daf2d15e41798914758aba","node_id":"C_kwDOTFTf-doAKDRkMmQ1NmQzODgzNWI4OWFlNWRhZjJkMTVlNDE3OTg5MTQ3NThhYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commit/41e15d3b2a8059d01eaa3e8e3ebcb3560a89b158","sha":"41e15d3b2a8059d01eaa3e8e3ebcb3560a89b158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/41e15d3b2a8059d01eaa3e8e3ebcb3560a89b158"}],"sha":"4d2d56d38835b89ae5daf2d15e41798914758aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/4d2d56d38835b89ae5daf2d15e41798914758aba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/41e15d3b2a8059d01eaa3e8e3ebcb3560a89b158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T09:53:54Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T09:53:54Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Show claim vs. ledger diff in Reconciliation for CONTRADICTED receipts\n\nWhen a receipt verdict is CONTRADICTED, ReceiptCard now renders a\nside-by-side diff section between what the agent claimed and what the\nledger recorded:\n\n- tool_name row when the claimed tool differs from the stored tool\n  (e.g. agent claims write_file but db_query was executed)\n- output_hash row when the claimed output hash differs from the stored hash\n- REASON label showing the verifier''s reason code (tool_name_mismatch,\n  output_hash_mismatch, etc.)\n- Card border changes to amber to visually distinguish contradicted cards\n\nAll data comes from the existing VerifyVerdict fields (tool_name,\nclaimed_hash, actual_hash, reason) — no backend changes needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b02436c4e72d28ee81053164534eed574daaf5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/4b02436c4e72d28ee81053164534eed574daaf5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/41e15d3b2a8059d01eaa3e8e3ebcb3560a89b158","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"