api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/commits/1837bb7ecd1f4aa06fa34a322dc43d473da239b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:59:53Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:59:53Z","email":"shreyanshkanojia104@gmail.com","name":"Shreyansh kanojia"},"message":"Fix Reconciliation overwriting full_claim verdicts; update docs\n\nRe-verifying a session built the claim from its own stored receipts, so a\nfull_claim session (e.g. demo_run replit → CONTRADICTED) always collapsed to\nVERIFIED on reconcile. Add a guard: verify-claim returns the on-record verdict\nunless ?force=true, and the UI shows it with an \"ON RECORD\" label / warned\n\"Re-run\" button. Also refresh CLAUDE.md to match current code and add a Live\nLedger screenshot to the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2218cb8db30b0455fcbae18d214cc524ac4c8d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/trees/2218cb8db30b0455fcbae18d214cc524ac4c8d0b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/receipts/git/commits/1837bb7ecd1f4aa06fa34a322dc43d473da239b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208697818?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","id":208697818,"login":"Shreyansh-Kanojiaa","node_id":"U_kgDODHB52g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/S