ps://api.github.com/repos/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/git/commits/738292c5b3ea71d40a6e73e8237630ac803094ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2534483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/weimeilin79","id":2534483,"login":"weimeilin79","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzQ0ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/commit/738292c5b3ea71d40a6e73e8237630ac803094ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTFXONtoAKDczODI5MmM1YjNlYTcxZDQwYTZlNzNlODIzNzYzMGFjODAzMDk0YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/commit/ec503049babaa7f1d9cafd1c89fae49d3c96f0d8","sha":"ec503049babaa7f1d9cafd1c89fae49d3c96f0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/commits/ec503049babaa7f1d9cafd1c89fae49d3c96f0d8"}],"sha":"738292c5b3ea71d40a6e73e8237630ac803094ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/commits/738292c5b3ea71d40a6e73e8237630ac803094ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2534483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/weimeilin79","id":2534483,"login":"weimeilin79","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MzQ0ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/commits/ec503049babaa7f1d9cafd1c89fae49d3c96f0d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T21:56:01Z","email":"weimeilin@gmail.com","name":"weimeilin79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T21:56:01Z","email":"weimeilin@gmail.com","name":"weimeilin79"},"message":"Migrate the fast A2A hops to the prebuilt ADK client\n\nRoot cause of why the stock client never worked engine-to-engine: the A2aAgent\ntemplate hardcodes the PLAIN aiplatform host into the agent card it serves\n(templates/a2a.py:328), overwriting whatever the deployer sets, and the Agent\nGateway authorizes only the .mtls host. Standard clients follow card.url, so\nevery hop was refused with 403. Measured in-engine against three peers.\n\nMigrated to the prebuilt client, verified in cloud:\n  app -> ui_renderer            stock RemoteA2aAgent + a card we build\n  orchestrator -> brand_style   VibeflixRemoteA2aAgent\n  orchestrator -> deal_pricing  VibeflixRemoteA2aAgent\nRe-run path checked too: an incremental re-audit saw the new input\n(''vinyl figures'' -> ''T-shirt''), so no completed-task reuse.\n\nStill on the poll sender, each for a measured reason:\n  app -> orchestrator, contract_finalize   blocking send dies at ~180s with\n    400 FAILED_PRECONDITION (\"Reasoning Engine Execution failed\", Error Details\n    EMPTY) while the callee keeps working normally\n  vendor_clearance -> legal                multi-round clarification loop needs\n    a fresh context per round\n\nVibeflixRemoteA2aAgent gains long_running=True: same class, same constructor,\nsame ctx.run_node - only the pacing changes (non-blocking send + poll), so call\nsites stay uniform whichever transport a hop needs. Both overrides carry the\nmeasurement that forced them.\n\nAlso:\n- contract_finalize now reports WHAT came back when no contract id is found.\n  Audits were finishing \"all passed\" with no contract while legal had in fact\n  executed one (six in the licensing registry), and the error said only \"did not\n  produce a contract id\" - the one thing already obvious. Root cause still open.\n- remove the temporary a2a_probe agent and its deploy entry.\n\nDocs: eng-report/UPSTREAM-FR-a2a-client-gaps.md (4 findings, retractions of six\nearlier claims disproved by testing, and the workaround shape), a migration plan\nwith gates, a README transport section, and the ELI5 rewrite.","tree":{"sha":"e17da8344d7ce0642da7cfbb7a2e51c014e14157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/git/trees/e17da8344d7ce0642da7cfbb7a2e51c014e14157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weimeilin79/vibeflix-audit/git/commits/ec503049babaa7f1d9cafd1c89fae49d3c96f0d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2534483?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weimeilin79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/weime